l:items-start"><div class="user-message-bubble-color corner-superellipse/0.98 relative rounded-[22px] px-4 py-2.5 leading-6 max-w-(--user-chat-width,70%)"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap">Okay, last_breath is now indexed. Also, I've now enabled WebGL, so hopefully that helps you. You have access to figma too, so go wild and get creative with that fact. </div></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex justify-end"><div aria-label="Your message actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto touch:opacity-100 duration-300 group-hover/turn-messages:delay-300 pointer-events-none opacity-0 motion-safe:transition-opacity group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:opacity-100 group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:opacity-100 has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:opacity-100" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy message" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Edit message" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#6d87e1" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><span class="sr-only"><br></span></section><section class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="1acf32d4-f049-47c3-a238-a7e6aa78b3b6" data-testid="conversation-turn-14" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT said:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><span class="group/tool-message"><span class="block first:mt-0 relative text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-primary my-1.5"><div class="group start-0 top-0 me-1.5 overflow-hidden mt-1 text-start"><button class="inline-block" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-1"><span class="text-start">Called tool</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#ba3792" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></div></button></div></span></span><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-tertiary flex items-center gap-0.5 dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary">Thought for 4m 57s<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-xs"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#b140e7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="64820870-6b5b-4741-91a6-d806dc6573b6" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-4-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="68">I dug through the indexed repo. The main structural finding is this:</p>
<h2 data-section-id="hf95w6" data-start="70" data-end="105">1. This is not really a monorepo</h2>
<p data-start="106" data-end="690">It is one root React/Express/Vite application with shared <code data-start="164" data-end="172">client</code>, <code data-start="174" data-end="182">server</code>, and <code data-start="188" data-end="196">shared</code> directories, one root <code data-start="219" data-end="233">package.json</code>, and one root build pipeline. The app then switches between <strong data-start="294" data-end="307">marketing</strong>, <strong data-start="309" data-end="321">internal</strong>, and <strong data-start="327" data-end="337">client</strong> portals at runtime based on hostname or route prefix. You can see that in the single root package/scripts, the Vite config pointing <code data-start="470" data-end="476">root</code> at <code data-start="480" data-end="488">client</code>, and the router that lazy-loads three portal apps <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2kf_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/package.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/package.json" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">package</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2kg_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/vite.config.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/vite.config.ts" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">vite.config</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2kh_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/tsconfig.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/tsconfig.json" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">tsconfig</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2ki_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/App.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/App.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">App</p></a></span></p>
<p data-start="692" data-end="868">That means the repo feels oversized not because it is a clean monorepo with too many packages, but because it is a <strong data-start="807" data-end="867">single codebase carrying three products plus experiments</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="870" data-end="926">That is actually good news. The cleanup path is clearer.</p>
<hr data-start="928" data-end="931">
<h2 data-section-id="150niza" data-start="933" data-end="971">2. What is making it feel oversized</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="7tydj0" data-start="973" data-end="1034">A. The internal portal is carrying too many product ideas</h3>
<p data-start="1035" data-end="1390">The internal portal is broad. It includes project management, CRM/sales, proposals/invoices, outreach, sequencing, blog/content, page builder, SEO assistant, workflow builder, analytics, communications, client invites, admin, monitoring, QA/QC, PDF generation, AI sales, and more <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2kj_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/internal/InternalApp.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/internal/InternalApp.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">InternalApp</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2kk_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/internal/layout/InternalLayout.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/internal/layout/InternalLayout.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">InternalLayout</p></a></span></p>
<p data-start="1392" data-end="1444">That is the biggest reason the repo feels unfocused.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="1pwcd09" data-start="1446" data-end="1515">B. There is also a separate mockup/design sandbox inside the repo</h3>
<p data-start="1516" data-end="1797">You have <code data-start="1525" data-end="1551">artifacts/mockup-sandbox</code> as its own Vite app with its own package and preview server, which is useful, but it is also another whole app inside the repo tree <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2kl_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/artifacts/mockup-sandbox/package.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/artifacts/mockup-sandbox/package.json" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">package</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2km_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/artifacts/mockup-sandbox/vite.config.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/artifacts/mockup-sandbox/vite.config.ts" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">vite.config</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2kn_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/artifacts/mockup-sandbox/src/App.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/artifacts/mockup-sandbox/src/App.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">App</p></a></span></p>
<h3 data-section-id="1ay95jq" data-start="1799" data-end="1850">C. Branding/tokens are split across two systems</h3>
<p data-start="1851" data-end="2180">Your global app theme uses generic HSL tokens in <code data-start="1900" data-end="1922">client/src/index.css</code>, while the marketing portal also introduces its own explicit brand vars in <code data-start="1998" data-end="2013">marketing.css</code> like <code data-start="2019" data-end="2037">--marketing-cyan</code> and <code data-start="2042" data-end="2062">--marketing-orange</code> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2ko_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/index.css" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/index.css" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">index</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2kp_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/index.css" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/index.css" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">index</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2kq_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">marketing</p></a></span></p>
<p data-start="2182" data-end="2236">That split is manageable, but it is a source of drift.</p>
<hr data-start="2238" data-end="2241">
<h2 data-section-id="13crmx" data-start="2243" data-end="2276">3. What the repo should become</h2>
<p data-start="2278" data-end="2316">You said the repo should only include:</p>
<ul data-start="2318" data-end="2385">
<li data-section-id="1ms5ax3" data-start="2318" data-end="2334">
<p data-start="2320" data-end="2334">marketing site</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="7if9az" data-start="2335" data-end="2352">
<p data-start="2337" data-end="2352">internal portal</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="9cxzlx" data-start="2353" data-end="2368">
<p data-start="2355" data-end="2368">client portal</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1xxd9wd" data-start="2369" data-end="2385">
<p data-start="2371" data-end="2385">their backends</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2387" data-end="2515">Given the current structure, I would not force a full workspace/monorepo rewrite first. I would do a <strong data-start="2488" data-end="2514">targeted slimming pass</strong>.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="dje574" data-start="2517" data-end="2549">Keep as first-class surfaces</h3>
<ul data-start="2550" data-end="2676">
<li data-section-id="1f7fhne" data-start="2550" data-end="2584">
<p data-start="2552" data-end="2584"><code data-start="2552" data-end="2584">client/src/portals/marketing/*</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ezn9yf" data-start="2585" data-end="2616">
<p data-start="2587" data-end="2616"><code data-start="2587" data-end="2616">client/src/portals/client/*</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="m5tvjt" data-start="2617" data-end="2650">
<p data-start="2619" data-end="2650"><code data-start="2619" data-end="2650">client/src/portals/internal/*</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="vo1myw" data-start="2651" data-end="2663">
<p data-start="2653" data-end="2663"><code data-start="2653" data-end="2663">server/*</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="o9hag4" data-start="2664" data-end="2676">
<p data-start="2666" data-end="2676"><code data-start="2666" data-end="2676">shared/*</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="1wpa58u" data-start="2678" data-end="2720">Keep, but treat as separate design lab</h3>
<ul data-start="2721" data-end="2751">
<li data-section-id="mr6mow" data-start="2721" data-end="2751">
<p data-start="2723" data-end="2751"><code data-start="2723" data-end="2751">artifacts/mockup-sandbox/*</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="12supqu" data-start="2753" data-end="2821">Review aggressively for extraction, feature-flagging, or archive</h3>
<p data-start="2822" data-end="2881">The internal portal routes are where the likely trim lives:</p>
<ul data-start="2882" data-end="3072">
<li data-section-id="1ru8987" data-start="2882" data-end="2896">
<p data-start="2884" data-end="2896"><code data-start="2884" data-end="2896">crm-search</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1dkkomz" data-start="2897" data-end="2909">
<p data-start="2899" data-end="2909"><code data-start="2899" data-end="2909">outreach</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="7z2xb9" data-start="2910" data-end="2929">
<p data-start="2912" data-end="2929"><code data-start="2912" data-end="2929">email-sequences</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="xvuid7" data-start="2930" data-end="2955">
<p data-start="2932" data-end="2955"><code data-start="2932" data-end="2955">sequence-optimization</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="159q3x0" data-start="2956" data-end="2969">
<p data-start="2958" data-end="2969"><code data-start="2958" data-end="2969">sales-bot</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1kabeo5" data-start="2970" data-end="2982">
<p data-start="2972" data-end="2982"><code data-start="2972" data-end="2982">ai-sales</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="xo0pcn" data-start="2983" data-end="2999">
<p data-start="2985" data-end="2999"><code data-start="2985" data-end="2999">page-builder</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1695dsh" data-start="3000" data-end="3007">
<p data-start="3002" data-end="3007"><code data-start="3002" data-end="3007">seo</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="3p2269" data-start="3008" data-end="3019">
<p data-start="3010" data-end="3019"><code data-start="3010" data-end="3019">content</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1n5e7n8" data-start="3020" data-end="3040">
<p data-start="3022" data-end="3040"><code data-start="3022" data-end="3040">template-builder</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="11vf4zo" data-start="3041" data-end="3055">
<p data-start="3043" data-end="3055"><code data-start="3043" data-end="3055">monitoring</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1xbpnsq" data-start="3056" data-end="3072">
<p data-start="3058" data-end="3072"><code data-start="3058" data-end="3072">icp-settings</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3074" data-end="3350">Those are not necessarily bad. They just read more like <strong data-start="3130" data-end="3197">growth tooling / internal experiments / phase-two admin systems</strong> than core ship-critical surfaces for a v1/v1.5 of your business platform <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2kr_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/internal/InternalApp.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/internal/InternalApp.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">InternalApp</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2ks_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/internal/layout/InternalLayout.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/internal/layout/InternalLayout.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">InternalLayout</p></a></span></p>
<h3 data-section-id="a6hf5y" data-start="3352" data-end="3396">Likely core internal modules to preserve</h3>
<p data-start="3397" data-end="3439">These feel aligned with the real business:</p>
<ul data-start="3440" data-end="3663">
<li data-section-id="1861moc" data-start="3440" data-end="3451">
<p data-start="3442" data-end="3451">dashboard</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1op00o8" data-start="3452" data-end="3490">
<p data-start="3454" data-end="3490">projects / project detail / requests</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1pzevp7" data-start="3491" data-end="3501">
<p data-start="3493" data-end="3501">contacts</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1h47kmv" data-start="3502" data-end="3513">
<p data-start="3504" data-end="3513">proposals</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1vp0j2i" data-start="3514" data-end="3524">
<p data-start="3516" data-end="3524">invoices</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1j4f3ty" data-start="3525" data-end="3531">
<p data-start="3527" data-end="3531">RFIs</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1mwpjs7" data-start="3532" data-end="3546">
<p data-start="3534" data-end="3546">doc approval</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="af01gu" data-start="3547" data-end="3587">
<p data-start="3549" data-end="3587">client communications / client invites</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1vx7j8u" data-start="3588" data-end="3605">
<p data-start="3590" data-end="3605">users / profile</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="17bj7ll" data-start="3606" data-end="3663">
<p data-start="3608" data-end="3663">maybe QA/QC if that is part of live delivery operations</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="pozlso" data-start="3665" data-end="3716">Client portal is already relatively disciplined</h3>
<p data-start="3717" data-end="3893">The client portal is much tighter: auth/register, dashboard, projects, documents, proposals, invoices, messages, reports, RFIs, settings <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2kt_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/client/ClientApp.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/client/ClientApp.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">ClientApp</p></a></span></p>
<p data-start="3895" data-end="3940">That part does <strong data-start="3910" data-end="3917">not</strong> look like the problem.</p>
<hr data-start="3942" data-end="3945">
<h2 data-section-id="1o0nmun" data-start="3947" data-end="3977">4. Biggest homepage finding</h2>
<p data-start="3978" data-end="4131">Your current production <code data-start="4002" data-end="4012">Home.tsx</code> is visually strong, but structurally it is still a <strong data-start="4064" data-end="4092">brand-first landing page</strong>, not yet a <strong data-start="4104" data-end="4130">trust-first proof page</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="4133" data-end="4167">Right now the page is effectively:</p>
<ul data-start="4169" data-end="4214">
<li data-section-id="1j34ayg" data-start="4169" data-end="4175">
<p data-start="4171" data-end="4175">hero</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="160nw7a" data-start="4176" data-end="4186">
<p data-start="4178" data-end="4186">services</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1p41tjk" data-start="4187" data-end="4195">
<p data-start="4189" data-end="4195">values</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="gdio7n" data-start="4196" data-end="4208">
<p data-start="4198" data-end="4208">why choose</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1o4e66" data-start="4209" data-end="4214">
<p data-start="4211" data-end="4214">CTA</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4216" data-end="4299">That is what I see in the current home file <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2ku_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span></p>
<p data-start="4301" data-end="4346">The home page already uses the right message:</p>
<ul data-start="4347" data-end="4539">
<li data-section-id="1t812h1" data-start="4347" data-end="4385">
<p data-start="4349" data-end="4385">“Consulting Engineers &amp; Contractors”</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="15h9xub" data-start="4386" data-end="4434">
<p data-start="4388" data-end="4434">same-day response / no obligations / 40+ years</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="afff00" data-start="4435" data-end="4448">
<p data-start="4437" data-end="4448">SF Bay Area</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ki7m9i" data-start="4449" data-end="4474">
<p data-start="4451" data-end="4474">licensed PE / QSD / QSP</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="7n0i9" data-start="4475" data-end="4539">
<p data-start="4477" data-end="4539">Class A &amp; B contractor <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2kv_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4541" data-end="4906">And that message matches the uploaded one-pager, which is good. The one-pager emphasizes the same core pillars and differentiators: <strong data-start="4673" data-end="4765">Construction Service, Engineering Consulting, Inspections &amp; Testing, Stormwater Planning</strong>, plus <strong data-start="4772" data-end="4789">field-reality</strong>, <strong data-start="4791" data-end="4830">Bay Area jurisdictional familiarity</strong>, and <strong data-start="4836" data-end="4866">compliance-minded delivery</strong> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2l0_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Union</p></button></span></p>
<p data-start="4908" data-end="4951">So the issue is <strong data-start="4924" data-end="4950">not messaging mismatch</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="4953" data-end="4979">The issue is <strong data-start="4966" data-end="4978">sequence</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="4981" data-end="4984">
<h2 data-section-id="6x2sfz" data-start="4986" data-end="5026">5. What should change on the homepage</h2>
<h2 data-section-id="jsilll" data-start="5028" data-end="5076">A. Add the proof rail directly under the hero</h2>
<p data-start="5077" data-end="5110">This is the highest-value change.</p>
<p data-start="5112" data-end="5168">You already have the trust badges in the services intro:</p>
<ul data-start="5169" data-end="5285">
<li data-section-id="afff00" data-start="5169" data-end="5182">
<p data-start="5171" data-end="5182">SF Bay Area</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1twuq6u" data-start="5183" data-end="5208">
<p data-start="5185" data-end="5208">Licensed PE / QSD / QSP</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="23d0y4" data-start="5209" data-end="5233">
<p data-start="5211" data-end="5233">Class A &amp; B Contractor</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="13s83dy" data-start="5234" data-end="5285">
<p data-start="5236" data-end="5285">40+ Years <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2l1_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="5287" data-end="5373">Lift those upward and turn them into a compact proof strip immediately below the hero.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="dycyd6" data-start="5375" data-end="5398">Recommended content</h3>
<p data-start="5399" data-end="5413">Use 5–6 items:</p>
<ul data-start="5414" data-end="5626">
<li data-section-id="mpplfs" data-start="5414" data-end="5445">
<p data-start="5416" data-end="5445">40+ years Bay Area experience</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="14wv3ac" data-start="5446" data-end="5486">
<p data-start="5448" data-end="5486">In-house engineering + field execution</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1twuq6u" data-start="5487" data-end="5512">
<p data-start="5489" data-end="5512">Licensed PE / QSD / QSP</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1octfe4" data-start="5513" data-end="5537">
<p data-start="5515" data-end="5537">Class A &amp; B contractor</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="gsryog" data-start="5538" data-end="5574">
<p data-start="5540" data-end="5574">Public works + commercial delivery</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ulsjwd" data-start="5575" data-end="5626">
<p data-start="5577" data-end="5626">Compliance, inspection, and documentation support</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="13ie8k" data-start="5628" data-end="5646">Why this works</h3>
<p data-start="5647" data-end="5741">For your actual buyers, this answers competence questions faster than another brand paragraph.</p>
<hr data-start="5743" data-end="5746">
<h2 data-section-id="1gwsaet" data-start="5748" data-end="5800">B. Add the condensed project evidence module next</h2>
<p data-start="5801" data-end="5831">Your instinct here is correct.</p>
<p data-start="5833" data-end="5894">The homepage should get a <strong data-start="5859" data-end="5893">compressed project proof block</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="5895" data-end="5963">
<li data-section-id="1r28e2e" data-start="5895" data-end="5928">
<p data-start="5897" data-end="5928">left: rotating project snippets</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="pspry1" data-start="5929" data-end="5963">
<p data-start="5931" data-end="5963">right: condensed interactive map</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="5965" data-end="6042">This should sit <strong data-start="5981" data-end="5991">before</strong> the user has to scroll through too much narrative.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="yaqwky" data-start="6044" data-end="6080">Home version should include only</h3>
<ul data-start="6081" data-end="6151">
<li data-section-id="128ddju" data-start="6081" data-end="6095">
<p data-start="6083" data-end="6095">project name</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1j3e18v" data-start="6096" data-end="6102">
<p data-start="6098" data-end="6102">city</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="18fidwi" data-start="6103" data-end="6115">
<p data-start="6105" data-end="6115">discipline</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1lpej18" data-start="6116" data-end="6124">
<p data-start="6118" data-end="6124">status</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="13f7mr2" data-start="6125" data-end="6151">
<p data-start="6127" data-end="6151">one-line proof statement</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="1acex90" data-start="6153" data-end="6200">Do not put the full project browser on home</h3>
<p data-start="6201" data-end="6227">Save the full version for:</p>
<ul data-start="6228" data-end="6274">
<li data-section-id="1bzzafp" data-start="6228" data-end="6245">
<p data-start="6230" data-end="6245">Project Gallery</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="16yqhhh" data-start="6246" data-end="6253">
<p data-start="6248" data-end="6253">About</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="3mbe8h" data-start="6254" data-end="6274">
<p data-start="6256" data-end="6274">Contact / Estimate</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="6276" data-end="6423">That routing structure already exists in the marketing app, so the information architecture is ready for it <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2l2_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/MarketingApp.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/MarketingApp.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">MarketingApp</p></a></span></p>
<hr data-start="6425" data-end="6428">
<h2 data-section-id="1dl8765" data-start="6430" data-end="6494">C. Put one testimonial lower on the page, not as a lead block</h2>
<p data-start="6495" data-end="6627">The testimonial design in your attachments is good, but for this audience testimonials are <strong data-start="6586" data-end="6606">supporting proof</strong>, not the main proof.</p>
<p data-start="6629" data-end="6698">The strongest testimonial you shared works because it is operational:</p>
<ul data-start="6699" data-end="6768">
<li data-section-id="gejgk9" data-start="6699" data-end="6740">
<p data-start="6701" data-end="6740">parking structure stayed partially open</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="z9sx8u" data-start="6741" data-end="6768">
<p data-start="6743" data-end="6768">zero days of full closure</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="6770" data-end="6818">That is exactly the type of testimonial to keep.</p>
<p data-start="6820" data-end="6867">Use one on home. Put the full slider elsewhere.</p>
<hr data-start="6869" data-end="6872">
<h2 data-section-id="j4ynnj" data-start="6874" data-end="6914">D. Team should be teaser-only on home</h2>
<p data-start="6915" data-end="6984">The full expert grid is useful, but it is too heavy for the homepage.</p>
<p data-start="6986" data-end="7013">Use 3 featured leaders max:</p>
<ul data-start="7014" data-end="7116">
<li data-section-id="1jhdi7x" data-start="7014" data-end="7032">
<p data-start="7016" data-end="7032">engineering lead</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1xe2of2" data-start="7033" data-end="7074">
<p data-start="7035" data-end="7074">field / superintendent / estimator type</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="kf6774" data-start="7075" data-end="7116">
<p data-start="7077" data-end="7116">inspections / geology / compliance type</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="7118" data-end="7175">That is enough to signal real people and real competence.</p>
<hr data-start="7177" data-end="7180">
<h2 data-section-id="bos5v1" data-start="7182" data-end="7238">E. The estimate flow belongs on dedicated pages first</h2>
<p data-start="7239" data-end="7315">The estimator component is good. But as a homepage priority, it ranks below:</p>
<ol data-start="7316" data-end="7380">
<li data-section-id="1syt3zm" data-start="7316" data-end="7330">
<p data-start="7319" data-end="7330">proof strip</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1tiu0za" data-start="7331" data-end="7356">
<p data-start="7334" data-end="7356">project evidence block</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1bjg50e" data-start="7357" data-end="7380">
<p data-start="7360" data-end="7380">relevant work teaser</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="7382" data-end="7406">On home, I would either:</p>
<ul data-start="7407" data-end="7484">
<li data-section-id="rha4ql" data-start="7407" data-end="7451">
<p data-start="7409" data-end="7451">use a teaser card to the estimate flow, or</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1nxwjcl" data-start="7452" data-end="7484">
<p data-start="7454" data-end="7484">use the contact CTA lower down</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="7486" data-end="7542">Full estimator belongs more naturally on contact/intake.</p>
<hr data-start="7544" data-end="7547">
<h2 data-section-id="xnqkey" data-start="7549" data-end="7626">6. The current hero is visually good, but slightly over-invested in motion</h2>
<p data-start="7627" data-end="7664">The current home hero is doing a lot:</p>
<ul data-start="7665" data-end="7880">
<li data-section-id="1n9juuv" data-start="7665" data-end="7683">
<p data-start="7667" data-end="7683">video background</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="utonb5" data-start="7684" data-end="7710">
<p data-start="7686" data-end="7710">animated grid background</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="dtc8sp" data-start="7711" data-end="7733">
<p data-start="7713" data-end="7733">blueprint background</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1bzt9ry" data-start="7734" data-end="7750">
<p data-start="7736" data-end="7750">particle field</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="18odj11" data-start="7751" data-end="7770">
<p data-start="7753" data-end="7770">floating elements</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="cz7r5r" data-start="7771" data-end="7791">
<p data-start="7773" data-end="7791">floating particles</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1i4grc" data-start="7792" data-end="7809">
<p data-start="7794" data-end="7809">scroll progress</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1hlvsw5" data-start="7810" data-end="7880">
<p data-start="7812" data-end="7880">reverse video playback logic <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2l3_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="7882" data-end="8017">It is polished, but for your audience the page could gain more trust by reallocating some of that “wow budget” into immediate evidence.</p>
<p data-start="8019" data-end="8120">I would not gut the hero. I would just stop adding more visual complexity there and move energy into:</p>
<ul data-start="8121" data-end="8187">
<li data-section-id="duqukg" data-start="8121" data-end="8134">
<p data-start="8123" data-end="8134">proof strip</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="l2i8f6" data-start="8135" data-end="8162">
<p data-start="8137" data-end="8162">project snippet/map block</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ips8x5" data-start="8163" data-end="8187">
<p data-start="8165" data-end="8187">relevant work evidence</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="8189" data-end="8192">
<h2 data-section-id="o3xu1o" data-start="8194" data-end="8252">7. You already have a strong mockup lab inside the repo</h2>
<p data-start="8253" data-end="8404">This is important: your attachments are not floating in a vacuum. The repo already contains a sandbox full of homepage experiments and refined mockups.</p>
<p data-start="8406" data-end="8499">I found multiple variants under <code data-start="8438" data-end="8487">artifacts/mockup-sandbox/src/components/mockups</code>, including:</p>
<ul data-start="8500" data-end="8820">
<li data-section-id="14kyuw7" data-start="8500" data-end="8527">
<p data-start="8502" data-end="8527">homepage refined variants</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ru5jh0" data-start="8528" data-end="8557">
<p data-start="8530" data-end="8557">homepage usability variants</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1s192t3" data-start="8558" data-end="8604">
<p data-start="8560" data-end="8604">more technical / blueprint-driven directions</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="8ydyqs" data-start="8605" data-end="8628">
<p data-start="8607" data-end="8628">flow/process sections</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1a4wpra" data-start="8629" data-end="8820">
<p data-start="8631" data-end="8820">stronger trust badge patterns <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2l4_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/artifacts/mockup-sandbox/src/components/mockups/homepage-refined/TightenedHierarchy.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/artifacts/mockup-sandbox/src/components/mockups/homepage-refined/TightenedHierarchy.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">TightenedHierarchy</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2l5_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/artifacts/mockup-sandbox/src/components/mockups/homepage-refined-v2/RestructuredAlt.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/artifacts/mockup-sandbox/src/components/mockups/homepage-refined-v2/RestructuredAlt.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">RestructuredAlt</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2l6_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/artifacts/mockup-sandbox/src/components/mockups/homepage-usability/HierarchyFirst.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/artifacts/mockup-sandbox/src/components/mockups/homepage-usability/HierarchyFirst.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">HierarchyFirst</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2l7_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/artifacts/mockup-sandbox/src/components/mockups/homepage-refined/BlueprintTechnical.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/artifacts/mockup-sandbox/src/components/mockups/homepage-refined/BlueprintTechnical.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">BlueprintTechnical</p></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="8822" data-end="8903">That means the smart move is <strong data-start="8851" data-end="8858">not</strong> to invent the new home modules from scratch.</p>
<p data-start="8905" data-end="8923">The smart move is:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="1gimgho" data-start="8925" data-end="8965">Promote from sandbox into production</h3>
<p data-start="8966" data-end="9068">Use the sandbox as the design lab and pull only the winning parts into <code data-start="9037" data-end="9067">client/src/portals/marketing</code>.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="cbldkr" data-start="9070" data-end="9097">What is worth promoting</h3>
<ul data-start="9098" data-end="9276">
<li data-section-id="1b0583e" data-start="9098" data-end="9131">
<p data-start="9100" data-end="9131">tighter hero hierarchy variants</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1011sip" data-start="9132" data-end="9162">
<p data-start="9134" data-end="9162">trust badge/proof band ideas</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ucwut2" data-start="9163" data-end="9203">
<p data-start="9165" data-end="9203">process strip / “How it works” pattern</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1svso2l" data-start="9204" data-end="9232">
<p data-start="9206" data-end="9232">structured CTA refinements</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="k191rs" data-start="9233" data-end="9276">
<p data-start="9235" data-end="9276">some of the more technical framing motifs</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="10yfm1w" data-start="9278" data-end="9310">What not to promote directly</h3>
<p data-start="9311" data-end="9479">Some sandbox concepts skew a little too “startup SaaS control room” or too futuristic for your buyer. Those are useful inspiration, but not ideal for the live homepage.</p>
<p data-start="9481" data-end="9510">For this brand, I would keep:</p>
<ul data-start="9511" data-end="9581">
<li data-section-id="19llnba" data-start="9511" data-end="9524">
<p data-start="9513" data-end="9524">disciplined</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="slv8qj" data-start="9525" data-end="9536">
<p data-start="9527" data-end="9536">technical</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="187phei" data-start="9537" data-end="9547">
<p data-start="9539" data-end="9547">credible</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ha7xn0" data-start="9548" data-end="9569">
<p data-start="9550" data-end="9569">regionally grounded</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="12vght6" data-start="9570" data-end="9581">
<p data-start="9572" data-end="9581">low-drama</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="9583" data-end="9586">
<h2 data-section-id="1f6g2fx" data-start="9588" data-end="9629">8. Brand/palette read from actual code</h2>
<p data-start="9630" data-end="9704">The current code confirms the visual system you showed in the screenshots.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="6djz79" data-start="9706" data-end="9735">Marketing palette in code</h3>
<p data-start="9736" data-end="9770"><code data-start="9736" data-end="9751">marketing.css</code> currently defines:</p>
<ul data-start="9771" data-end="9885">
<li data-section-id="znchwp" data-start="9771" data-end="9791">
<p data-start="9773" data-end="9791">primary gray/slate</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="pbnvhm" data-start="9792" data-end="9810">
<p data-start="9794" data-end="9810">dark navy accent</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="93cd9d" data-start="9811" data-end="9829">
<p data-start="9813" data-end="9829">white background</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1j3ee65" data-start="9830" data-end="9836">
<p data-start="9832" data-end="9836">cyan</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="56bh7p" data-start="9837" data-end="9885">
<p data-start="9839" data-end="9885">orange <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2l8_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">marketing</p></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="1xb2qj7" data-start="9887" data-end="9910">Global token system</h3>
<p data-start="9911" data-end="10178">The app-wide token system is more generic blue-led HSL in <code data-start="9969" data-end="9980">index.css</code> and Tailwind config, with a strong blue primary and supporting slate neutrals <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2l9_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/index.css" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/index.css" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">index</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2la_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/index.css" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/index.css" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">index</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2lb_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/tailwind.config.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/tailwind.config.ts" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">tailwind.config</p></a></span></p>
<h3 data-section-id="vy2chn" data-start="10180" data-end="10201">My recommendation</h3>
<p data-start="10202" data-end="10241">Formalize this into three brand layers:</p>
<ul data-start="10243" data-end="10453">
<li data-section-id="1uqi6z0" data-start="10243" data-end="10306">
<p data-start="10245" data-end="10306"><strong data-start="10245" data-end="10266">foundation tokens</strong>: text, border, surface, spacing, radius</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="b1dtyk" data-start="10307" data-end="10379">
<p data-start="10309" data-end="10379"><strong data-start="10309" data-end="10335">marketing brand tokens</strong>: navy, cyan, orange, teal, light background</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="14v3jcw" data-start="10380" data-end="10453">
<p data-start="10382" data-end="10453"><strong data-start="10382" data-end="10399">status tokens</strong>: active / completed / ongoing / warning / destructive</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="10455" data-end="10488">That will make it much easier to:</p>
<ul data-start="10489" data-end="10641">
<li data-section-id="1yf48ik" data-start="10489" data-end="10504">
<p data-start="10491" data-end="10504">theme the map</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="u6uetk" data-start="10505" data-end="10529">
<p data-start="10507" data-end="10529">style project statuses</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="i7r5zp" data-start="10530" data-end="10576">
<p data-start="10532" data-end="10576">keep internal/client portals more restrained</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1mqhqii" data-start="10577" data-end="10641">
<p data-start="10579" data-end="10641">let marketing stay brand-forward without forking styles ad hoc</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="10643" data-end="10646">
<h2 data-section-id="1cye3j6" data-start="10648" data-end="10678">9. My recommended trim plan</h2>
<h2 data-section-id="1vwygn7" data-start="10680" data-end="10712">Phase 1: Ship-focused cleanup</h2>
<p data-start="10713" data-end="10727">Do this first.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="hta4t7" data-start="10729" data-end="10752">Keep in active code</h3>
<ul data-start="10753" data-end="10844">
<li data-section-id="1s79yfh" data-start="10753" data-end="10768">
<p data-start="10755" data-end="10768">marketing app</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="9cxzlx" data-start="10769" data-end="10784">
<p data-start="10771" data-end="10784">client portal</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="nnrs30" data-start="10785" data-end="10811">
<p data-start="10787" data-end="10811">internal portal core ops</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="19b2ekr" data-start="10812" data-end="10827">
<p data-start="10814" data-end="10827">server/shared</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ef8e16" data-start="10828" data-end="10844">
<p data-start="10830" data-end="10844">mockup sandbox</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="1x96i49" data-start="10846" data-end="10890"><span role="text">Move to <code data-start="10858" data-end="10873">experimental/</code> or feature flags</span></h3>
<p data-start="10891" data-end="10938">Anything not needed for the next launch window:</p>
<ul data-start="10939" data-end="11093">
<li data-section-id="7mrcso" data-start="10939" data-end="10949">
<p data-start="10941" data-end="10949">AI sales</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="4lc14p" data-start="10950" data-end="10961">
<p data-start="10952" data-end="10961">sales bot</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="14et9xy" data-start="10962" data-end="10985">
<p data-start="10964" data-end="10985">sequence optimization</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1159ch0" data-start="10986" data-end="11007">
<p data-start="10988" data-end="11007">outreach automation</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1191951" data-start="11008" data-end="11023">
<p data-start="11010" data-end="11023">SEO assistant</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="nq7jq2" data-start="11024" data-end="11038">
<p data-start="11026" data-end="11038">page builder</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="9c97tl" data-start="11039" data-end="11057">
<p data-start="11041" data-end="11057">template builder</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="cjuvnj" data-start="11058" data-end="11078">
<p data-start="11060" data-end="11078">website monitoring</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1s7vdsn" data-start="11079" data-end="11093">
<p data-start="11081" data-end="11093">ICP settings</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="11095" data-end="11163">This preserves work without letting it dominate the shipped product.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1by87mm" data-start="11165" data-end="11203">Phase 2: Naming + structure cleanup</h2>
<p data-start="11204" data-end="11267">Rename the repo mental model from “monorepo” to something like:</p>
<ul data-start="11268" data-end="11313">
<li data-section-id="1g7in7b" data-start="11268" data-end="11280">
<p data-start="11270" data-end="11280"><code data-start="11270" data-end="11280">platform</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="106g33" data-start="11281" data-end="11297">
<p data-start="11283" data-end="11297"><code data-start="11283" data-end="11297">portal-suite</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="dhxmy7" data-start="11298" data-end="11313">
<p data-start="11300" data-end="11313"><code data-start="11300" data-end="11313">pe-platform</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="11315" data-end="11455">Even the root package name still says <code data-start="11353" data-end="11367">rest-express</code>, which undersells what the repo actually is now <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2lc_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/package.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/package.json" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">package</p></a></span></p>
<h2 data-section-id="plylu2" data-start="11457" data-end="11518">Phase 3: Extract real shared packages only if still needed</h2>
<p data-start="11519" data-end="11620">After the trim, then decide whether to split shared UI, forms, auth, maps, etc.<br>
Do not do this first.</p>
<hr data-start="11622" data-end="11625">
<h2 data-section-id="1iljzlx" data-start="11627" data-end="11664">10. What I would do next, in order</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="1qn3ddx" data-start="11666" data-end="11680">Priority 1</h3>
<p data-start="11681" data-end="11708">Refactor homepage order to:</p>
<ul data-start="11710" data-end="11856">
<li data-section-id="1j34ayg" data-start="11710" data-end="11716">
<p data-start="11712" data-end="11716">hero</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="duqukg" data-start="11717" data-end="11730">
<p data-start="11719" data-end="11730">proof strip</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1r8m9h0" data-start="11731" data-end="11772">
<p data-start="11733" data-end="11772">condensed project evidence map/snippets</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1esmrfu" data-start="11773" data-end="11792">
<p data-start="11775" data-end="11792">services snapshot</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="nyycr3" data-start="11793" data-end="11809">
<p data-start="11795" data-end="11809">how we deliver</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="wivvhq" data-start="11810" data-end="11832">
<p data-start="11812" data-end="11832">relevant work teaser</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="8oddh7" data-start="11833" data-end="11850">
<p data-start="11835" data-end="11850">one testimonial</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1o4e66" data-start="11851" data-end="11856">
<p data-start="11853" data-end="11856">CTA</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="1qn3ddy" data-start="11858" data-end="11872">Priority 2</h3>
<p data-start="11873" data-end="11945">Promote the best homepage modules from <code data-start="11912" data-end="11928">mockup-sandbox</code> into production.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="1qn3ddz" data-start="11947" data-end="11961">Priority 3</h3>
<p data-start="11962" data-end="11996">Audit internal portal routes into:</p>
<ul data-start="11997" data-end="12042">
<li data-section-id="1xaq09r" data-start="11997" data-end="12007">
<p data-start="11999" data-end="12007">core ops</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ppb8g9" data-start="12008" data-end="12027">
<p data-start="12010" data-end="12027">growth/automation</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="163ziv8" data-start="12028" data-end="12042">
<p data-start="12030" data-end="12042">experimental</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="1qn3dds" data-start="12044" data-end="12058">Priority 4</h3>
<p data-start="12059" data-end="12132">Unify brand tokens so marketing and core app are not partially diverging.</p>
<hr data-start="12134" data-end="12137">
<h2 data-section-id="aawbs8" data-start="12139" data-end="12165">11. My blunt assessment</h2>
<p data-start="12166" data-end="12195">You are closer than it feels.</p>
<p data-start="12197" data-end="12292">The marketing site is not far off. The repo is not fundamentally broken. The main problems are:</p>
<ul data-start="12294" data-end="12492">
<li data-section-id="slwaa2" data-start="12294" data-end="12351">
<p data-start="12296" data-end="12351"><strong data-start="12296" data-end="12351">too many internal product ideas living at top level</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1dmvojz" data-start="12352" data-end="12391">
<p data-start="12354" data-end="12391"><strong data-start="12354" data-end="12391">homepage proof appearing too late</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="6aotup" data-start="12392" data-end="12446">
<p data-start="12394" data-end="12446"><strong data-start="12394" data-end="12446">sandbox and production not yet cleanly separated</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1rki5g3" data-start="12447" data-end="12492">
<p data-start="12449" data-end="12492"><strong data-start="12449" data-end="12492">brand token system not fully normalized</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="12494" data-end="12560">The strongest move is not a redesign. It is a <strong data-start="12540" data-end="12559">discipline pass</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="12562" data-end="12621">If you want, the next pass I do should be one of these two:</p>
<ol data-start="12622" data-end="12853" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">
<li data-section-id="1tk52rj" data-start="12622" data-end="12728">
<p data-start="12625" data-end="12728">a <strong data-start="12627" data-end="12656">surgical repo trim matrix</strong> listing exactly what to keep / extract / archive by route or folder, or</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="185v7l5" data-start="12729" data-end="12853" data-is-last-node="">
<p data-start="12732" data-end="12853" data-is-last-node="">a <strong data-start="12734" data-end="12771">homepage implementation blueprint</strong> mapping each new section to existing production files and likely sandbox sources.</p>
</li>
</ol></div></div></div></div><div class="relative h-[60px] select-none"><div class="absolute h-[60px]" style="opacity: 1;"><button class="not-prose group/footnote border-token-border-default bg-token-main-surface-primary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 mt-3 mb-2 flex w-fit items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border py-2 ps-3 pe-2.5"><div class="flex flex-row-reverse gap-1"><div class="border-token-main-surface-primary bg-token-main-surface-primary flex items-center overflow-hidden group-hover/footnote:border-token-main-surface-secondary relative" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="icon-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></div></div></div><div class="text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-xs font-semibold">Sources</div></button></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-ce