inhg</div></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex justify-end"><div aria-label="Your message actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto touch:opacity-100 duration-300 group-hover/turn-messages:delay-300 pointer-events-none opacity-0 motion-safe:transition-opacity group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:opacity-100 group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:opacity-100 has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:opacity-100" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy message" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Edit message" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#6d87e1" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><span class="sr-only"><br></span></section><section class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="a21b6c4c-b9a7-4da6-bb05-3657d3e03038" data-testid="conversation-turn-18" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT said:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="6e3efc4d-3cd3-49b5-a8f8-cb83af6b8945" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-4-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="203" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">I’m validating the five uploaded skill archives now and checking whether each one is a proper single-skill bundle or just source material. Then I’ll tell you which are usable as-is and which need repair.</p></div></div></div><div class="my-2 flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1"><button type="button" aria-disabled="false" class="text-token-text-tertiary inline-flex w-full items-start text-start text-base cursor-pointer hover:underline"><span class="line-clamp-1 truncate">Used skill-creator skill.</span></button></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="4dc8698c-cb74-40d8-87bc-1af56f26bdc9" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-4-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="348" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">All five archives are valid single-skill bundles. The only remaining limitation is platform-side: I can validate and inspect them here, but I cannot silently add them to your account’s skill library from inside this chat. I’m pulling the entrypoints now so I can tell you exactly what each one is for and whether any overlap should be consolidated.</p></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-tertiary flex items-center gap-0.5 dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary">Thought for 2m 31s<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-xs"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#b140e7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="75ccd4c8-8e06-48cc-b3f6-abe8b961e341" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-4-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="13">I kept going.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="6p0odv" data-start="15" data-end="31">Skills status</h2>
<p data-start="33" data-end="243">All five uploaded archives are structurally valid single-skill bundles. I unpacked each one and ran the <code data-start="137" data-end="156">quick_validate.py</code> validator from the skill-creator toolkit against the skill directory. All five passed.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="x3lray" data-start="245" data-end="262">What they are</h3>
<ul data-start="263" data-end="850">
<li data-section-id="a9gcb6" data-start="263" data-end="416">
<p data-start="265" data-end="416"><strong data-start="265" data-end="289">figma-internal-scout</strong> — inspect Figma files/nodes and extract components, variables, layouts, and code-connect mappings into a structured inventory.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="12msfym" data-start="417" data-end="531">
<p data-start="419" data-end="531"><strong data-start="419" data-end="444">figma-community-miner</strong> — shortlist Figma Community kits/patterns and map them into an internal design system.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="su4f5h" data-start="532" data-end="641">
<p data-start="534" data-end="641"><strong data-start="534" data-end="560">figma-to-code-contract</strong> — turn Figma nodes into code-ready component contracts and implementation plans.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="14wlcoz" data-start="642" data-end="756">
<p data-start="644" data-end="756"><strong data-start="644" data-end="670">figma-knowledge-weaver</strong> — maintain a persistent design knowledge base across repeated design/code iterations.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1qcee65" data-start="757" data-end="850">
<p data-start="759" data-end="850"><strong data-start="759" data-end="783">sequential-workbench</strong> — structured project study + planning + durable knowledge weaving.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="1rbrask" data-start="852" data-end="869">My assessment</h3>
<p data-start="870" data-end="916">This is a coherent stack. The only overlap is:</p>
<ul data-start="918" data-end="1127">
<li data-section-id="1ksl5hb" data-start="918" data-end="1020">
<p data-start="920" data-end="1020"><code data-start="920" data-end="944">figma-knowledge-weaver</code> and <code data-start="949" data-end="971">sequential-workbench</code> both want to maintain durable project knowledge.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1qpg6vf" data-start="1021" data-end="1127">
<p data-start="1023" data-end="1127"><code data-start="1023" data-end="1045">figma-internal-scout</code> and <code data-start="1050" data-end="1074">figma-to-code-contract</code> should stay separate; they solve different problems.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="1o709do" data-start="1129" data-end="1157">Practical recommendation</h3>
<p data-start="1158" data-end="1212">Keep all five, but operationally treat them like this:</p>
<ul data-start="1214" data-end="1438">
<li data-section-id="1mue78d" data-start="1214" data-end="1235">
<p data-start="1216" data-end="1235"><strong data-start="1216" data-end="1225">Scout</strong> = inspect</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ig8wg8" data-start="1236" data-end="1262">
<p data-start="1238" data-end="1262"><strong data-start="1238" data-end="1250">Contract</strong> = implement</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ysn0l9" data-start="1263" data-end="1302">
<p data-start="1265" data-end="1302"><strong data-start="1265" data-end="1275">Weaver</strong> = persist design knowledge</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ssvem9" data-start="1303" data-end="1362">
<p data-start="1305" data-end="1362"><strong data-start="1305" data-end="1318">Workbench</strong> = run the broader project/program reasoning</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1lqiif2" data-start="1363" data-end="1438">
<p data-start="1365" data-end="1438"><strong data-start="1365" data-end="1384">Community Miner</strong> = optional, but only when you need outside references</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1440" data-end="1740">One limitation: I can validate and inspect these skills here, but I cannot silently add them into your account’s <code data-start="1553" data-end="1562">/skills</code> library from inside this chat session. They need to be uploaded through the Skills UI. The good news is that they are already valid bundles, so there is nothing to repair first.</p>
<hr data-start="1742" data-end="1745">
<h1 data-section-id="19znajr" data-start="1747" data-end="1774">Back to the repo and site</h1>
<p data-start="1776" data-end="1849">Now that the repo is indexed, the important structural conclusion stands:</p>
<h2 data-section-id="10igeaa" data-start="1851" data-end="1912">1. The codebase is one application carrying three products</h2>
<p data-start="1913" data-end="2426">It is not a true workspace-style monorepo. The root app lazy-loads <code data-start="1980" data-end="1993">InternalApp</code>, <code data-start="1995" data-end="2006">ClientApp</code>, and <code data-start="2012" data-end="2026">MarketingApp</code>, and switches between them based on hostname or route prefix <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2m0_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/App.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/App.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">App</p></a></span>. Vite is also configured with a single <code data-start="2165" data-end="2173">client</code> root and a single <code data-start="2192" data-end="2205">dist/public</code> build output, which confirms the single-app shape <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2m1_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/vite.config.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/vite.config.ts" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">vite.config</p></a></span>. The root package is still one package with one build/dev pipeline, not multiple app packages <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2m2_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/package.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/package.json" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">package</p></a></span>.</p>
<p data-start="2428" data-end="2589">That matters because the right cleanup is <strong data-start="2470" data-end="2477">not</strong> “convert to a formal monorepo first.”<br data-start="2515" data-end="2518">
The right cleanup is <strong data-start="2539" data-end="2588">trim and isolate scope inside the current app</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="2591" data-end="2594">
<h2 data-section-id="xespfq" data-start="2596" data-end="2628">2. What to keep, what to park</h2>
<h2 data-section-id="1l19dq7" data-start="2630" data-end="2668">Keep as active first-class surfaces</h2>
<p data-start="2669" data-end="2715">These are aligned to your stated launch scope:</p>
<ul data-start="2717" data-end="2796">
<li data-section-id="gfp4uw" data-start="2717" data-end="2735">
<p data-start="2719" data-end="2735">marketing portal</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="9cxzlx" data-start="2736" data-end="2751">
<p data-start="2738" data-end="2751">client portal</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="nnrs30" data-start="2752" data-end="2778">
<p data-start="2754" data-end="2778">internal portal core ops</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1m0vje5" data-start="2779" data-end="2787">
<p data-start="2781" data-end="2787">server</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ls7f7l" data-start="2788" data-end="2796">
<p data-start="2790" data-end="2796">shared</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2798" data-end="2990">The client portal already looks fairly disciplined: auth/register, dashboard, projects, documents, proposals, invoices, messages, reports, RFIs, settings <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2m3_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/client/ClientApp.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/client/ClientApp.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">ClientApp</p></a></span>.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="4u5agz" data-start="2992" data-end="3038">Park, feature-flag, or move to experimental</h2>
<p data-start="3039" data-end="3454">The internal portal is the part creating most of the “oversized and disorganized” feeling. It includes core ops plus a large amount of growth/automation/admin tooling such as CRM search, outreach, email sequences, sales bot control, page builder, SEO assistant, content manager, ICP settings, website monitoring, template builder, AI sales assistant, and sequence optimization <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2m4_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/internal/InternalApp.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/internal/InternalApp.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">InternalApp</p></a></span>.</p>
<p data-start="3456" data-end="3594">For your current launch objective, I would classify these as <strong data-start="3517" data-end="3546">phase-two or experimental</strong> unless they are already operationally critical:</p>
<ul data-start="3596" data-end="3812">
<li data-section-id="fotd16" data-start="3596" data-end="3608">
<p data-start="3598" data-end="3608">CRM search</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1gf2gcq" data-start="3609" data-end="3625">
<p data-start="3611" data-end="3625">outreach queue</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="h3eyi0" data-start="3626" data-end="3643">
<p data-start="3628" data-end="3643">email sequences</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="14et9xy" data-start="3644" data-end="3667">
<p data-start="3646" data-end="3667">sequence optimization</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1f67ev2" data-start="3668" data-end="3687">
<p data-start="3670" data-end="3687">sales bot control</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="58qja4" data-start="3688" data-end="3708">
<p data-start="3690" data-end="3708">AI sales assistant</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="nq7jq2" data-start="3709" data-end="3723">
<p data-start="3711" data-end="3723">page builder</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1191951" data-start="3724" data-end="3739">
<p data-start="3726" data-end="3739">SEO assistant</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="98ix8y" data-start="3740" data-end="3757">
<p data-start="3742" data-end="3757">content manager</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="cjuvnj" data-start="3758" data-end="3778">
<p data-start="3760" data-end="3778">website monitoring</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1s7vdsn" data-start="3779" data-end="3793">
<p data-start="3781" data-end="3793">ICP settings</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="9c97tl" data-start="3794" data-end="3812">
<p data-start="3796" data-end="3812">template builder</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="vecjae" data-start="3814" data-end="3849">Internal portal core to preserve</h2>
<p data-start="3850" data-end="3896">These look much closer to live business value:</p>
<ul data-start="3898" data-end="4149">
<li data-section-id="1861moc" data-start="3898" data-end="3909">
<p data-start="3900" data-end="3909">dashboard</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="179rziz" data-start="3910" data-end="3964">
<p data-start="3912" data-end="3964">project manager / project detail / project dashboard</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1pzevp7" data-start="3965" data-end="3975">
<p data-start="3967" data-end="3975">contacts</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1h47kmv" data-start="3976" data-end="3987">
<p data-start="3978" data-end="3987">proposals</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1vp0j2i" data-start="3988" data-end="3998">
<p data-start="3990" data-end="3998">invoices</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1j4f3ty" data-start="3999" data-end="4005">
<p data-start="4001" data-end="4005">RFIs</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1mwpjs7" data-start="4006" data-end="4020">
<p data-start="4008" data-end="4020">doc approval</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="12z57he" data-start="4021" data-end="4044">
<p data-start="4023" data-end="4044">client communications</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="oy63zf" data-start="4045" data-end="4061">
<p data-start="4047" data-end="4061">client invites</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1qjlzf2" data-start="4062" data-end="4089">
<p data-start="4064" data-end="4089">user management / profile</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="8d7e79" data-start="4090" data-end="4108">
<p data-start="4092" data-end="4108">form submissions</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ujs2z2" data-start="4109" data-end="4149">
<p data-start="4111" data-end="4149">QA/QC, if genuinely used in operations</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4151" data-end="4198">That gives you a much tighter product boundary.</p>
<hr data-start="4200" data-end="4203">
<h2 data-section-id="x0c0gv" data-start="4205" data-end="4264">3. The homepage issue is sequencing, not visual identity</h2>
<p data-start="4266" data-end="4408">Your current <code data-start="4279" data-end="4289">Home.tsx</code> is visually strong, but it still behaves like a <strong data-start="4338" data-end="4366">brand-first landing page</strong> rather than a <strong data-start="4381" data-end="4407">trust-first proof page</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="4410" data-end="4453">The file shows a high-investment hero with:</p>
<ul data-start="4454" data-end="4645">
<li data-section-id="1n9juuv" data-start="4454" data-end="4472">
<p data-start="4456" data-end="4472">video background</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="5xhv5z" data-start="4473" data-end="4500">
<p data-start="4475" data-end="4500">blueprint/grid treatments</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1bzt9ry" data-start="4501" data-end="4517">
<p data-start="4503" data-end="4517">particle field</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="18odj11" data-start="4518" data-end="4537">
<p data-start="4520" data-end="4537">floating elements</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1i4grc" data-start="4538" data-end="4555">
<p data-start="4540" data-end="4555">scroll progress</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1c7crjf" data-start="4556" data-end="4645">
<p data-start="4558" data-end="4645">animated transitions and reverse-play video logic <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2m5_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4647" data-end="4691">The page already carries the right messages:</p>
<ul data-start="4692" data-end="4884">
<li data-section-id="1t812h1" data-start="4692" data-end="4730">
<p data-start="4694" data-end="4730">“Consulting Engineers &amp; Contractors”</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="168z29s" data-start="4731" data-end="4750">
<p data-start="4733" data-end="4750">same-day response</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="11aj0p3" data-start="4751" data-end="4781">
<p data-start="4753" data-end="4781">40+ years Bay Area expertise</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="afff00" data-start="4782" data-end="4795">
<p data-start="4784" data-end="4795">SF Bay Area</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ki7m9i" data-start="4796" data-end="4821">
<p data-start="4798" data-end="4821">licensed PE / QSD / QSP</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ma74dt" data-start="4822" data-end="4884">
<p data-start="4824" data-end="4884">Class A &amp; B contractor <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2m6_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4886" data-end="5145">That matches the one-pager positioning around construction service, engineering consulting, inspections/testing, stormwater planning, plus field-reality, Bay Area jurisdictional familiarity, and compliance-minded delivery <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2m7_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Union</p></button></span></p>
<p data-start="5147" data-end="5183">So the diagnosis is straightforward:</p>
<p data-start="5185" data-end="5271"><strong data-start="5185" data-end="5271">The messaging is largely correct.<br data-start="5220" data-end="5223">
The order is not yet optimized for your buyer.</strong></p>
<hr data-start="5273" data-end="5276">
<h2 data-section-id="v08is2" data-start="5278" data-end="5324">4. Exact homepage restructuring I recommend</h2>
<h2 data-section-id="1our91z" data-start="5326" data-end="5338">New order</h2>
<ol data-start="5339" data-end="5506">
<li data-section-id="dvfaqy" data-start="5339" data-end="5348">
<p data-start="5342" data-end="5348">Hero</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1thpv6z" data-start="5349" data-end="5364">
<p data-start="5352" data-end="5364">Proof rail</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="g11e3l" data-start="5365" data-end="5399">
<p data-start="5368" data-end="5399">Condensed project proof + map</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="gwdsgt" data-start="5400" data-end="5422">
<p data-start="5403" data-end="5422">Services snapshot</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="6oof1" data-start="5423" data-end="5452">
<p data-start="5426" data-end="5452">Delivery / “why Pacific”</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="mwkrrs" data-start="5453" data-end="5478">
<p data-start="5456" data-end="5478">Featured work teaser</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="16hs9f3" data-start="5479" data-end="5499">
<p data-start="5482" data-end="5499">One testimonial</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1v7165h" data-start="5500" data-end="5506">
<p data-start="5503" data-end="5506">CTA</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h2 data-section-id="1hryv0j" data-start="5508" data-end="5514">Why</h2>
<p data-start="5515" data-end="5720">Right now, your trust badges appear in the services section instead of immediately under the hero <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2m8_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span>. That means one of your best credibility assets is arriving too late.</p>
<p data-start="5722" data-end="5821">For GCs, supers, architects, engineers, and construction professionals, the homepage should answer:</p>
<ul data-start="5823" data-end="5993">
<li data-section-id="1my0x58" data-start="5823" data-end="5843">
<p data-start="5825" data-end="5843">Are you qualified?</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ubc2zh" data-start="5844" data-end="5879">
<p data-start="5846" data-end="5879">Are you local and field-literate?</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="rjnjy7" data-start="5880" data-end="5923">
<p data-start="5882" data-end="5923">What kind of work have you actually done?</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="12iwp48" data-start="5924" data-end="5951">
<p data-start="5926" data-end="5951">Will you reduce friction?</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="17onrc0" data-start="5952" data-end="5993">
<p data-start="5954" data-end="5993">Can I get someone on the phone quickly?</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="5995" data-end="6066">Your current page answers those, but not in the fastest possible order.</p>
<hr data-start="6068" data-end="6071">
<h2 data-section-id="17fjftf" data-start="6073" data-end="6110">5. Exact files I would touch first</h2>
<h2 data-section-id="tuq88z" data-start="6112" data-end="6163"><span role="text">A. <code data-start="6118" data-end="6163">client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx</code></span></h2>
<p data-start="6164" data-end="6333">This is the main integration point. It already contains the hero, service intro, trust badges, values, why-choose, and CTA sections <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2m9_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span></p>
<h3 data-section-id="eu5dc0" data-start="6335" data-end="6345">Change</h3>
<p data-start="6346" data-end="6397">Insert two new sections immediately after the hero:</p>
<ul data-start="6399" data-end="6440">
<li data-section-id="1b2doet" data-start="6399" data-end="6416">
<p data-start="6401" data-end="6416"><code data-start="6401" data-end="6416">HomeProofRail</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1uy7fc1" data-start="6417" data-end="6440">
<p data-start="6419" data-end="6440"><code data-start="6419" data-end="6440">HomeProjectEvidence</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="6442" data-end="6486">Then push the current services section down.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="uiq9dk" data-start="6488" data-end="6538"><span role="text">B. <code data-start="6494" data-end="6538">client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css</code></span></h2>
<p data-start="6539" data-end="6595">This file already defines the marketing color variables:</p>
<ul data-start="6596" data-end="6745">
<li data-section-id="11pbudp" data-start="6596" data-end="6619">
<p data-start="6598" data-end="6619"><code data-start="6598" data-end="6619">--marketing-primary</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="5lpmyn" data-start="6620" data-end="6642">
<p data-start="6622" data-end="6642"><code data-start="6622" data-end="6642">--marketing-accent</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="jh4zwk" data-start="6643" data-end="6661">
<p data-start="6645" data-end="6661"><code data-start="6645" data-end="6661">--marketing-bg</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="169s5n8" data-start="6662" data-end="6682">
<p data-start="6664" data-end="6682"><code data-start="6664" data-end="6682">--marketing-cyan</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1r0rfqk" data-start="6683" data-end="6745">
<p data-start="6685" data-end="6745"><code data-start="6685" data-end="6705">--marketing-orange</code> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2ma_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">marketing</p></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="eu5dc0" data-start="6747" data-end="6757">Change</h3>
<p data-start="6758" data-end="6871">Expand this into a fuller token layer so the new homepage modules do not hardcode stylistic decisions inside JSX.</p>
<p data-start="6873" data-end="6877">Add:</p>
<ul data-start="6878" data-end="6993">
<li data-section-id="2fbdbd" data-start="6878" data-end="6904">
<p data-start="6880" data-end="6904">dark navy surface tokens</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="bckkcr" data-start="6905" data-end="6927">
<p data-start="6907" data-end="6927">light surface tokens</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1qfpgwt" data-start="6928" data-end="6941">
<p data-start="6930" data-end="6941">text tokens</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="8twy30" data-start="6942" data-end="6957">
<p data-start="6944" data-end="6957">border tokens</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="vnbeiz" data-start="6958" data-end="6993">
<p data-start="6960" data-end="6993">status tokens for project markers</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="1xp0vtb" data-start="6995" data-end="7024">C. Add new component files</h2>
<p data-start="7025" data-end="7040">I would create:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="7042" data-end="7357"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>client/src/portals/marketing/components/HomeProofRail.tsx</span><br><span>client/src/portals/marketing/components/HomeProjectEvidence.tsx</span><br><span>client/src/portals/marketing/components/ProjectSnippetRotator.tsx</span><br><span>client/src/portals/marketing/components/ProjectMiniMap.tsx</span><br><span>client/src/portals/marketing/data/homeProjectSnippets.ts</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="7359" data-end="7451">That gives you a clean, isolated implementation without destabilizing the rest of marketing.</p>
<hr data-start="7453" data-end="7456">
<h2 data-section-id="6ot9ib" data-start="7458" data-end="7495">6. Exact component recommendations</h2>
<h2 data-section-id="emgsif" data-start="7497" data-end="7510">Proof rail</h2>
<p data-start="7511" data-end="7598">Take the trust badges that currently sit in the services intro and promote them upward.</p>
<p data-start="7600" data-end="7643">Current content already exists in the page:</p>
<ul data-start="7644" data-end="7760">
<li data-section-id="afff00" data-start="7644" data-end="7657">
<p data-start="7646" data-end="7657">SF Bay Area</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1twuq6u" data-start="7658" data-end="7683">
<p data-start="7660" data-end="7683">Licensed PE / QSD / QSP</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="23d0y4" data-start="7684" data-end="7708">
<p data-start="7686" data-end="7708">Class A &amp; B Contractor</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1vxuj6u" data-start="7709" data-end="7760">
<p data-start="7711" data-end="7760">40+ Years <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2md_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="w1bnza" data-start="7762" data-end="7799">Convert into a compact proof band</h3>
<p data-start="7800" data-end="7814">Use 5–6 items:</p>
<ul data-start="7815" data-end="8022">
<li data-section-id="mpplfs" data-start="7815" data-end="7846">
<p data-start="7817" data-end="7846">40+ years Bay Area experience</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="14wv3ac" data-start="7847" data-end="7887">
<p data-start="7849" data-end="7887">In-house engineering + field execution</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1twuq6u" data-start="7888" data-end="7913">
<p data-start="7890" data-end="7913">Licensed PE / QSD / QSP</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1octfe4" data-start="7914" data-end="7938">
<p data-start="7916" data-end="7938">Class A &amp; B contractor</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="gsryog" data-start="7939" data-end="7975">
<p data-start="7941" data-end="7975">Public works + commercial delivery</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1wnqqdz" data-start="7976" data-end="8022">
<p data-start="7978" data-end="8022">Compliance, inspection, and closeout support</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="2g0yqi" data-start="8024" data-end="8039">Design rule</h3>
<p data-start="8040" data-end="8113">Do not make this a large card section.<br data-start="8078" data-end="8081">
Make it a horizontal trust rail.</p>
<hr data-start="8115" data-end="8118">
<h2 data-section-id="jqnnm3" data-start="8120" data-end="8155">Condensed project evidence + map</h2>
<p data-start="8156" data-end="8200">This should be your second inserted section.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="1xsy1s7" data-start="8202" data-end="8223">Home version only</h3>
<p data-start="8224" data-end="8229">Show:</p>
<ul data-start="8230" data-end="8295">
<li data-section-id="1hvdobh" data-start="8230" data-end="8245">
<p data-start="8232" data-end="8245">project title</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1j3e18v" data-start="8246" data-end="8252">
<p data-start="8248" data-end="8252">city</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="18fidwi" data-start="8253" data-end="8265">
<p data-start="8255" data-end="8265">discipline</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1lpej18" data-start="8266" data-end="8274">
<p data-start="8268" data-end="8274">status</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="by6gh5" data-start="8275" data-end="8295">
<p data-start="8277" data-end="8295">one proof sentence</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="2rhszg" data-start="8297" data-end="8312">Interaction</h3>
<ul data-start="8313" data-end="8440">
<li data-section-id="ojgxzf" data-start="8313" data-end="8339">
<p data-start="8315" data-end="8339">rotating snippet on left</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="19aesxf" data-start="8340" data-end="8371">
<p data-start="8342" data-end="8371">interactive mini-map on right</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="12ekf7r" data-start="8372" data-end="8409">
<p data-start="8374" data-end="8409">snippet hover updates active marker</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1s5b43v" data-start="8410" data-end="8440">
<p data-start="8412" data-end="8440">marker hover updates snippet</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="ym8qpr" data-start="8442" data-end="8459">Keep it small</h3>
<p data-start="8460" data-end="8569">On home, use only 5–8 curated projects.<br data-start="8499" data-end="8502">
Do not bring the full project-browser complexity into the homepage.</p>
<p data-start="8571" data-end="8750">You already have routing in place for a fuller project experience through the marketing app, including <code data-start="8674" data-end="8690">ProjectGallery</code> and <code data-start="8695" data-end="8710">ProjectDetail</code> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2me_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/MarketingApp.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/MarketingApp.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">MarketingApp</p></a></span></p>
<hr data-start="8752" data-end="8755">
<h2 data-section-id="o5wxjn" data-start="8757" data-end="8782">7. Brand/token cleanup</h2>
<p data-start="8784" data-end="8856">The palette is directionally correct, but the code should be normalized.</p>
<p data-start="8858" data-end="9143">Right now, <code data-start="8869" data-end="8884">marketing.css</code> gives you the basic cyan/orange/slate marketing identity <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2mf_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">marketing</p></a></span>, while the page itself still contains lots of ad hoc gradients and hardcoded visual treatments inside the component tree <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2mg_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span>.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="1bbqkt4" data-start="9145" data-end="9179">I would formalize these layers</h3>
<h2 data-section-id="o77tfy" data-start="9181" data-end="9194">Foundation</h2>
<ul data-start="9195" data-end="9248">
<li data-section-id="1m9fevx" data-start="9195" data-end="9204">
<p data-start="9197" data-end="9204">surface</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1j3pnhx" data-start="9205" data-end="9211">
<p data-start="9207" data-end="9211">text</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1c544w4" data-start="9212" data-end="9220">
<p data-start="9214" data-end="9220">border</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ls80su" data-start="9221" data-end="9229">
<p data-start="9223" data-end="9229">shadow</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1mj6zww" data-start="9230" data-end="9238">
<p data-start="9232" data-end="9238">radius</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ivy889" data-start="9239" data-end="9248">
<p data-start="9241" data-end="9248">spacing</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="xbu6n2" data-start="9250" data-end="9258">Brand</h2>
<ul data-start="9259" data-end="9300">
<li data-section-id="1j3bt7s" data-start="9259" data-end="9265">
<p data-start="9261" data-end="9265">navy</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1j3ee65" data-start="9266" data-end="9272">
<p data-start="9268" data-end="9272">cyan</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1970ja0" data-start="9273" data-end="9281">
<p data-start="9275" data-end="9281">orange</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1j3po44" data-start="9282" data-end="9288">
<p data-start="9284" data-end="9288">teal</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="8sjjot" data-start="9289" data-end="9300">
<p data-start="9291" data-end="9300">off-white</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="18lxos1" data-start="9302" data-end="9311">Status</h2>
<ul data-start="9312" data-end="9356">
<li data-section-id="17rqqis" data-start="9312" data-end="9320">
<p data-start="9314" data-end="9320">active</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="2v93tx" data-start="9321" data-end="9332">
<p data-start="9323" data-end="9332">completed</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="hie842" data-start="9333" data-end="9346">
<p data-start="9335" data-end="9346">in progress</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="8ro6w2" data-start="9347" data-end="9356">
<p data-start="9349" data-end="9356">warning</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="9358" data-end="9522">That matters because the mini-map and project snippet rotator will need status colors, and you do not want those scattered as one-off values through new components.</p>
<hr data-start="9524" data-end="9527">
<h2 data-section-id="1c86c1p" data-start="9529" data-end="9568">8. How I would use your Figma access</h2>
<p data-start="9570" data-end="9614">The strongest Figma-backed workflow here is:</p>
<ol data-start="9616" data-end="10150">
<li data-section-id="qmdab" data-start="9616" data-end="9725">
<p data-start="9619" data-end="9725"><strong data-start="9619" data-end="9655">Use <code data-start="9625" data-end="9647">figma-internal-scout</code> logic</strong> to inspect the attached component directions or your live design file</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="p51qp4" data-start="9726" data-end="9914">
<p data-start="9729" data-end="9834"><strong data-start="9729" data-end="9767">Use <code data-start="9735" data-end="9759">figma-to-code-contract</code> logic</strong> to define the production-ready props/states/layout invariants for:</p>
<ul data-start="9838" data-end="9914">
<li data-section-id="6vfzui" data-start="9838" data-end="9850">
<p data-start="9840" data-end="9850">proof rail</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1u56oss" data-start="9854" data-end="9876">
<p data-start="9856" data-end="9876">project snippet card</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="7qx5cq" data-start="9880" data-end="9890">
<p data-start="9882" data-end="9890">mini-map</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="2lqb71" data-start="9894" data-end="9914">
<p data-start="9896" data-end="9914">featured work card</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-section-id="19jq27a" data-start="9915" data-end="10057">
<p data-start="9918" data-end="10057"><strong data-start="9918" data-end="9956">Use <code data-start="9924" data-end="9948">figma-knowledge-weaver</code> logic</strong> to write a small <code data-start="9974" data-end="9987">docs/design</code> knowledge layer in the repo so these choices do not live only in chat</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ywokx6" data-start="10058" data-end="10150">
<p data-start="10061" data-end="10150"><strong data-start="10061" data-end="10097">Use <code data-start="10067" data-end="10089">sequential-workbench</code> logic</strong> to keep the trim and implementation plan disciplined</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="10152" data-end="10383">One constraint: although you enabled Figma access, I do not have a Figma Community search tool in this environment. So I can inspect your Figma files directly, but I cannot do a live Figma Community mining pass from here right now.</p>
<hr data-start="10385" data-end="10388">
<h2 data-section-id="15z4lr" data-start="10390" data-end="10456">9. My concrete recommendation for the next implementation slice</h2>
<p data-start="10458" data-end="10475">Do this in order:</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1uuu1us" data-start="10477" data-end="10487">Slice 1</h2>
<p data-start="10488" data-end="10522">Add the proof rail under the hero.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1uuu1uv" data-start="10524" data-end="10534">Slice 2</h2>
<p data-start="10535" data-end="10589">Add the condensed project evidence + mini-map section.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1uuu1uu" data-start="10591" data-end="10601">Slice 3</h2>
<p data-start="10602" data-end="10701">Move the existing trust badges out of the services intro, since they will already be handled above.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1uuu1up" data-start="10703" data-end="10713">Slice 4</h2>
<p data-start="10714" data-end="10875">Reduce the hero’s motion budget slightly by avoiding further decorative additions there. The hero is already doing enough <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2mh_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span></p>
