lns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">vite.config</p></a></span>. So the clean mental split is:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1663" data-end="2255"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>last_breath/</span><br><span>├── 01_mockups_and_unused/</span><br><span>│   ├── artifacts/</span><br><span>│   │   └── mockup-sandbox/</span><br><span>│   ├── dormant-marketing-experiments/</span><br><span>│   ├── dormant-internal-experiments/</span><br><span>│   ├── old-content/</span><br><span>│   ├── unused-assets/</span><br><span>│   └── staging-only references/</span><br><span>│</span><br><span>└── 02_active_platform/</span><br><span>    ├── client/</span><br><span>    │   └── src/</span><br><span>    │       ├── portals/</span><br><span>    │       │   ├── marketing/</span><br><span>    │       │   ├── client/</span><br><span>    │       │   └── internal/</span><br><span>    │       ├── components/</span><br><span>    │       ├── hooks/</span><br><span>    │       └── lib/</span><br><span>    ├── server/</span><br><span>    ├── shared/</span><br><span>    ├── attached_assets/</span><br><span>    └── package.json / vite.config.ts</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="2257" data-end="2312">And the active platform itself should be thought of as:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="2314" data-end="2430"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>02_active_platform/</span><br><span>├── marketing-site</span><br><span>├── client-portal</span><br><span>├── internal-portal-core</span><br><span>├── backend</span><br><span>└── shared</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="2432" data-end="2473">I’ll keep using that split going forward.</p>
<hr data-start="2475" data-end="2478">
<h2 data-section-id="ija98p" data-start="2480" data-end="2509">Updated homepage direction</h2>
<p data-start="2511" data-end="2846">You were right to trim attention away from hero motion. The current home page is doing a lot in the hero already: video, grid/background layers, particles, floating elements, scroll progress, and custom reverse-play logic <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2n6_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2n7_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2n8_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span></p>
<p data-start="2848" data-end="3082">Also, the trust badges you want are currently sitting in the services intro, not immediately under the hero: <strong data-start="2957" data-end="2972">SF Bay Area</strong>, <strong data-start="2974" data-end="3001">Licensed PE / QSD / QSP</strong>, <strong data-start="3003" data-end="3029">Class A &amp; B Contractor</strong>, <strong data-start="3031" data-end="3044">40+ Years</strong> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2n9_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span></p>
<p data-start="3084" data-end="3113">That confirms the right move:</p>
<h2 data-section-id="om57ds" data-start="3115" data-end="3140">Refined homepage order</h2>
<ol data-start="3141" data-end="3337">
<li data-section-id="dvfaqy" data-start="3141" data-end="3150">
<p data-start="3144" data-end="3150">Hero</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="b33lij" data-start="3151" data-end="3170">
<p data-start="3154" data-end="3170"><strong data-start="3154" data-end="3168">Proof rail</strong></p>
</li>
