</li>
<li data-section-id="mwkrrs" data-start="3274" data-end="3299">
<p data-start="3277" data-end="3299">Featured work teaser</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="16hs9f3" data-start="3300" data-end="3320">
<p data-start="3303" data-end="3320">One testimonial</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1vg8q22" data-start="3321" data-end="3337">
<p data-start="3324" data-end="3337">CTA / contact</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="3339" data-end="3631">And yes: “Why Pacific Engineering” should carry more weight than a generic delivery section. That aligns better with the one-pager’s strongest differentiators: <strong data-start="3499" data-end="3516">field-reality</strong>, <strong data-start="3518" data-end="3557">Bay Area jurisdictional familiarity</strong>, and <strong data-start="3563" data-end="3593">compliance-minded delivery</strong> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2na_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Union</p></button></span></p>
<hr data-start="3633" data-end="3636">
<h1 data-section-id="1gy48rm" data-start="3638" data-end="3666">Best proof rail directions</h1>
<p data-start="3668" data-end="3745">You asked for the strongest examples. Here are the ones I would actually use.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="xs5wd2" data-start="3747" data-end="3785">Direction A — the strongest default</h2>
<p data-start="3786" data-end="3823">A clean 6-item horizontal trust rail.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="dycyd6" data-start="3825" data-end="3848">Recommended content</h3>
<ul data-start="3849" data-end="4239">
<li data-section-id="1icrn4n" data-start="3849" data-end="3896">
<p data-start="3851" data-end="3896"><strong data-start="3851" data-end="3864">40+ Years</strong><br data-start="3864" data-end="3867">
Bay Area project experience</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="r10p4s" data-start="3897" data-end="3955">
<p data-start="3899" data-end="3955"><strong data-start="3899" data-end="3923">In-House Engineering</strong><br data-start="3923" data-end="3926">
PE, QSD, QSP-backed support</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="24bxk4" data-start="3956" data-end="4020">
<p data-start="3958" data-end="4020"><strong data-start="3958" data-end="3984">Class A &amp; B Contractor</strong><br data-start="3984" data-end="3987">
Engineering and field execution</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="in29o" data-start="4021" data-end="4094">
<p data-start="4023" data-end="4094"><strong data-start="4023" data-end="4048">Public + Private Work</strong><br data-start="4048" data-end="4051">
Municipal, infrastructure, and commercial</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ak7u93" data-start="4095" data-end="4167">
<p data-start="4097" data-end="4167"><strong data-start="4097" data-end="4118">Compliance-Driven</strong><br data-start="4118" data-end="4121">
SWPPP, permitting, inspection, documentation</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1a672gy" data-start="4168" data-end="4239">
<p data-start="4170" data-end="4239"><strong data-start="4170" data-end="4194">Field-Ready Delivery</strong><br data-start="4194" data-end="4197">
Constructability and phased coordination</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="13ie8k" data-start="4241" data-end="4259">Why this works</h3>
<p data-start="4260" data-end="4353">It is fast, literal, credible, and directly useful to GCs, supers, architects, and engineers.</p>
<hr data-start="4355" data-end="4358">
<h2 data-section-id="1j7tqtx" data-start="4360" data-end="4398">Direction B — a little more premium</h2>
<p data-start="4399" data-end="4428">Same rail, but each item has:</p>
<ul data-start="4429" data-end="4487">
<li data-section-id="105slms" data-start="4429" data-end="4443">
<p data-start="4431" data-end="4443">compact icon</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="143ccqw" data-start="4444" data-end="4461">
<p data-start="4446" data-end="4461">bold value line</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ssd4le" data-start="4462" data-end="4487">
<p data-start="4464" data-end="4487">quieter supporting line</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4489" data-end="4497">Example:</p>
<ul data-start="4499" data-end="4889">
<li data-section-id="bzx38f" data-start="4499" data-end="4558">
<p data-start="4501" data-end="4558"><strong data-start="4501" data-end="4514">40+ Years</strong><br data-start="4514" data-end="4517">
Northern California delivery experience</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="s76t2" data-start="4559" data-end="4626">
<p data-start="4561" data-end="4626"><strong data-start="4561" data-end="4579">PE / QSD / QSP</strong><br data-start="4579" data-end="4582">
In-house compliance and stormwater support</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="elhoy2" data-start="4627" data-end="4688">
<p data-start="4629" data-end="4688"><strong data-start="4629" data-end="4644">Class A &amp; B</strong><br data-start="4644" data-end="4647">
Contractor-backed engineering execution</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="fl4kta" data-start="4689" data-end="4752">
