Schools, airport, utilities, waterfront</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="19btc16" data-start="4823" data-end="4889">
<p data-start="4825" data-end="4889"><strong data-start="4825" data-end="4844">Closeout Minded</strong><br data-start="4844" data-end="4847">
Documentation, reporting, accountability</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4891" data-end="4936">This is the direction I’d use in Figma first.</p>
<hr data-start="4938" data-end="4941">
<h2 data-section-id="15yaefn" data-start="4943" data-end="4996">Direction C — proof rail with one rotating callout</h2>
<p data-start="4997" data-end="5074">Five static proof items plus one featured project proof capsule on the right.</p>
<p data-start="5076" data-end="5114">That right-most capsule rotates among:</p>
<ul data-start="5115" data-end="5160">
<li data-section-id="lm650t" data-start="5115" data-end="5127">
<p data-start="5117" data-end="5127">Port of SF</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="lo1ruk" data-start="5128" data-end="5138">
<p data-start="5130" data-end="5138">Caltrans</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1782mov" data-start="5139" data-end="5146">
<p data-start="5141" data-end="5146">SFUSD</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1782tuj" data-start="5147" data-end="5154">
<p data-start="5149" data-end="5154">SFPUC</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1o4r8y" data-start="5155" data-end="5160">
<p data-start="5157" data-end="5160">SFO</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="5162" data-end="5269">This is visually stronger, but slightly more complex. I would do this only after Direction A or B is solid.</p>
<hr data-start="5271" data-end="5274">
<h1 data-section-id="kkdkdg" data-start="5276" data-end="5318">Best condensed project evidence strategy</h1>
<p data-start="5320" data-end="5371">You want the home version to be condensed. Correct.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="12nu0l2" data-start="5373" data-end="5404">Home project evidence layout</h2>
<p data-start="5405" data-end="5540"><strong data-start="5405" data-end="5414">Left:</strong> rotating snippet stack<br data-start="5437" data-end="5440">
<strong data-start="5440" data-end="5450">Right:</strong> mini interactive map<br data-start="5471" data-end="5474">
<strong data-start="5474" data-end="5494">Below or corner:</strong> status legend + “View all project experience”</p>
<p data-start="5542" data-end="5608">This should sit before the user gets into long narrative sections.</p>
<hr data-start="5610" data-end="5613">
<h2 data-section-id="10ptn3w" data-start="5615" data-end="5650">What each snippet should contain</h2>
<p data-start="5651" data-end="5691">For home, each snippet should have only:</p>
<ul data-start="5693" data-end="5768">
<li data-section-id="1hvdobh" data-start="5693" data-end="5708">
<p data-start="5695" data-end="5708">project title</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1j3e18v" data-start="5709" data-end="5715">
<p data-start="5711" data-end="5715">city</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="18fidwi" data-start="5716" data-end="5728">
<p data-start="5718" data-end="5728">discipline</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="avj33h" data-start="5729" data-end="5745">
<p data-start="5731" data-end="5745">proof sentence</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="17ykrog" data-start="5746" data-end="5768">
<p data-start="5748" data-end="5768">optional status chip</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="nbi05n" data-start="5770" data-end="5791">Important caution</h3>
<p data-start="5792" data-end="6100">The uploaded project docs are useful for <strong data-start="5833" data-end="5850">project proof</strong>, but some of the dates/status framing in them is historical. So on home, I would only expose <strong data-start="5944" data-end="5954">status</strong> after you confirm it manually in your gallery dataset. The source materials are good for scope/proof, but not always safe for live status labels.</p>
<hr data-start="6102" data-end="6105">
<h1 data-section-id="5x5vwl" data-start="6107" data-end="6175">Best project snippet examples from your uploaded project materials</h1>
<p data-start="6177" data-end="6244">These are the strongest ones for the homepage and gallery seed set.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="d86x5k" data-start="6246" data-end="6273">1. Port of San Francisco</h2>
<p data-start="6274" data-end="6604">The project materials show PECI developed a portwide demolition cost estimate for multiple deteriorated piers/wharfs, supported U.S. Army Corps documentation, and also performed roof inspection / structural consulting for solar placement on Port property <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2nb_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">example projects completed</p></button></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2nc_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">example projects completed</p></button></span></p>
<h3 data-section-id="s7rf3g" data-start="6606" data-end="6622">Home snippet</h3>
<p data-start="6623" data-end="6947"><strong data-start="6623" data-end="6683">Port of SF - Portwide Demolition + Solar Roof Inspection</strong><br data-start="6683" data-end="6686">
San Francisco, CA<br data-start="6703" data-end="6706">
Infrastructure / Inspection / Cost Estimating<br data-start="6751" data-end="6754">
<strong data-start="6754" data-end="6764">Proof:</strong> Developed demolition cost estimates across multiple waterfront piers and supported funding documentation, with added roof inspection and structural consulting for solar installation.</p>
<p data-start="6949" data-end="7023">Why it works: waterfront, public agency, multi-scope, documentation-heavy.</p>
<hr data-start="7025" data-end="7028">
<h2 data-section-id="clde5w" data-start="7030" data-end="7075">2. Caltrans stormwater / ADA / signal work</h2>
<p data-start="7076" data-end="7368">The project materials show stormwater reconstruction at Highway 80, emergency turnaround / guardrail work, ADA and signal modifications, and stormwater/erosion control planning, completed within schedule and budget <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2nd_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">example projects completed</p></button></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2ne_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">example projects completed</p></button></span></p>
