Utility Construction / Compliance / Hazardous Materials Planning<br data-start="8889" data-end="8892">
<strong data-start="8892" data-end="8902">Proof:</strong> Supported excavation, utility installation, hazardous materials planning, and ongoing stormwater monitoring across public utility infrastructure work.</p>
<p data-start="9055" data-end="9126">Why it works: compliance-heavy, infrastructure-heavy, operations-heavy.</p>
<hr data-start="9128" data-end="9131">
<h2 data-section-id="17ewqpg" data-start="9133" data-end="9171">5. SFO Terminal 3 / Boarding Area E</h2>
<p data-start="9172" data-end="9461">The materials show PECI supported design-build civil scope including SWPPP, erosion control, grading, utilities, survey, construction administration, and installation of storm/water systems for Boarding Area E <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2nj_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">example projects completed</p></button></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2nk_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">example projects completed</p></button></span></p>
<h3 data-section-id="s7rf3g" data-start="9463" data-end="9479">Home snippet</h3>
<p data-start="9480" data-end="9721"><strong data-start="9480" data-end="9516">SFO Terminal 3 / Boarding Area E</strong><br data-start="9516" data-end="9519">
San Francisco, CA<br data-start="9536" data-end="9539">
Design-Build / Civil / Utility Installation<br data-start="9582" data-end="9585">
<strong data-start="9585" data-end="9595">Proof:</strong> Provided civil design support, stormwater and erosion planning, survey, and utility installation for a major airport project.</p>
<p data-start="9723" data-end="9800">Why it works: instantly recognizable client, strong design-build credibility.</p>
<hr data-start="9802" data-end="9805">
