Construction Survey / Excavation Support<br data-start="10190" data-end="10193">
<strong data-start="10193" data-end="10203">Proof:</strong> Provided staking, utility potholing investigation, and excavation support for critical structural foundation elements.</p>
<p data-start="10324" data-end="10367">Why it works: compact, technical, no fluff.</p>
<hr data-start="10369" data-end="10372">
<h1 data-section-id="j0obko" data-start="10374" data-end="10418">Deep advice on brand, voice, and expertise</h1>
<p data-start="10420" data-end="10510">Your market does not reward ornamental confidence. It rewards <strong data-start="10482" data-end="10509">operational credibility</strong>.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1mrftqq" data-start="10512" data-end="10554">What your brand voice should sound like</h2>
<ul data-start="10555" data-end="10686">
<li data-section-id="123r1ew" data-start="10555" data-end="10565">
<p data-start="10557" data-end="10565">specific</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="im14mf" data-start="10566" data-end="10579">
<p data-start="10568" data-end="10579">field-aware</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="x7h6mq" data-start="10580" data-end="10594">
<p data-start="10582" data-end="10594">permit-aware</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="8quxxc" data-start="10595" data-end="10611">
<p data-start="10597" data-end="10611">schedule-aware</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="z4pisu" data-start="10612" data-end="10633">
<p data-start="10614" data-end="10633">compliance-literate</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1j3e7d7" data-start="10634" data-end="10640">
<p data-start="10636" data-end="10640">calm</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="15uaslt" data-start="10641" data-end="10664">
<p data-start="10643" data-end="10664">technically competent</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ha7xn0" data-start="10665" data-end="10686">
<p data-start="10667" data-end="10686">regionally grounded</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="1xxk1lh" data-start="10688" data-end="10713">What to emphasize more</h2>
<ul data-start="10714" data-end="11012">
<li data-section-id="1kt8d05" data-start="10714" data-end="10759">
<p data-start="10716" data-end="10759">Bay Area permitting and agency coordination</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="izyqp6" data-start="10760" data-end="10791">
<p data-start="10762" data-end="10791">in-house PE / QSD / QSP depth</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1wfsm9y" data-start="10792" data-end="10832">
<p data-start="10794" data-end="10832">self-perform capability where relevant</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1s4oqv3" data-start="10833" data-end="10851">
<p data-start="10835" data-end="10851">constructability</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="17p2sqn" data-start="10852" data-end="10869">
<p data-start="10854" data-end="10869">phased delivery</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="79oucs" data-start="10870" data-end="10922">
<p data-start="10872" data-end="10922">stormwater / inspection / documentation discipline</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="93428j" data-start="10923" data-end="10967">
<p data-start="10925" data-end="10967">public works and institutional credibility</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ewqnph" data-start="10968" data-end="11012">
<p data-start="10970" data-end="11012">real project scope, not just sector labels</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="1xxkyix" data-start="11014" data-end="11039">What to emphasize less</h2>
<ul data-start="11040" data-end="11198">
<li data-section-id="1sqasaf" data-start="11040" data-end="11070">
<p data-start="11042" data-end="11070">abstract innovation language</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1pz70hq" data-start="11071" data-end="11125">
<p data-start="11073" data-end="11125">startup-style “platform” language on marketing pages</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="qqy3r2" data-start="11126" data-end="11156">
<p data-start="11128" data-end="11156">over-animated hero spectacle</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1if9l8x" data-start="11157" data-end="11198">
<p data-start="11159" data-end="11198">generic “we build your vision” phrasing</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="1fczqov" data-start="11200" data-end="11224">Best language pattern</h2>
<p data-start="11225" data-end="11229">Use:</p>
<ul data-start="11230" data-end="11332">
<li data-section-id="1evrwlj" data-start="11230" data-end="11249">
<p data-start="11232" data-end="11249"><strong data-start="11232" data-end="11249">what was done</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="c0v7d1" data-start="11250" data-end="11261">
<p data-start="11252" data-end="11261"><strong data-start="11252" data-end="11261">where</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="lti0ha" data-start="11262" data-end="11276">
<p data-start="11264" data-end="11276"><strong data-start="11264" data-end="11276">for whom</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="gaa32i" data-start="11277" data-end="11304">
<p data-start="11279" data-end="11304"><strong data-start="11279" data-end="11304">what risk was handled</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="bfmcjk" data-start="11305" data-end="11332">
<p data-start="11307" data-end="11332"><strong data-start="11307" data-end="11332">what made it credible</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="11334" data-end="11373">That is the best fit for your audience.</p>
<hr data-start="11375" data-end="11378">
<h1 data-section-id="na376s" data-start="11380" data-end="11407">Component folder strategy</h1>
<p data-start="11409" data-end="11456">I still recommend these new folders/components:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="11458" data-end="11768"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>client/src/portals/marketing/components/</span><br><span>├── HomeProofRail.tsx</span><br><span>├── HomeProjectEvidence.tsx</span><br><span>├── ProjectSnippetRotator.tsx</span><br><span>├── ProjectMiniMap.tsx</span><br><span>├── WhyPacific.tsx</span><br><span>└── FeaturedProjectCards.tsx</span><br><br><span>client/src/portals/marketing/data/</span><br><span>├── homeProjectSnippets.ts</span><br><span>├── projectMarkers.ts</span><br><span>└── proofRailItems.ts</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<h2 data-section-id="14p08a8" data-start="11770" data-end="11797">Layout strategy for each</h2>
<h2 data-section-id="iv82g9" data-start="11799" data-end="11821"><span role="text"><code data-start="11802" data-end="11821">HomeProofRail.tsx</code></span></h2>
<ul data-start="11822" data-end="11971">
<li data-section-id="ndsibn" data-start="11822" data-end="11854">
<p data-start="11824" data-end="11854">one horizontal band under hero</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="hydt1m" data-start="11855" data-end="11872">
<p data-start="11857" data-end="11872">6 items desktop</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="w7fa0r" data-start="11873" data-end="11885">
<p data-start="11875" data-end="11885">3x2 tablet</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="11zsw9z" data-start="11886" data-end="11902">
<p data-start="11888" data-end="11902">stacked mobile</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="rtbl09" data-start="11903" data-end="11916">
<p data-start="11905" data-end="11916">no carousel</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1xgkpxi" data-start="11917" data-end="11931">
<p data-start="11919" data-end="11931">no long copy</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="sk9dpp" data-start="11932" data-end="11971">
<p data-start="11934" data-end="11971">one icon, one value, one support line</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="1o2oacd" data-start="11973" data-end="12001"><span role="text"><code data-start="11976" data-end="12001">HomeProjectEvidence.tsx</code></span></h2>
<ul data-start="12002" data-end="12152">
<li data-section-id="1p2sck3" data-start="12002" data-end="12029">
<p data-start="12004" data-end="12029">section intro on top-left</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="16m2md3" data-start="12030" data-end="12052">
<p data-start="12032" data-end="12052">snippet rotator left</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="q0opsk" data-start="12053" data-end="12064">
<p data-start="12055" data-end="12064">map right</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1o122y8" data-start="12065" data-end="12080">
<p data-start="12067" data-end="12080">subtle legend</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="4jcn5q" data-start="12081" data-end="12102">
<p data-start="12083" data-end="12102">CTA to full gallery</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="voio9k" data-start="12103" data-end="12152">
<p data-start="12105" data-end="12152">keep the home version curated, not filter-heavy</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="sjb49x" data-start="12154" data-end="12184"><span role="text"><code data-start="12157" data-end="12184">ProjectSnippetRotator.tsx</code></span></h2>
<ul data-start="12185" data-end="12348">
<li data-section-id="1o41eje" data-start="12185" data-end="12206">
<p data-start="12187" data-end="12206">5–6 curated entries</p>
