</li>
<li data-section-id="b0pyud" data-start="12669" data-end="12702">
<p data-start="12671" data-end="12702">compliance-minded documentation</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1pz71bw" data-start="12703" data-end="12754">
<p data-start="12705" data-end="12754">integrated engineering + construction perspective</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="12756" data-end="12759">
<h1 data-section-id="1w04tbx" data-start="12761" data-end="12801">Updated part 8 — how I’d use Figma now</h1>
<p data-start="12803" data-end="12887">Now that you want the community-miner in the loop, here is the right Figma workflow:</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1laih9p" data-start="12889" data-end="12922">Phase A — internal truth first</h2>
<p data-start="12923" data-end="13009">Use <strong data-start="12927" data-end="12951">figma-internal-scout</strong> against your actual homepage and design file to identify:</p>
<ul data-start="13010" data-end="13157">
<li data-section-id="vqz7qz" data-start="13010" data-end="13038">
<p data-start="13012" data-end="13038">header/hero spacing rhythm</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="qckljd" data-start="13039" data-end="13066">
<p data-start="13041" data-end="13066">card corner/radius system</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="4zcws4" data-start="13067" data-end="13083">
<p data-start="13069" data-end="13083">section widths</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1mbg63y" data-start="13084" data-end="13101">
<p data-start="13086" data-end="13101">button families</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1rjdmnu" data-start="13102" data-end="13124">
<p data-start="13104" data-end="13124">current accent usage</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1c1n3oa" data-start="13125" data-end="13157">
<p data-start="13127" data-end="13157">what should be kept vs retired</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="1cfnvjp" data-start="13159" data-end="13197">Phase B — targeted community mining</h2>
<p data-start="13198" data-end="13259">Use <strong data-start="13202" data-end="13227">figma-community-miner</strong> only for these pattern classes:</p>
<ul data-start="13260" data-end="13402">
<li data-section-id="dqboy1" data-start="13260" data-end="13273">
<p data-start="13262" data-end="13273">proof rails</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="t8n128" data-start="13274" data-end="13308">
<p data-start="13276" data-end="13308">compact project evidence modules</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1up6gbd" data-start="13309" data-end="13340">
<p data-start="13311" data-end="13340">mini-map + card sync patterns</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="c63jyn" data-start="13341" data-end="13371">
<p data-start="13343" data-end="13371">testimonial slider mechanics</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="e9ii1f" data-start="13372" data-end="13402">
<p data-start="13374" data-end="13402">estimator / intake card flow</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="yz88m1" data-start="13404" data-end="13434">Rules for community mining</h3>
<ul data-start="13435" data-end="13596">
<li data-section-id="lvec4n" data-start="13435" data-end="13466">
<p data-start="13437" data-end="13466">mine for structure, not style</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="r43on9" data-start="13467" data-end="13495">
<p data-start="13469" data-end="13495">ignore consumer/SaaS gloss</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="d31tw1" data-start="13496" data-end="13532">
<p data-start="13498" data-end="13532">ignore illustration-heavy patterns</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="15gwu7b" data-start="13533" data-end="13566">
<p data-start="13535" data-end="13566">ignore overly soft card systems</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1b0bb6q" data-start="13567" data-end="13596">
<p data-start="13569" data-end="13596">ignore playful interactions</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="2pdbxl" data-start="13598" data-end="13630">Phase C — contract generation</h2>
<p data-start="13631" data-end="13672">Use <strong data-start="13635" data-end="13661">figma-to-code-contract</strong> to define:</p>
<ul data-start="13673" data-end="13841">
<li data-section-id="1cay6wv" data-start="13673" data-end="13698">
<p data-start="13675" data-end="13698">proof rail props/states</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="krxim6" data-start="13699" data-end="13743">
<p data-start="13701" data-end="13743">project evidence section layout invariants</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="lqpma3" data-start="13744" data-end="13774">
<p data-start="13746" data-end="13774">marker/snippet sync behavior</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1jqmb0o" data-start="13775" data-end="13795">
<p data-start="13777" data-end="13795">mobile breakpoints</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="uymptp" data-start="13796" data-end="13810">
<p data-start="13798" data-end="13810">card anatomy</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ro35oy" data-start="13811" data-end="13841">
<p data-start="13813" data-end="13841">section-specific token usage</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="1xfnzua" data-start="13843" data-end="13870">Phase D — durable memory</h2>
<p data-start="13871" data-end="13914">Use <strong data-start="13875" data-end="13901">figma-knowledge-weaver</strong> to preserve:</p>
<ul data-start="13915" data-end="14104">
<li data-section-id="16hw4dt" data-start="13915" data-end="13940">
<p data-start="13917" data-end="13940">approved homepage order</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="9rf0yx" data-start="13941" data-end="13973">
<p data-start="13943" data-end="13973">approved proof rail copy rules</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="zpu7sc" data-start="13974" data-end="14012">
<p data-start="13976" data-end="14012">approved project snippet field rules</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="15181wr" data-start="14013" data-end="14044">
<p data-start="14015" data-end="14044">“Why Pacific” messaging rules</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="12t2plf" data-start="14045" data-end="14104">
<p data-start="14047" data-end="14104">what stays on home vs what moves to gallery/about/contact</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="164em6m" data-start="14106" data-end="14138">Phase E — sequence discipline</h2>
<p data-start="14139" data-end="14177">Use <strong data-start="14143" data-end="14167">sequential-workbench</strong> to track:</p>
<ul data-start="14178" data-end="14321">
<li data-section-id="1ygq2aj" data-start="14178" data-end="14202">
<p data-start="14180" data-end="14202">homepage changes first</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="bi3xl2" data-start="14203" data-end="14226">
<p data-start="14205" data-end="14226">repo separation later</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1o796pa" data-start="14227" data-end="14265">
<p data-start="14229" data-end="14265">internal portal bloat handling later</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1nyjy4b" data-start="14266" data-end="14321">
<p data-start="14268" data-end="14321">gallery/contact/about expansion after home stabilizes</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="5chadd" data-start="14323" data-end="14348">One honest limitation</h3>
<p data-start="14349" data-end="14657">I attempted a generic Figma search from this environment, but no specific file surfaced from connector search without a direct file or node target. So the workflow above is the correct one, but for file-specific inspection I still want a Figma file URL or node once you want me to canonize a specific layout.</p>
<hr data-start="14659" data-end="14662">
<h1 data-section-id="6gkohr" data-start="14664" data-end="14709">Updated part 9 — next implementation slices</h1>
<p data-start="14711" data-end="14768">Based on your reply, I would update the sequence to this:</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1jskqje" data-start="14770" data-end="14810">Slice 0 — mental repo separation only</h2>
<p data-start="14811" data-end="14876">Keep the two tree model in working memory.<br data-start="14853" data-end="14856">
Do not refactor yet.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="pm1i2z" data-start="14878" data-end="14904">Slice 1 — token cleanup</h2>
<p data-start="14905" data-end="15126">Replace the current lightweight marketing token layer with a fuller <code data-start="14973" data-end="14988">marketing.css</code>.<br data-start="14989" data-end="14992">
The existing repo version is still very minimal — mostly a few brand colors and effect helpers <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2np_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">marketing</p></a></span></p>
<h2 data-section-id="twsxs1" data-start="15128" data-end="15151">Slice 2 — proof rail</h2>
<p data-start="15152" data-end="15355">Add <code data-start="15156" data-end="15171">HomeProofRail</code> directly under hero.<br data-start="15192" data-end="15195">
Move the current trust badges out of the services intro after that. The current badge set is in the services section now <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2nq_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span></p>
<h2 data-section-id="eo4i71" data-start="15357" data-end="15392">Slice 3 — project evidence block</h2>
<p data-start="15393" data-end="15616">Add <code data-start="15397" data-end="15418">HomeProjectEvidence</code> under the proof rail.<br data-start="15440" data-end="15443">
Use the uploaded project materials as the seed source for snippet content and gallery records <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2nr_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">example projects completed</p></button></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2ns_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">example projects completed</p></button></span></p>
<h2 data-section-id="q7cipv" data-start="15618" data-end="15653">Slice 4 — rebalance the mid-page</h2>
<p data-start="15654" data-end="15776">Keep services, but give more visual and narrative weight to <strong data-start="15714" data-end="15741">Why Pacific Engineering</strong> than to generic delivery language.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="gk0gfc" data-start="15778" data-end="15822">Slice 5 — gallery/about/contact expansion</h2>
<p data-start="15823" data-end="16065">The marketing app already has routes for <code data-start="15864" data-end="15871">about</code>, <code data-start="15873" data-end="15882">contact</code>, <code data-start="15884" data-end="15901">project-gallery</code>, and <code data-start="15907" data-end="15922">project/:slug</code> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2nt_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/MarketingApp.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/marketing/MarketingApp.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">MarketingApp</p></a></span><br data-start="15962" data-end="15965">
That is where the fuller map, longer project inventory, testimonials, and estimator flow can expand.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="12m0eji" data-start="16067" data-end="16102">Slice 6 — internal cleanup later</h2>
<p data-start="16103" data-end="16451">Only after the homepage/marketing side is tighter do we decide what internal items stay active, get feature-flagged, or move into an experimental area. That internal route list is exactly where the bloat pressure is coming from, even though the features are functional <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2nu_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/internal/InternalApp.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/internal/InternalApp.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">InternalApp</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2nv_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/internal/InternalApp.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/c94349630a506d05ca4c78125047a483eef63296/client/src/portals/internal/InternalApp.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">InternalApp</p></a></span></p>
<hr data-start="16453" data-end="16456">
<h1 data-section-id="19dro5o" data-start="16458" data-end="16483"><span role="text">Drop-in <code data-start="16468" data-end="16483">marketing.css</code></span></h1>
<p data-start="16485" data-end="16586">I rewrote a full drop-in <code data-start="16510" data-end="16525">marketing.css</code> based on your updated palette and the structure we need for:</p>
<ul data-start="16587" data-end="16701">
<li data-section-id="6vfzui" data-start="16587" data-end="16599">
<p data-start="16589" data-end="16599">proof rail</p>
