<p data-start="85" data-end="400">I do have access to your Figma account/team context, but the two links you sent are <strong data-start="169" data-end="200">team search/community pages</strong>, not specific file URLs or node URLs. That means I can confirm the workspace exists, but I cannot do true node-level scouting, metadata extraction, or code-contract generation from those links alone.</p>
