<hr data-start="2373" data-end="2376">
<h1 data-section-id="e9yzvc" data-start="2378" data-end="2426">2. Phase B — targeted “community-miner” result</h1>
<p data-start="2428" data-end="2592">Since I couldn’t mine a specific file/node from those workspace links, I’m giving you the <strong data-start="2518" data-end="2537">pattern classes</strong> I would mine and the winner I’d choose for this brand.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1g63m8" data-start="2594" data-end="2618">A. Proof rail pattern</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="1dx8u6a" data-start="2619" data-end="2664"><span role="text">Best fit: <strong data-start="2633" data-end="2664">technical credential ledger</strong></span></h3>
<p data-start="2665" data-end="2731">Not floating pills.<br data-start="2684" data-end="2687">
Not playful badges.<br data-start="2706" data-end="2709">
Not SaaS metric cards.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="1pqyt3b" data-start="2733" data-end="2753">Visual structure</h3>
<ul data-start="2754" data-end="2939">
<li data-section-id="1k7ym4b" data-start="2754" data-end="2775">
<p data-start="2756" data-end="2775">one horizontal band</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1np4cxg" data-start="2776" data-end="2802">
<p data-start="2778" data-end="2802">6 equal cells on desktop</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="5vwtmr" data-start="2803" data-end="2823">
<p data-start="2805" data-end="2823">quiet top hairline</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="h38v6s" data-start="2824" data-end="2854">
<p data-start="2826" data-end="2854">white / surface-2 background</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="z9tn58" data-start="2855" data-end="2869">
<p data-start="2857" data-end="2869">thin borders</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1pxvdc2" data-start="2870" data-end="2897">
<p data-start="2872" data-end="2897">restrained icon treatment</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1uhnnjy" data-start="2898" data-end="2917">
<p data-start="2900" data-end="2917">strong value line</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1n9yc8g" data-start="2918" data-end="2939">
<p data-start="2920" data-end="2939">softer support line</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="1a6uttu" data-start="2941" data-end="2964">Why it fits Pacific</h3>
<p data-start="2965" data-end="2974">It reads:</p>
<ul data-start="2975" data-end="3036">
<li data-section-id="1eko87n" data-start="2975" data-end="2983">
<p data-start="2977" data-end="2983">formal</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="zalquo" data-start="2984" data-end="2996">
<p data-start="2986" data-end="2996">engineered</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="101mv3s" data-start="2997" data-end="3019">
<p data-start="2999" data-end="3019">documentation-minded</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="wnm2j1" data-start="3020" data-end="3036">
<p data-start="3022" data-end="3036">not decorative</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3038" data-end="3068">That is right for your buyers.</p>
<hr data-start="3070" data-end="3073">
<h2 data-section-id="1ug1vyf" data-start="3075" data-end="3105">B. Project evidence pattern</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="1w7rnks" data-start="3106" data-end="3145"><span role="text">Best fit: <strong data-start="3120" data-end="3145">split evidence module</strong></span></h3>
<ul data-start="3146" data-end="3237">
<li data-section-id="4dt0a9" data-start="3146" data-end="3180">
<p data-start="3148" data-end="3180">left = rotating project snippets</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="q7z0we" data-start="3181" data-end="3202">
<p data-start="3183" data-end="3202">right = compact map</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1sodjjp" data-start="3203" data-end="3237">
<p data-start="3205" data-end="3237">bottom row = subtle legend + CTA</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3239" data-end="3259">This is better than:</p>
<ul data-start="3260" data-end="3358">
<li data-section-id="131foo" data-start="3260" data-end="3292">
<p data-start="3262" data-end="3292">a full dashboard-style browser</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1g9gbuc" data-start="3293" data-end="3312">
<p data-start="3295" data-end="3312">a masonry gallery</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1d0ynyc" data-start="3313" data-end="3334">
<p data-start="3315" data-end="3334">a giant county list</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="q7max3" data-start="3335" data-end="3358">
<p data-start="3337" data-end="3358">a map-first interface</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="1a6uttu" data-start="3360" data-end="3383">Why it fits Pacific</h3>
<p data-start="3384" data-end="3514">The right question on home is not “let me browse everything.”<br>
It is:<br>
<strong data-start="3453" data-end="3514">“Show me enough real work, in this region, to trust you.”</strong></p>
<hr data-start="3516" data-end="3519">
<h2 data-section-id="1hmk9nb" data-start="3521" data-end="3546">C. Testimonial pattern</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="c75e0z" data-start="3547" data-end="3583"><span role="text">Best fit: <strong data-start="3561" data-end="3583">single proof quote</strong></span></h3>
<p data-start="3584" data-end="3610">Not full carousel on home.</p>
<p data-start="3612" data-end="3772">Use one strong quote that references an actual operating constraint.<br>
Your earlier testimonial example about keeping a parking structure open is the right shape.</p>
<p data-start="3774" data-end="3816">The homepage testimonial should feel like:</p>
<ul data-start="3817" data-end="3858">
<li data-section-id="wmco3x" data-start="3817" data-end="3833">
<p data-start="3819" data-end="3833">outcome-driven</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="123r1ew" data-start="3834" data-end="3844">
<p data-start="3836" data-end="3844">specific</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="17nsm34" data-start="3845" data-end="3858">
<p data-start="3847" data-end="3858">operational</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3860" data-end="3874">Not emotional.</p>
<hr data-start="3876" data-end="3879">
<h2 data-section-id="y3ekw2" data-start="3881" data-end="3910">D. Estimate/intake pattern</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="smjszf" data-start="3911" data-end="3952"><span role="text">Best fit: <strong data-start="3925" data-end="3952">teaser, not centerpiece</strong></span></h3>
<p data-start="3953" data-end="4041">On home, use a teaser card or CTA row.<br>
Save the multi-step estimator for contact/intake.</p>
<hr data-start="4043" data-end="4046">
<h1 data-section-id="1bpuhd7" data-start="4048" data-end="4082">3. Selected component directions</h1>
<p data-start="4084" data-end="4132">These are the directions I would actually build.</p>
<hr data-start="4134" data-end="4137">
<h2 data-section-id="iv82g9" data-start="4139" data-end="4161"><span role="text"><code data-start="4142" data-end="4161">HomeProofRail.tsx</code></span></h2>
<h3 data-section-id="o60jss" data-start="4162" data-end="4177">Best layout</h3>
<ul data-start="4178" data-end="4352">
<li data-section-id="ajyi6t" data-start="4178" data-end="4204">
<p data-start="4180" data-end="4204">sits directly under hero</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="hydt1m" data-start="4205" data-end="4222">
<p data-start="4207" data-end="4222">6 items desktop</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="12wacxm" data-start="4223" data-end="4238">
<p data-start="4225" data-end="4238">3x2 on tablet</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1r61fy9" data-start="4239" data-end="4264">
<p data-start="4241" data-end="4264">stacked cards on mobile</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="19z4twd" data-start="4265" data-end="4303">
<p data-start="4267" data-end="4303">1 icon, 1 bold value, 1 support line</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="rtbl09" data-start="4304" data-end="4317">
<p data-start="4306" data-end="4317">no carousel</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="104pmaj" data-start="4318" data-end="4352">
<p data-start="4320" data-end="4352">no animation beyond subtle hover</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="m6rjj" data-start="4354" data-end="4370">Best content</h3>
<p data-start="4371" data-end="4390">Use this exact set:</p>
<ol data-start="4392" data-end="4802">
<li data-section-id="1awgu91" data-start="4392" data-end="4441">
<p data-start="4395" data-end="4441"><strong data-start="4395" data-end="4408">40+ Years</strong><br data-start="4408" data-end="4411">
Bay Area project experience</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="jjqrmk" data-start="4443" data-end="4513">
<p data-start="4446" data-end="4513"><strong data-start="4446" data-end="4464">PE / QSD / QSP</strong><br data-start="4464" data-end="4467">
In-house engineering and compliance support</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="c88u4h" data-start="4515" data-end="4572">
<p data-start="4518" data-end="4572"><strong data-start="4518" data-end="4533">Class A &amp; B</strong><br data-start="4533" data-end="4536">
Contractor-backed field execution</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="68nfvv" data-start="4574" data-end="4649">
<p data-start="4577" data-end="4649"><strong data-start="4577" data-end="4597">Public + Private</strong><br data-start="4597" data-end="4600">
Municipal, infrastructure, and commercial work</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="mo3fii" data-start="4651" data-end="4727">
<p data-start="4654" data-end="4727"><strong data-start="4654" data-end="4671">Permit Fluent</strong><br data-start="4671" data-end="4674">
Regional coordination and documentation discipline</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ouw4gm" data-start="4729" data-end="4802">
<p data-start="4732" data-end="4802"><strong data-start="4732" data-end="4747">Field-Ready</strong><br data-start="4747" data-end="4750">
Constructability, phasing, and closeout awareness</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-section-id="a1ek6v" data-start="4804" data-end="4820">Design notes</h3>
<ul data-start="4821" data-end="5004">
<li data-section-id="1f66qwl" data-start="4821" data-end="4859">
<p data-start="4823" data-end="4859">keep icons monochrome or cyan-tinted</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ukz5j5" data-start="4860" data-end="4894">
<p data-start="4862" data-end="4894">use top eyebrow labels sparingly</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1hkxhlc" data-start="4895" data-end="4941">
<p data-start="4897" data-end="4941">keep support lines under 6 words if possible</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1p3nb6" data-start="4942" data-end="5004">
<p data-start="4944" data-end="5004">use your new token system, not Tailwind-only color decisions</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="5006" data-end="5009">
<h2 data-section-id="1o2oacd" data-start="5011" data-end="5039"><span role="text"><code data-start="5014" data-end="5039">HomeProjectEvidence.tsx</code></span></h2>
<h3 data-section-id="o60jss" data-start="5040" data-end="5055">Best layout</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="5056" data-end="5421"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>-----------------------------------------</span><br><span>| intro + CTA                            |</span><br><span>|----------------------------------------|</span><br><span>| rotating snippets | mini map           |</span><br><span>|                  |                     |</span><br><span>|----------------------------------------|</span><br><span>| legend                    view all -&gt;  |</span><br><span>-----------------------------------------</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<h3 data-section-id="zzmv8k" data-start="5423" data-end="5450">Best section intro copy</h3>
<p data-start="5451" data-end="5654"><strong data-start="5451" data-end="5495">Relevant Work Across Northern California</strong><br data-start="5495" data-end="5498">
Selected infrastructure, utility, public works, and institutional projects that show how Pacific supports real-world delivery, compliance, and coordination.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="13ie8k" data-start="5656" data-end="5674">Why this works</h3>
<p data-start="5675" data-end="5749">It is credible and restrained.<br>
It feels like evidence, not a sales widget.</p>
<hr data-start="5751" data-end="5754">
<h2 data-section-id="sjb49x" data-start="5756" data-end="5786"><span role="text"><code data-start="5759" data-end="5786">ProjectSnippetRotator.tsx</code></span></h2>
<h3 data-section-id="2zicgk" data-start="5787" data-end="5812">Best anatomy per card</h3>
<ul data-start="5813" data-end="5921">
<li data-section-id="1qmlpa9" data-start="5813" data-end="5828">
<p data-start="5815" data-end="5828">category pill</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1hvdobh" data-start="5829" data-end="5844">
<p data-start="5831" data-end="5844">project title</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="whxzxx" data-start="5845" data-end="5855">
<p data-start="5847" data-end="5855">location</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ynkww5" data-start="5856" data-end="5877">
<p data-start="5858" data-end="5877">2-item metadata row</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="avj33h" data-start="5878" data-end="5894">
<p data-start="5880" data-end="5894">proof sentence</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1lgxziz" data-start="5895" data-end="5921">
<p data-start="5897" data-end="5921">tiny “view project” link</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="2ald2d" data-start="5923" data-end="5939">Visual style</h3>
<ul data-start="5940" data-end="6087">
<li data-section-id="1utbefo" data-start="5940" data-end="5956">
<p data-start="5942" data-end="5956">vertical stack</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1yn5n4k" data-start="5957" data-end="5974">
<p data-start="5959" data-end="5974">one active card</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="j7r8jc" data-start="5975" data-end="6005">
<p data-start="5977" data-end="6005">other cards slightly quieter</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1h295f4" data-start="6006" data-end="6051">
<p data-start="6008" data-end="6051">active card gets stronger border and shadow</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ozcstw" data-start="6052" data-end="6087">
<p data-start="6054" data-end="6087">no aggressive auto-rotation speed</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="qzu6dy" data-start="6089" data-end="6099">Timing</h3>
<p data-start="6100" data-end="6119">If you auto-rotate:</p>
<ul data-start="6120" data-end="6222">
<li data-section-id="1kqey10" data-start="6120" data-end="6139">
<p data-start="6122" data-end="6139">every 6–7 seconds</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="7xl68t" data-start="6140" data-end="6156">
<p data-start="6142" data-end="6156">pause on hover</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="19226ns" data-start="6157" data-end="6186">
<p data-start="6159" data-end="6186">manual next/prev on desktop</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="4m8nlr" data-start="6187" data-end="6222">
<p data-start="6189" data-end="6222">swipe on mobile if you want later</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="6224" data-end="6227">
<h2 data-section-id="bldb0e" data-start="6229" data-end="6252"><span role="text"><code data-start="6232" data-end="6252">ProjectMiniMap.tsx</code></span></h2>
<h3 data-section-id="tvc70w" data-start="6253" data-end="6270">Best approach</h3>
<p data-start="6271" data-end="6317">Do <strong data-start="6274" data-end="6281">not</strong> build a full GIS product into home.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="1hs050t" data-start="6319" data-end="6325">Do</h3>
<ul data-start="6326" data-end="6441">
<li data-section-id="jv045m" data-start="6326" data-end="6343">
<p data-start="6328" data-end="6343">lightweight map</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="avt90d" data-start="6344" data-end="6366">
<p data-start="6346" data-end="6366">curated markers only</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="hnmer0" data-start="6367" data-end="6399">
<p data-start="6369" data-end="6399">marker hover sync with snippet</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1o122y8" data-start="6400" data-end="6415">
<p data-start="6402" data-end="6415">subtle legend</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1jbg0e5" data-start="6416" data-end="6441">
<p data-start="6418" data-end="6441">static regional framing</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="6ywige" data-start="6443" data-end="6452">Don’t</h3>
<ul data-start="6453" data-end="6555">
<li data-section-id="1bo8bo7" data-start="6453" data-end="6482">
<p data-start="6455" data-end="6482">ship full filtering on home</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="2spqfm" data-start="6483" data-end="6516">
<p data-start="6485" data-end="6516">show full county coverage table</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1m8hk8p" data-start="6517" data-end="6555">
<p data-start="6519" data-end="6555">overload the component with metadata</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="13dvss9" data-start="6557" data-end="6575">Marker palette</h3>
<p data-start="6576" data-end="6580">Use:</p>
<ul data-start="6581" data-end="6692">
<li data-section-id="1g4b9f1" data-start="6581" data-end="6614">
<p data-start="6583" data-end="6614">blue = featured / institutional</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1il5pdd" data-start="6615" data-end="6651">
<p data-start="6617" data-end="6651">teal = completed / utility / water</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="5g88ku" data-start="6652" data-end="6692">
<p data-start="6654" data-end="6692">orange = active / phased / field-heavy</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="6694" data-end="6724">Keep this semantically stable.</p>
<hr data-start="6726" data-end="6729">
<h2 data-section-id="1dm1jl1" data-start="6731" data-end="6750"><span role="text"><code data-start="6734" data-end="6750">WhyPacific.tsx</code></span></h2>
<p data-start="6751" data-end="6810">You said to weight this more heavily than delivery. Agreed.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="h1ehsa" data-start="6812" data-end="6858">Reframe the current section into 4 reasons</h3>
<ol data-start="6859" data-end="7345">
<li data-section-id="1ea8xa1" data-start="6859" data-end="6976">
<p data-start="6862" data-end="6976"><strong data-start="6862" data-end="6903">Engineering Informed by Field Reality</strong><br data-start="6903" data-end="6906">
Planning shaped by how work gets built, sequenced, and coordinated.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1o3xg9i" data-start="6978" data-end="7097">
<p data-start="6981" data-end="7097"><strong data-start="6981" data-end="7020">Bay Area Jurisdictional Familiarity</strong><br data-start="7020" data-end="7023">
Stronger permit coordination across local agencies and site conditions.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="gkxwfz" data-start="7099" data-end="7211">
<p data-start="7102" data-end="7211"><strong data-start="7102" data-end="7137">Compliance-Minded Documentation</strong><br data-start="7137" data-end="7140">
SWPPP, inspections, reporting, and closeout handled with discipline.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1n470qu" data-start="7213" data-end="7345">
<p data-start="7216" data-end="7345"><strong data-start="7216" data-end="7269">Integrated Engineering + Construction Perspective</strong><br data-start="7269" data-end="7272">
One team that understands both design intent and delivery constraints.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-section-id="18chnci" data-start="7347" data-end="7364">Design change</h3>
<p data-start="7365" data-end="7539">Your current “Why Pacific Engineering?” section is close, but the left card plus generic right image is still a little too brochure-like <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2ol_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Pasted text</p></button></span></p>
<p data-start="7541" data-end="7562">I would turn it into:</p>
<ul data-start="7563" data-end="7716">
<li data-section-id="1pt6v6y" data-start="7563" data-end="7580">
<p data-start="7565" data-end="7580">left: 4 reasons</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1o93e0k" data-start="7581" data-end="7641">
<p data-start="7583" data-end="7641">right: one featured project image or technical image block</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="17b9zbw" data-start="7642" data-end="7670">
<p data-start="7644" data-end="7670">one anchored proof callout</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1hjz2ew" data-start="7671" data-end="7716">
<p data-start="7673" data-end="7716">remove anything that feels generic or stock</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="7718" data-end="7721">
<h1 data-section-id="1kf63xd" data-start="7723" data-end="7778">4. Best project seed set from your uploaded materials</h1>
