nstallation, hazardous materials planning, and stormwater monitoring across public utility infrastructure work."</span><span>,</span><br><span>    markerId: </span><span class="ͼr">"sfpuc"</span><span>,</span><br><span>  },</span><br><span>  {</span><br><span>    id: </span><span class="ͼr">"sfo-terminal-3"</span><span>,</span><br><span>    slug: </span><span class="ͼr">"sfo-terminal-3-boarding-area-e"</span><span>,</span><br><span>    category: </span><span class="ͼr">"Aviation"</span><span>,</span><br><span>    title: </span><span class="ͼr">"Terminal 3 / Boarding Area E"</span><span>,</span><br><span>    location: </span><span class="ͼr">"San Francisco, CA"</span><span>,</span><br><span>    meta: </span><span class="ͼr">"Design-Build / Civil / Utility Installation"</span><span>,</span><br><span>    proof:</span><br><span>      </span><span class="ͼr">"Delivered civil design support, SWPPP and erosion planning, survey, and storm/water utility installation for a major airport project."</span><span>,</span><br><span>    markerId: </span><span class="ͼr">"sfo"</span><span>,</span><br><span>  },</span><br><span>  {</span><br><span>    id: </span><span class="ͼr">"medical-examiner"</span><span>,</span><br><span>    slug: </span><span class="ͼr">"chief-medical-examiner-building"</span><span>,</span><br><span>    category: </span><span class="ͼr">"Civic"</span><span>,</span><br><span>    title: </span><span class="ͼr">"Construction Survey + Excavation Support"</span><span>,</span><br><span>    location: </span><span class="ͼr">"San Francisco, CA"</span><span>,</span><br><span>    meta: </span><span class="ͼr">"Survey / Structural Support / Excavation"</span><span>,</span><br><span>    proof:</span><br><span>      </span><span class="ͼr">"Provided staking, utility potholing investigation, and excavation support for critical foundation elements."</span><span>,</span><br><span>    markerId: </span><span class="ͼr">"medical-examiner"</span><span>,</span><br><span>  },</span>