<hr data-start="14626" data-end="14629">
<h1 data-section-id="h9ahh1" data-start="14631" data-end="14670">6. The strongest first visual attempt</h1>
<p data-start="14672" data-end="14708">This is the one I would build first.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1d0uqm7" data-start="14710" data-end="14735">Attempt 1 — Proof rail</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="1wjiw8s" data-start="14736" data-end="14754">Visual formula</h3>
<ul data-start="14755" data-end="15131">
<li data-section-id="1nnlok5" data-start="14755" data-end="14788">
<p data-start="14757" data-end="14788">background: <code data-start="14769" data-end="14788">var(--pe-surface)</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1s6yk0n" data-start="14789" data-end="14840">
<p data-start="14791" data-end="14840">outer shell: <code data-start="14804" data-end="14840">border: 1px solid var(--pe-border)</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="a0fapw" data-start="14841" data-end="14857">
<p data-start="14843" data-end="14857">radius: <code data-start="14851" data-end="14857">24px</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="7jilb1" data-start="14858" data-end="14889">
<p data-start="14860" data-end="14889">shadow: <code data-start="14868" data-end="14889">var(--pe-shadow-sm)</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="18j91ea" data-start="14890" data-end="14943">
<p data-start="14892" data-end="14943">top accent line using a subtle blue → cyan gradient</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1jtsrap" data-start="14944" data-end="14989">
<p data-start="14946" data-end="14989">each cell separated by 1px vertical divider</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="gwnoba" data-start="14990" data-end="15044">
<p data-start="14992" data-end="15044">icon in a rounded square using <code data-start="15023" data-end="15044">var(--pe-surface-3)</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="2fcqux" data-start="15045" data-end="15087">
<p data-start="15047" data-end="15087">strong value line using <code data-start="15071" data-end="15087">var(--pe-text)</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1mxfwz2" data-start="15088" data-end="15131">
<p data-start="15090" data-end="15131">support line using <code data-start="15109" data-end="15131">var(--pe-text-muted)</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="1yohfm2" data-start="15133" data-end="15145">Behavior</h3>
<ul data-start="15146" data-end="15235">
<li data-section-id="pbl6qk" data-start="15146" data-end="15185">
<p data-start="15148" data-end="15185">on hover: border strengthens slightly</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="dmak5n" data-start="15186" data-end="15211">
<p data-start="15188" data-end="15211">no lift bigger than 2px</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1464n8a" data-start="15212" data-end="15235">
<p data-start="15214" data-end="15235">no dramatic animation</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="1xxfhz4" data-start="15237" data-end="15244">Why</h3>
<p data-start="15245" data-end="15315">It feels precise, engineered, and premium without becoming agency-ish.</p>
<hr data-start="15317" data-end="15320">
<h2 data-section-id="mbem75" data-start="15322" data-end="15359">Attempt 2 — Project evidence block</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="1wjiw8s" data-start="15360" data-end="15378">Visual formula</h3>
<ul data-start="15379" data-end="15570">
<li data-section-id="79dc2t" data-start="15379" data-end="15419">
<p data-start="15381" data-end="15419">left column = stack of 3 visible cards</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ylw4y3" data-start="15420" data-end="15466">
<p data-start="15422" data-end="15466">active card = <code data-start="15436" data-end="15445">pe-card</code> with stronger border</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="2cefmd" data-start="15467" data-end="15518">
<p data-start="15469" data-end="15518">right column = muted map card on <code data-start="15502" data-end="15518">--pe-surface-2</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1cjg455" data-start="15519" data-end="15543">
<p data-start="15521" data-end="15543">small legend below map</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="4hb6wg" data-start="15544" data-end="15570">
<p data-start="15546" data-end="15570">CTA aligned bottom-right</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="mvlk21" data-start="15572" data-end="15589">Section label</h3>
<p data-start="15590" data-end="15643">Use a small technical eyebrow:<br>
<strong data-start="15621" data-end="15643">PROJECT EXPERIENCE</strong></p>
<h3 data-section-id="ncdalr" data-start="15645" data-end="15662">Section title</h3>
<p data-start="15663" data-end="15707"><strong data-start="15663" data-end="15707">Selected Work Across Northern California</strong></p>
<h3 data-section-id="oqgf5g" data-start="15709" data-end="15728">Supporting text</h3>
<p data-start="15729" data-end="15878">“Representative infrastructure, institutional, and utility work showing how Pacific supports constructability, compliance, and coordinated delivery.”</p>
<hr data-start="15880" data-end="15883">
<h1 data-section-id="1prinv" data-start="15885" data-end="15913">7. Updated part 9 sequence</h1>
<p data-start="15915" data-end="15976">Given your latest status, I would now run the plan like this:</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1uuu1ut" data-start="15978" data-end="15988">Slice 0</h2>
<p data-start="15989" data-end="16036">Keep the two repo trees in working memory only.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1uuu1us" data-start="16038" data-end="16048">Slice 1</h2>
<p data-start="16049" data-end="16105">You already dropped in the fuller <code data-start="16083" data-end="16098">marketing.css</code>. Good.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1uuu1uv" data-start="16107" data-end="16117">Slice 2</h2>
<p data-start="16118" data-end="16146">Build <code data-start="16124" data-end="16139">HomeProofRail</code> first.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1uuu1uu" data-start="16148" data-end="16158">Slice 3</h2>
<p data-start="16159" data-end="16360">Move the current service-badges out of the services intro and into the proof rail. They are currently living below the services heading instead of under the hero <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2pa_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Pasted text</p></button></span></p>
<h2 data-section-id="1uuu1up" data-start="16362" data-end="16372">Slice 4</h2>
<p data-start="16373" data-end="16540">Build <code data-start="16379" data-end="16400">HomeProjectEvidence</code> using the six uploaded project examples as the seed dataset <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2pb_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">example projects completed</p></button></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2pc_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">example projects completed</p></button></span></p>
<h2 data-section-id="1uuu1uo" data-start="16542" data-end="16552">Slice 5</h2>
<p data-start="16553" data-end="16813">Rebalance the mid-page so “Why Pacific Engineering?” becomes the heavier trust section. The current copy there is already close and aligns with your strongest brand differentiators <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2pd_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Pasted text</p></button></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2pe_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Union</p></button></span></p>
<h2 data-section-id="1uuu1ur" data-start="16815" data-end="16825">Slice 6</h2>
<p data-start="16826" data-end="16872">Expand the fuller map/gallery/testimonials on:</p>
<ul data-start="16873" data-end="16908">
<li data-section-id="zpmfkl" data-start="16873" data-end="16890">
<p data-start="16875" data-end="16890">project gallery</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="167zrhh" data-start="16891" data-end="16898">
<p data-start="16893" data-end="16898">about</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1vm9oo" data-start="16899" data-end="16908">
<p data-start="16901" data-end="16908">contact</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="1uuu1uq" data-start="16910" data-end="16920">Slice 7</h2>
<p data-start="16921" data-end="16997">Later: decide which internal features stay active, get moved, or get parked.</p>
<hr data-start="16999" data-end="17002">
<h1 data-section-id="1k1w8sl" data-start="17004" data-end="17031">8. My blunt creative take</h1>
<p data-start="17033" data-end="17145">Your paralysis is not because you lack ideas.<br data-start="17078" data-end="17081">
It is because there are <strong data-start="17105" data-end="17144">too many possible visual directions</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="17147" data-end="17191">So I would lock these constraints right now:</p>
<ul data-start="17193" data-end="17378">
<li data-section-id="rvrl9e" data-start="17193" data-end="17217">
<p data-start="17195" data-end="17217">no playful card styles</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="bgjcr7" data-start="17218" data-end="17242">
<p data-start="17220" data-end="17242">no oversized gradients</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="117b6j3" data-start="17243" data-end="17280">
<p data-start="17245" data-end="17280">no “startup dashboard” home layouts</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="m3yif9" data-start="17281" data-end="17302">
<p data-start="17283" data-end="17302">no soft consumer UI</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="obzwaa" data-start="17303" data-end="17344">
<p data-start="17305" data-end="17344">no over-decorated testimonial treatment</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="13uoi42" data-start="17345" data-end="17378">
<p data-start="17347" data-end="17378">no full map application on home</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="17380" data-end="17410">And I would lock these truths:</p>
<ul data-start="17412" data-end="17651">
<li data-section-id="7qsbph" data-start="17412" data-end="17452">
<p data-start="17414" data-end="17452">Pacific should feel <strong data-start="17434" data-end="17452">field-literate</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="uta7ly" data-start="17453" data-end="17491">
<p data-start="17455" data-end="17491">Pacific should feel <strong data-start="17475" data-end="17491">permit-aware</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="74ni0h" data-start="17492" data-end="17533">
<p data-start="17494" data-end="17533">Pacific should feel <strong data-start="17514" data-end="17533">Bay Area fluent</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="94zcpg" data-start="17534" data-end="17578">
<p data-start="17536" data-end="17578">Pacific should feel <strong data-start="17556" data-end="17578">compliance-capable</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1rtb0gw" data-start="17579" data-end="17651">
<p data-start="17581" data-end="17651">Pacific should feel <strong data-start="17601" data-end="17651">construction-professional, not agency-precious</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="17653" data-end="17682">That is the aesthetic filter.</p>
<hr data-start="17684" data-end="17687">
<h2 data-section-id="5gbvhl" data-start="17689" data-end="17731">What I need next to go one level deeper</h2>
<p data-start="17732" data-end="17747">Send me either:</p>
<ol data-start="17749" data-end="17960">
<li data-section-id="t3l6c8" data-start="17749" data-end="17841">
<p data-start="17752" data-end="17841">a <strong data-start="17754" data-end="17793">specific Figma file URL or node URL</strong>, and I’ll do the real scout/contract pass, or</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1secegx" data-start="17842" data-end="17960">
<p data-start="17845" data-end="17960">the current contents of your empty component files, and I’ll turn them into tighter first-pass TSX implementations.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="17962" data-end="18076" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">If you want the fastest unblocking move, send me just <code data-start="18016" data-end="18035">HomeProofRail.tsx</code> and I’ll draft the first real component.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="relative h-[60px] select-none"><div class="absolute h-[60px]" style="opacity: 1;"><button class="not-prose group/footnote border-token-border-default bg-token-main-surface-primary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 mt-3 mb-2 flex w-fit items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border py-2 ps-3 pe-2.5"><div class="text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-xs font-semibold">Sources</div></button></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></s