a-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-xs"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#b140e7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="f00c17fb-fc3c-4467-a39f-fbe21f7f10f5" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-4-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="24">I’ve got enough to move.</p>
<p data-start="26" data-end="851">I inspected the Figma node you linked and cross-checked it against your current <code data-start="106" data-end="116">Home.tsx</code>, the new <code data-start="126" data-end="141">marketing.css</code>, the placeholder component files, and the uploaded project sheets. Your current home still concentrates a lot of visual energy in the hero, while the trust badges you want are still living under the services intro instead of directly below the hero <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2pt_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2pu_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span>. The new <code data-start="476" data-end="491">marketing.css</code> now has the right foundation for proof rail and project-evidence components, including dedicated token sections and helper classes for <code data-start="627" data-end="640">.proof-rail</code>, <code data-start="642" data-end="661">.project-evidence</code>, snippet cards, and mini-map markers <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2pv_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">marketing</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2q0_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">marketing</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2q1_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">marketing</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2q2_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">marketing</p></a></span>.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="5vced4" data-start="853" data-end="884">What the Figma node tells me</h2>
<p data-start="886" data-end="979">The node you sent is a <strong data-start="909" data-end="941">full “Relevant Work” section</strong>, not a homepage-mini version. It has:</p>
<ul data-start="980" data-end="1133">
<li data-section-id="sdkoor" data-start="980" data-end="1005">
<p data-start="982" data-end="1005">eyebrow + section title</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="qpf54n" data-start="1006" data-end="1018">
<p data-start="1008" data-end="1018">search bar</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="8f90zh" data-start="1019" data-end="1036">
<p data-start="1021" data-end="1036">two filter rows</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="weha7" data-start="1037" data-end="1054">
<p data-start="1039" data-end="1054">large map panel</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="18rjwja" data-start="1055" data-end="1080">
<p data-start="1057" data-end="1080">county coverage sidebar</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="15pad6x" data-start="1081" data-end="1089">
<p data-start="1083" data-end="1089">legend</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1i9b3p3" data-start="1090" data-end="1107">
<p data-start="1092" data-end="1107">card grid below</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="4jfj8i" data-start="1108" data-end="1133">
<p data-start="1110" data-end="1133">top-right grid/view CTA</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1135" data-end="1188">That is a very good <strong data-start="1155" data-end="1179">gallery/project page</strong> pattern.</p>
<p data-start="1190" data-end="1274">For the homepage, I would <strong data-start="1216" data-end="1223">not</strong> copy it literally. I would <strong data-start="1251" data-end="1273">compress its logic</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="1275" data-end="1571">
<li data-section-id="5ev9sa" data-start="1275" data-end="1317">
<p data-start="1277" data-end="1317">keep the <strong data-start="1286" data-end="1317">map + evidence relationship</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1tkh0ii" data-start="1318" data-end="1355">
<p data-start="1320" data-end="1355">keep the <strong data-start="1329" data-end="1355">clean Bay Area framing</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1reidnv" data-start="1356" data-end="1377">
<p data-start="1358" data-end="1377">keep the <strong data-start="1367" data-end="1377">legend</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1w2uog8" data-start="1378" data-end="1405">
<p data-start="1380" data-end="1405">remove the <strong data-start="1391" data-end="1405">search bar</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="z09kdm" data-start="1406" data-end="1440">
<p data-start="1408" data-end="1440">remove the <strong data-start="1419" data-end="1440">full filter stack</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="umsiax" data-start="1441" data-end="1481">
<p data-start="1443" data-end="1481">remove the <strong data-start="1454" data-end="1481">county coverage sidebar</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="90wn0x" data-start="1482" data-end="1537">
<p data-start="1484" data-end="1537">keep only <strong data-start="1494" data-end="1537">3 visible snippets + 1 active map state</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ymtba3" data-start="1538" data-end="1571">
<p data-start="1540" data-end="1571">add a clean CTA to full gallery</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1573" data-end="1698">So the Figma node becomes your <strong data-start="1604" data-end="1635">full gallery parent pattern</strong>, and the homepage component becomes its <strong data-start="1676" data-end="1697">distilled sibling</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="1700" data-end="1703">
<h1 data-section-id="tqml4i" data-start="1705" data-end="1737">What I recommend you build now</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="h1mc7q" data-start="1739" data-end="1764"><span role="text">1. <code data-start="1745" data-end="1764">HomeProofRail.tsx</code></span></h2>
<p data-start="1765" data-end="1812">This should be the first implemented component.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="65ljiv" data-start="1814" data-end="1834">Visual direction</h3>
<p data-start="1835" data-end="1890">Use the proof-rail language already in <code data-start="1874" data-end="1889">marketing.css</code>:</p>
<ul data-start="1891" data-end="2085">
<li data-section-id="1t8zs55" data-start="1891" data-end="1906">
<p data-start="1893" data-end="1906"><code data-start="1893" data-end="1906">.proof-rail</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="s666ru" data-start="1907" data-end="1928">
<p data-start="1909" data-end="1928"><code data-start="1909" data-end="1928">.proof-rail-inner</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1srmm62" data-start="1929" data-end="1944">
<p data-start="1931" data-end="1944"><code data-start="1931" data-end="1944">.proof-item</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1fv207w" data-start="1945" data-end="1965">
<p data-start="1947" data-end="1965"><code data-start="1947" data-end="1965">.proof-item-icon</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1o955gc" data-start="1966" data-end="1987">
<p data-start="1968" data-end="1987"><code data-start="1968" data-end="1987">.proof-item-value</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="n06cwh" data-start="1988" data-end="2085">
<p data-start="1990" data-end="2085"><code data-start="1990" data-end="2009">.proof-item-label</code> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2q3_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">marketing</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2q4_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/marketing.css" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">marketing</p></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="yrsfv8" data-start="2087" data-end="2117">Why this is the right move</h3>
<p data-start="2118" data-end="2197">The current services section already contains your strongest quick-proof items:</p>
<ul data-start="2198" data-end="2312">
<li data-section-id="afff00" data-start="2198" data-end="2211">
<p data-start="2200" data-end="2211">SF Bay Area</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1twuq6u" data-start="2212" data-end="2237">
<p data-start="2214" data-end="2237">Licensed PE / QSD / QSP</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="23d0y4" data-start="2238" data-end="2262">
<p data-start="2240" data-end="2262">Class A &amp; B Contractor</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="zs1mo6" data-start="2263" data-end="2312">
<p data-start="2265" data-end="2312">40+ Years <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2q5_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2314" data-end="2381">Those belong under the hero, not buried under the services heading.</p>
