<h2 data-section-id="1tmfni5" data-start="4266" data-end="4296"><span role="text">3. <code data-start="4272" data-end="4296">homeProjectSnippets.ts</code></span></h2>
<p data-start="4297" data-end="4364">These six are the right seed set from your uploaded project sheets.</p>
<p data-start="4366" data-end="4462">They are strong because they are recognizable, public/institutional, and operationally credible:</p>
<ul data-start="4463" data-end="4631">
<li data-section-id="1ahv4p6" data-start="4463" data-end="4486">
