<hr data-start="12868" data-end="12871">
<h2 data-section-id="uz1b8k" data-start="12873" data-end="12904"><span role="text">7. <code data-start="12879" data-end="12904">HomeProjectEvidence.tsx</code></span></h2>
<p data-start="12905" data-end="13203">This component should be a condensed sibling of your Figma “Relevant Work” section, not a copy of it. Your placeholder file already points the right way: intro top-left, snippet rotator left, map right, subtle legend, CTA to gallery, curated not filter-heavy <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2qm_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/components/HomeProjectEvidence.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/components/HomeProjectEvidence.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">HomeProjectEvidence</p></a></span></p>
<p data-start="13205" data-end="13209">Use:</p>
