<h3 data-section-id="pst7np" data-start="16121" data-end="16142">Insert after hero</h3>
<p data-start="16143" data-end="16246">Put these immediately after the hero closing <code data-start="16188" data-end="16200">&lt;/section&gt;</code> and before the current hero→services divider:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="16248" data-end="16300"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>TypeScript</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼv">&lt;HomeProofRail</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">/&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼn">&lt;</span><span class="ͼt">HomeProjectEvidence</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">/&gt;</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<h3 data-section-id="a9xvlj" data-start="16302" data-end="16317">Then remove</h3>
<p data-start="16318" data-end="16339">This row in services:</p>
<ul data-start="16340" data-end="16456">
<li data-section-id="afff00" data-start="16340" data-end="16353">
<p data-start="16342" data-end="16353">SF Bay Area</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1twuq6u" data-start="16354" data-end="16379">
<p data-start="16356" data-end="16379">Licensed PE / QSD / QSP</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="23d0y4" data-start="16380" data-end="16404">
<p data-start="16382" data-end="16404">Class A &amp; B Contractor</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1nqnrc6" data-start="16405" data-end="16456">
<p data-start="16407" data-end="16456">40+ Years <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2r0_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/62e26cdcd1871f742e0e6f2ef05ee8a500271112/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="16458" data-end="16527">Because once the proof rail exists, those badges are redundant there.</p>
<hr data-start="16529" data-end="16532">
<h2 data-section-id="678fyd" data-start="16534" data-end="16567">9. Best creative judgment call</h2>
<p data-start="16568" data-end="16651">You are not blocked by lack of style. You are blocked by too many valid directions.</p>
<p data-start="16653" data-end="16677">So I’d lock these rules:</p>
<ul data-start="16679" data-end="16976">
<li data-section-id="xqecms" data-start="16679" data-end="16722">
<p data-start="16681" data-end="16722">homepage evidence should feel <strong data-start="16711" data-end="16722">curated</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="15m1elr" data-start="16723" data-end="16753">
<p data-start="16725" data-end="16753">not everything needs to move</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="12js0ky" data-start="16754" data-end="16805">
<p data-start="16756" data-end="16805">the hero can lose 25–35% of its motion complexity</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="umxadb" data-start="16806" data-end="16870">
<p data-start="16808" data-end="16870">project evidence should feel like <strong data-start="16842" data-end="16851">proof</strong>, not like software</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="161xjbz" data-start="16871" data-end="16976">
<p data-start="16873" data-end="16976">“Why Pacific Engineering?” should read like <strong data-start="16917" data-end="16948">operational differentiation</strong>, not mission-statement copy</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="16978" data-end="16997">That is the filter.</p>
<hr data-start="16999" data-end="17002">
<h2 data-section-id="1m0smx7" data-start="17004" data-end="17023">What I need next</h2>
<p data-start="17024" data-end="17087">You’ve given me enough to move on the data and component shape.</p>
<p data-start="17089" data-end="17204">The next most useful thing would be <strong data-start="17125" data-end="17152">one more Figma node URL</strong> for whichever section you want me to canonize next:</p>
<ul data-start="17205" data-end="17303">
<li data-section-id="11vgk9r" data-start="17205" data-end="17227">
<p data-start="17207" data-end="17227">proof rail direction</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="b85vk7" data-start="17228" data-end="17252">
<p data-start="17230" data-end="17252">project evidence block</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ut4bmm" data-start="17253" data-end="17281">
<p data-start="17255" data-end="17281">“Why Pacific Engineering?”</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ew07ge" data-start="17282" data-end="17303">
<p data-start="17284" data-end="17303">featured work cards</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="17305" data-end="17401" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">If you want the fastest path, send the node for the section you’re actively designing right now.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="relative h-[60px] select-none"><div class="absolute h-[60px]" style="opacity: 1;"><button class="not-prose group/footnote border-token-border-default bg-token-main-surface-primary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 mt-3 mb-2 flex w-fit items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border py-2 ps-3 pe-2.5"><div class="flex flex-row-reverse gap-1"><div class="border-token-main-surface-primary bg-token-main-surface-primary flex items-center overflow-hidden group-hover/footnote:border-token-main-surface-secondary relative" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="icon-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></div></div></div><div class="text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-xs font-semibold">Sources</div></button></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="t