<p data-start="990" data-end="1092"><code data-start="990" data-end="1009">projectMarkers.ts</code> is clean and consistent with the snippet IDs <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2u2_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/data/projectMarkers.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/data/projectMarkers.ts" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">projectMarkers</p></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1094" data-end="1282"><code data-start="1094" data-end="1114">ProjectMiniMap.tsx</code> is also correctly aligned with the intended “not a full GIS tool” approach and is already using your curated marker model cleanly <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2u3_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/components/ProjectMiniMap.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/components/ProjectMiniMap.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">ProjectMiniMap</p></a></span></p>
<p data-start="1284" data-end="1426"><code data-start="1284" data-end="1311">ProjectSnippetRotator.tsx</code> is structurally good and reads like the right homepage evidence card pattern <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2u4_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/components/ProjectSnippetRotator.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/components/ProjectSnippetRotator.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">ProjectSnippetRotator</p></a></span></p>
<hr data-start="1428" data-end="1431">
<h2 data-section-id="19z3izv" data-start="1433" data-end="1490">The few things I would tighten before the next preview</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="cktx2a" data-start="1492" data-end="1544"><span role="text">1. <code data-start="1499" data-end="1512">useCallback</code> is still imported in <code data-start="1534" data-end="1544">Home.tsx</code></span></h3>
<p data-start="1545" data-end="1648">It is no longer used, so it should be removed to avoid lint noise <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2u5_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span></p>
<h3 data-section-id="1xoh47v" data-start="1650" data-end="1714"><span role="text">2. <code data-start="1657" data-end="1678">FloatingParticles()</code> is commented out, not fully removed</span></h3>
<p data-start="1715" data-end="1885">That is harmless, but it is still dead code sitting in <code data-start="1770" data-end="1780">Home.tsx</code>. I would delete the whole helper entirely on the next cleanup pass <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2u6_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span></p>
<h3 data-section-id="ddpko0" data-start="1887" data-end="1937">3. The services trust-badge row is still there</h3>
<p data-start="1938" data-end="2201">You already know this, and you intentionally kept it for now. That is fine. Just be aware that if the proof rail reads well in preview, that row should be the next thing to remove because it becomes duplicated proof content <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2u7_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span></p>
<h3 data-section-id="ky80vb" data-start="2203" data-end="2280">4. Mobile/touch interaction on the project evidence needs one improvement</h3>
<p data-start="2281" data-end="2291">Right now:</p>
<ul data-start="2292" data-end="2514">
<li data-section-id="zony6z" data-start="2292" data-end="2365">
<p data-start="2294" data-end="2365"><code data-start="2294" data-end="2317">ProjectSnippetRotator</code> activates cards on <code data-start="2337" data-end="2351">onMouseEnter</code> and <code data-start="2356" data-end="2365">onFocus</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="7rcnyu" data-start="2366" data-end="2514">
<p data-start="2368" data-end="2514"><code data-start="2368" data-end="2384">ProjectMiniMap</code> activates markers on <code data-start="2406" data-end="2420">onMouseEnter</code> and <code data-start="2425" data-end="2434">onFocus</code> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2u8_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/components/ProjectSnippetRotator.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/components/ProjectSnippetRotator.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">ProjectSnippetRotator</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2u9_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/components/ProjectMiniMap.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/components/ProjectMiniMap.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">ProjectMiniMap</p></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2516" data-end="2575">That is okay on desktop, but for touch devices I would add:</p>
<ul data-start="2576" data-end="2711">
<li data-section-id="19dv7pb" data-start="2576" data-end="2626">
<p data-start="2578" data-end="2626"><code data-start="2578" data-end="2611">onClick={() =&gt; onActivate(...)}</code> to map markers</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1j23rvh" data-start="2627" data-end="2711">
<p data-start="2629" data-end="2711">make snippet cards either clickable buttons or give them explicit touch activation</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2713" data-end="2764">That is the biggest functional tweak I’d make next.</p>
<hr data-start="2766" data-end="2769">
<h2 data-section-id="1x04vu2" data-start="2771" data-end="2784">My verdict</h2>
<p data-start="2786" data-end="2830">You are <strong data-start="2794" data-end="2829">past the structural setup stage</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="2832" data-end="2876">The homepage now has the right architecture:</p>
<ul data-start="2877" data-end="2941">
<li data-section-id="1j34ayg" data-start="2877" data-end="2883">
<p data-start="2879" data-end="2883">hero</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="6vfzui" data-start="2884" data-end="2896">
<p data-start="2886" data-end="2896">proof rail</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1baiy26" data-start="2897" data-end="2915">
<p data-start="2899" data-end="2915">project evidence</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="160nw7a" data-start="2916" data-end="2926">
<p data-start="2918" data-end="2926">services</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="5g79ya" data-start="2927" data-end="2941">
<p data-start="2929" data-end="2941">rest of page</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2943" data-end="2971">That is the important shift.</p>
<p data-start="2973" data-end="3100">The current state is good enough to move into the <strong data-start="3023" data-end="3036">next pass</strong>, which should be less about plumbing and more about refinement.</p>
<hr data-start="3102" data-end="3105">
<h1 data-section-id="1u0t14d" data-start="3107" data-end="3130">Next pass I recommend</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="xxdg2r" data-start="3132" data-end="3184">Priority 1 — tighten project evidence interaction</h2>
<p data-start="3185" data-end="3231">Make the project evidence block feel polished:</p>
<ul data-start="3232" data-end="3351">
<li data-section-id="1izjvax" data-start="3232" data-end="3258">
<p data-start="3234" data-end="3258">add click/tap activation</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="19ce98j" data-start="3259" data-end="3303">
<p data-start="3261" data-end="3303">pause auto-rotation after user interaction</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ai1rsm" data-start="3304" data-end="3351">
<p data-start="3306" data-end="3351">optionally add next/prev controls for desktop</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="18l5g8t" data-start="3353" data-end="3409">Priority 2 — visual refinement of the evidence module</h2>
<p data-start="3410" data-end="3460">Right now the structure is right. Next I’d refine:</p>
<ul data-start="3461" data-end="3607">
<li data-section-id="1cfeg8a" data-start="3461" data-end="3490">
<p data-start="3463" data-end="3490">snippet card spacing rhythm</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ovzz48" data-start="3491" data-end="3513">
<p data-start="3493" data-end="3513">active card emphasis</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="h0ahlh" data-start="3514" data-end="3533">
<p data-start="3516" data-end="3533">map-shell styling</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="4ff7op" data-start="3534" data-end="3575">
<p data-start="3536" data-end="3575">marker hover/active animation restraint</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="mdnka7" data-start="3576" data-end="3607">
<p data-start="3578" data-end="3607">CTA placement under the block</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="w36wwo" data-start="3609" data-end="3659"><span role="text">Priority 3 — clean up <code data-start="3634" data-end="3659">Why Pacific Engineering</code></span></h2>
<p data-start="3660" data-end="3891">This should be the next major section refinement.<br>
Your current copy is strong, but the right-side visual is still generic compared with the stronger project-proof system you now have in place <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2ua_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/Home.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Home</p></a></span></p>
<p data-start="3893" data-end="3948">I would likely replace that stock-ish image block with:</p>
<ul data-start="3949" data-end="4041">
<li data-section-id="1o9tqdd" data-start="3949" data-end="3971">
<p data-start="3951" data-end="3971">a real project image</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="17v8h4g" data-start="3972" data-end="3997">
<p data-start="3974" data-end="3997">a tighter proof callout</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="5axj7v" data-start="3998" data-end="4041">
<p data-start="4000" data-end="4041">or a split proof/stat + image composition</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="mupjw" data-start="4043" data-end="4109">Priority 4 — remove duplicated services trust row after preview</h2>
<p data-start="4110" data-end="4143">If preview looks good, remove it.</p>
<hr data-start="4145" data-end="4148">
<h1 data-section-id="1rg4s9s" data-start="4150" data-end="4202">The two code changes I’d do first on the next pass</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="l55q19" data-start="4204" data-end="4240"><span role="text">A. In <code data-start="4213" data-end="4240">ProjectSnippetRotator.tsx</code></span></h2>
<p data-start="4241" data-end="4316">Convert each snippet card into a button-like interactive surface for touch.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="12eyb9" data-start="4318" data-end="4347"><span role="text">B. In <code data-start="4327" data-end="4347">ProjectMiniMap.tsx</code></span></h2>
<p data-start="4348" data-end="4414">Add <code data-start="4352" data-end="4391">onClick={() =&gt; onActivate(marker.id)}</code> to each marker button.</p>
<p data-start="4416" data-end="4498">Those two changes give you the biggest immediate improvement with the least churn.</p>
<hr data-start="4500" data-end="4503">
<p data-start="4505" data-end="4553">The next best move is for you to send me either:</p>
<ul data-start="4554" data-end="4681" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">
<li data-section-id="19pfhl1" data-start="4554" data-end="4603">
<p data-start="4556" data-end="4603">the preview result after you test this pass, or</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="fg0ml2" data-start="4604" data-end="4681" data-is-last-node="">
<p data-start="4606" data-end="4681" data-is-last-node="">the current <code data-start="4618" data-end="4643">Why Pacific Engineering</code> section you want me to refactor next.</p>
