3fa144d9" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-4-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="76">I split the repo into the two workspace sides we’ve been using conceptually.</p>
<p data-start="78" data-end="119">This split is grounded in the repo shape:</p>
<ul data-start="120" data-end="698">
<li data-section-id="1euu35k" data-start="120" data-end="318">
<p data-start="122" data-end="318">the live app is one root Vite/React/Express application with <code data-start="183" data-end="191">client</code> as the Vite root, <code data-start="210" data-end="218">shared</code> as a resolved alias, and <code data-start="244" data-end="261">attached_assets</code> as the asset alias <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2vn_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/vite.config.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/vite.config.ts" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">vite.config</p></a></span></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="32yg6b" data-start="319" data-end="526">
<p data-start="321" data-end="526">the three live surfaces are routed as separate portal apps: marketing, client, and internal <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2vo_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/MarketingApp.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/marketing/MarketingApp.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">MarketingApp</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2vp_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/client/ClientApp.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/client/ClientApp.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">ClientApp</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2vq_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/internal/InternalApp.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/client/src/portals/internal/InternalApp.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">InternalApp</p></a></span></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ojdbz2" data-start="527" data-end="698">
<p data-start="529" data-end="698">the mockup side is already a separate Vite app under <code data-start="582" data-end="608">artifacts/mockup-sandbox</code> with its own <code data-start="622" data-end="636">package.json</code>, scripts, and toolchain <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_2vr_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/artifacts/mockup-sandbox/package.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/branch_v2/artifacts/mockup-sandbox/package.json" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">package</p></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="1ryrwi5" data-start="700" data-end="729">Download the two zip packs</h2>
<ul data-start="731" data-end="950">
<li data-section-id="1n2jfhs" data-start="731" data-end="837">
<p data-start="733" data-end="837"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button">last_breath_active_platform_workspace.zip</button></span></p>
