<p data-start="291" data-end="472">That matches the route map in <code data-start="321" data-end="338">InternalApp.tsx</code>, which includes core delivery/admin surfaces alongside CRM, outreach, SEO, page-builder, AI sales, monitoring, and workflow tooling</p>
<h1 data-section-id="18400oz" data-start="474" data-end="528">Internal portal file tree, grouped by future posture</h1>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="530" data-end="1788"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>internal-portal/</span><br><span>├── A_core_ops_keep_together/</span><br><span>│   ├── dashboard</span><br><span>│   ├── project-dashboard</span><br><span>│   ├── project-manager</span><br><span>│   ├── project-detail</span><br><span>│   ├── requests</span><br><span>│   ├── contacts</span><br><span>│   ├── proposals</span><br><span>│   ├── invoices</span><br><span>│   ├── rfi</span><br><span>│   ├── doc-approval</span><br><span>│   ├── client-communications</span><br><span>│   ├── client-invites</span><br><span>│   ├── form-submissions</span><br><span>│   ├── users</span><br><span>│   ├── user-profile</span><br><span>│   ├── qaqc</span><br><span>│   └── geotechnical / inspection-adjacent items as they mature</span><br><span>│</span><br><span>├── B_platform_adjacent_keep_linked_but_logically_separate/</span><br><span>│   ├── crm-search</span><br><span>│   ├── outreach</span><br><span>│   ├── email-sequences</span><br><span>│   ├── sequence-optimization</span><br><span>│   ├── sales-bot-control</span><br><span>│   ├── ai-sales-assistant</span><br><span>│   ├── client-invites</span><br><span>│   ├── analytics</span><br><span>│   ├── workflow-builder</span><br><span>│   └── template-builder</span><br><span>│</span><br><span>├── C_content_web_presence_tools_future_spinout/</span><br><span>│   ├── page-builder</span><br><span>│   ├── seo-assistant</span><br><span>│   ├── content-manager</span><br><span>│   ├── website-monitoring</span><br><span>│   └── icp-settings</span><br><span>│</span><br><span>├── D_admin_and_cross_system_controls/</span><br><span>│   ├── admin</span><br><span>│   ├── settings</span><br><span>│   ├── permissions / users</span><br><span>│   ├── integrations</span><br><span>│   └── shared notifications / automations</span><br><span>│</span><br><span>└── E_future_vertical_apps/</span><br><span>    ├── inspections-platform</span><br><span>    ├── compliance-platform</span><br><span>    ├── sales-dev-platform</span><br><span>    ├── crm-platform</span><br><span>    └── active-bid-pool-monitoring-platform</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<h1 data-section-id="1j84ol5" data-start="1790" data-end="1821">Keep / pseudo-separate matrix</h1>
<div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div tabindex="-1" class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="1823" data-end="3800" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1823" data-end="1904"><tr data-start="1823" data-end="1904"><th data-start="1823" data-end="1830" data-col-size="sm" class="">Area</th><th data-start="1830" data-end="1864" data-col-size="sm" class="">Keep inside internal portal now</th><th data-start="1864" data-end="1886" data-col-size="sm" class="" style="text-align: right;">Pseudo-separate now</th><th data-start="1886" data-end="1904" data-col-size="md" class="">Future posture</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1924" data-end="3800"><tr data-start="1924" data-end="1988"><td data-start="1924" data-end="1936" data-col-size="sm">Dashboard</td><td data-start="1936" data-end="1942" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="1942" data-end="1947" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">No</td><td data-start="1947" data-end="1988" data-col-size="md">Remains home surface for internal ops</td></tr><tr data-start="1989" data-end="2064"><td data-start="1989" data-end="2028" data-col-size="sm">Project dashboard / manager / detail</td><td data-start="2028" data-end="2034" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="2034" data-end="2039" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">No</td><td data-start="2039" data-end="2064" data-col-size="md">Core operating system</td></tr><tr data-start="2065" data-end="2119"><td data-start="2065" data-end="2076" data-col-size="sm">Requests</td><td data-start="2076" data-end="2082" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="2082" data-end="2087" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">No</td><td data-start="2087" data-end="2119" data-col-size="md">Core intake and delivery ops</td></tr><tr data-start="2120" data-end="2179"><td data-start="2120" data-end="2131" data-col-size="sm">Contacts</td><td data-start="2131" data-end="2137" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="2137" data-end="2145" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">Light</td><td data-start="2145" data-end="2179" data-col-size="md">Could later dual-home with CRM</td></tr><tr data-start="2180" data-end="2245"><td data-start="2180" data-end="2192" data-col-size="sm">Proposals</td><td data-start="2192" data-end="2198" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="2198" data-end="2203" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">No</td><td data-start="2203" data-end="2245" data-col-size="md">Core revenue ops, stays tightly linked</td></tr><tr data-start="2246" data-end="2310"><td data-start="2246" data-end="2257" data-col-size="sm">Invoices</td><td data-start="2257" data-end="2263" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="2263" data-end="2268" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">No</td><td data-start="2268" data-end="2310" data-col-size="md">Core finance ops, stays tightly linked</td></tr><tr data-start="2311" data-end="2349"><td data-start="2311" data-end="2317" data-col-size="sm">RFI</td><td data-start="2317" data-end="2323" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="2323" data-end="2328" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">No</td><td data-start="2328" data-end="2349" data-col-size="md">Core delivery ops</td></tr><tr data-start="2350" data-end="2412"><td data-start="2350" data-end="2365" data-col-size="sm">Doc approval</td><td data-start="2365" data-end="2371" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="2371" data-end="2376" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">No</td><td data-start="2376" data-end="2412" data-col-size="md">Core delivery and compliance ops</td></tr><tr data-start="2413" data-end="2490"><td data-start="2413" data-end="2437" data-col-size="sm">Client communications</td><td data-start="2437" data-end="2443" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="2443" data-end="2451" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">Light</td><td data-start="2451" data-end="2490" data-col-size="md">Shared with future CRM/comms system</td></tr><tr data-start="2491" data-end="2556"><td data-start="2491" data-end="2508" data-col-size="sm">Client invites</td><td data-start="2508" data-end="2514" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="2514" data-end="2522" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">Light</td><td data-start="2522" data-end="2556" data-col-size="md">Shared auth/relationship layer</td></tr><tr data-start="2557" data-end="2610"><td data-start="2557" data-end="2576" data-col-size="sm">Form submissions</td><td data-start="2576" data-end="2582" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="2582" data-end="2587" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">No</td><td data-start="2587" data-end="2610" data-col-size="md">Core intake surface</td></tr><tr data-start="2611" data-end="2664"><td data-start="2611" data-end="2629" data-col-size="sm">Users / profile</td><td data-start="2629" data-end="2635" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="2635" data-end="2640" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">No</td><td data-start="2640" data-end="2664" data-col-size="md">Shared control plane</td></tr><tr data-start="2665" data-end="2744"><td data-start="2665" data-end="2673" data-col-size="sm">QA/QC</td><td data-start="2673" data-end="2679" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="2679" data-end="2684" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">No</td><td data-start="2684" data-end="2744" data-col-size="md">Core, and likely seed for inspection/compliance platform</td></tr><tr data-start="2745" data-end="2798"><td data-start="2745" data-end="2758" data-col-size="sm">CRM search</td><td data-start="2758" data-end="2764" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="2764" data-end="2774" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;"><strong data-start="2766" data-end="2773">Yes</strong></td><td data-start="2774" data-end="2798" data-col-size="md">Future sales/CRM app</td></tr><tr data-start="2799" data-end="2850"><td data-start="2799" data-end="2810" data-col-size="sm">Outreach</td><td data-start="2810" data-end="2816" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="2816" data-end="2826" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;"><strong data-start="2818" data-end="2825">Yes</strong></td><td data-start="2826" data-end="2850" data-col-size="md">Future sales-dev app</td></tr><tr data-start="2851" data-end="2909"><td data-start="2851" data-end="2869" data-col-size="sm">Email sequences</td><td data-start="2869" data-end="2875" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="2875" data-end="2885" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;"><strong data-start="2877" data-end="2884">Yes</strong></td><td data-start="2885" data-end="2909" data-col-size="md">Future sales-dev app</td></tr><tr data-start="2910" data-end="2974"><td data-start="2910" data-end="2934" data-col-size="sm">Sequence optimization</td><td data-start="2934" data-end="2940" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="2940" data-end="2950" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;"><strong data-start="2942" data-end="2949">Yes</strong></td><td data-start="2950" data-end="2974" data-col-size="md">Future sales-dev app</td></tr><tr data-start="2975" data-end="3048"><td data-start="2975" data-end="2995" data-col-size="sm">Sales bot control</td><td data-start="2995" data-end="3001" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="3001" data-end="3011" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;"><strong data-start="3003" data-end="3010">Yes</strong></td><td data-start="3011" data-end="3048" data-col-size="md">Future sales-dev / automation app</td></tr><tr data-start="3049" data-end="3129"><td data-start="3049" data-end="3070" data-col-size="sm">AI sales assistant</td><td data-start="3070" data-end="3076" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="3076" data-end="3086" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;"><strong data-start="3078" data-end="3085">Yes</strong></td><td data-start="3086" data-end="3129" data-col-size="md">Future sales-dev / CRM intelligence app</td></tr><tr data-start="3130" data-end="3198"><td data-start="3130" data-end="3142" data-col-size="sm">Analytics</td><td data-start="3142" data-end="3148" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="3148" data-end="3158" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;"><strong data-start="3150" data-end="3157">Yes</strong></td><td data-start="3158" data-end="3198" data-col-size="md">Could become shared platform service</td></tr><tr data-start="3199" data-end="3286"><td data-start="3199" data-end="3218" data-col-size="sm">Workflow builder</td><td data-start="3218" data-end="3224" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="3224" data-end="3234" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;"><strong data-start="3226" data-end="3233">Yes</strong></td><td data-start="3234" data-end="3286" data-col-size="md">Shared platform utility, not core portal surface</td></tr><tr data-start="3287" data-end="3349"><td data-start="3287" data-end="3306" data-col-size="sm">Template builder</td><td data-start="3306" data-end="3312" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="3312" data-end="3322" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;"><strong data-start="3314" data-end="3321">Yes</strong></td><td data-start="3322" data-end="3349" data-col-size="md">Shared platform utility</td></tr><tr data-start="3350" data-end="3423"><td data-start="3350" data-end="3365" data-col-size="sm">Page builder</td><td data-start="3365" data-end="3383" data-col-size="sm">Keep accessible</td><td data-start="3383" data-end="3393" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;"><strong data-start="3385" data-end="3392">Yes</strong></td><td data-start="3393" data-end="3423" data-col-size="md">Future web/content ops app</td></tr><tr data-start="3424" data-end="3498"><td data-start="3424" data-end="3440" data-col-size="sm">SEO assistant</td><td data-start="3440" data-end="3458" data-col-size="sm">Keep accessible</td><td data-start="3458" data-end="3468" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;"><strong data-start="3460" data-end="3467">Yes</strong></td><td data-start="3468" data-end="3498" data-col-size="md">Future web/content ops app</td></tr><tr data-start="3499" data-end="3575"><td data-start="3499" data-end="3517" data-col-size="sm">Content manager</td><td data-start="3517" data-end="3535" data-col-size="sm">Keep accessible</td><td data-start="3535" data-end="3545" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;"><strong data-start="3537" data-end="3544">Yes</strong></td><td data-start="3545" data-end="3575" data-col-size="md">Future web/content ops app</td></tr><tr data-start="3576" data-end="3668"><td data-start="3576" data-end="3597" data-col-size="sm">Website monitoring</td><td data-start="3597" data-end="3615" data-col-size="sm">Keep accessible</td><td data-start="3615" data-end="3625" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;"><strong data-start="3617" data-end="3624">Yes</strong></td><td data-start="3625" data-end="3668" data-col-size="md">Future web/content ops / monitoring app</td></tr><tr data-start="3669" data-end="3745"><td data-start="3669" data-end="3684" data-col-size="sm">ICP settings</td><td data-start="3684" data-end="3702" data-col-size="sm">Keep accessible</td><td data-start="3702" data-end="3712" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;"><strong data-start="3704" data-end="3711">Yes</strong></td><td data-start="3712" data-end="3745" data-col-size="md">Future GTM ops config surface</td></tr><tr data-start="3746" data-end="3800"><td data-start="3746" data-end="3765" data-col-size="sm">Admin / settings</td><td data-start="3765" data-end="3771" data-col-size="sm">Yes</td><td data-start="3771" data-end="3776" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">No</td><td data-start="3776" data-end="3800" data-col-size="md">Shared control plane</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 48.6562px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<h1 data-section-id="iyymn3" data-start="3802" data-end="3828">Practical interpretation</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="38lhhx" data-start="3830" data-end="3853">A. Keep together now</h2>
<p data-start="3854" data-end="3969">These are the pieces that should still feel like one internal workspace because they serve the same operating loop:</p>
<ul data-start="3971" data-end="4102">
<li data-section-id="12szgac" data-start="3971" data-end="3979">
<p data-start="3973" data-end="3979">intake</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="18jd95t" data-start="3980" data-end="3998">
<p data-start="3982" data-end="3998">project delivery</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="g8bije" data-start="3999" data-end="4014">
<p data-start="4001" data-end="4014">documentation</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="hxtgpq" data-start="4015" data-end="4036">
<p data-start="4017" data-end="4036">client coordination</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="e1qzxk" data-start="4037" data-end="4065">
<p data-start="4039" data-end="4065">proposal/invoice execution</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ytkwz1" data-start="4066" data-end="4102">
<p data-start="4068" data-end="4102">QA/QC and compliance-adjacent work</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4104" data-end="4153">That cluster is your real “internal portal core.”</p>
<h2 data-section-id="176947j" data-start="4155" data-end="4180">B. Pseudo-separate now</h2>
<p data-start="4181" data-end="4345">These are <strong data-start="4191" data-end="4232">not bloat in the sense of uselessness</strong>. They are bloat only in the sense that they are trying to live inside the same mental container as delivery ops.</p>
<p data-start="4347" data-end="4377">That applies most strongly to:</p>
<ul data-start="4379" data-end="4485">
<li data-section-id="fotd16" data-start="4379" data-end="4391">
<p data-start="4381" data-end="4391">CRM search</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="18prl97" data-start="4392" data-end="4402">
<p data-start="4394" data-end="4402">outreach</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="h3eyi0" data-start="4403" data-end="4420">
<p data-start="4405" data-end="4420">email sequences</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="14et9xy" data-start="4421" data-end="4444">
<p data-start="4423" data-end="4444">sequence optimization</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1f67ev2" data-start="4445" data-end="4464">
<p data-start="4447" data-end="4464">sales bot control</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="58qja4" data-start="4465" data-end="4485">
<p data-start="4467" data-end="4485">AI sales assistant</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4487" data-end="4637">These should remain available, but mentally and structurally they should start being treated as a <strong data-start="4585" data-end="4636">sales-dev / CRM / bid-pipeline operating system</strong>.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1tkhhn1" data-start="4639" data-end="4665">C. Future vertical apps</h2>
<p data-start="4666" data-end="4827">Given what you said about inspections, compliance, and bid monitoring becoming deeper software products, I would explicitly plan for these future app boundaries:</p>
<ul data-start="4829" data-end="4962">
<li data-section-id="3kd2ca" data-start="4829" data-end="4855">
<p data-start="4831" data-end="4855"><strong data-start="4831" data-end="4855">Inspections platform</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="npkw2y" data-start="4856" data-end="4881">
<p data-start="4858" data-end="4881"><strong data-start="4858" data-end="4881">Compliance platform</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ikj0m7" data-start="4882" data-end="4920">
<p data-start="4884" data-end="4920"><strong data-start="4884" data-end="4920">Sales development / CRM platform</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="k6gaqs" data-start="4921" data-end="4962">
<p data-start="4923" data-end="4962"><strong data-start="4923" data-end="4962">Active bid pool monitoring platform</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4964" data-end="5111">Not because they should be removed now, but because this is the cleanest way to stop internal from feeling like one giant undifferentiated machine.</p>
<h1 data-section-id="194kjjp" data-start="5113" data-end="5159">My recommendation for how to use this matrix</h1>
<p data-start="5161" data-end="5223">Use 3 labels only when you look at internal pages and modules:</p>
<ul data-start="5225" data-end="5288">
<li data-section-id="1o8qv84" data-start="5225" data-end="5244">
<p data-start="5227" data-end="5244"><strong data-start="5227" data-end="5244">Core Internal</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="a4r99y" data-start="5245" data-end="5266">
<p data-start="5247" data-end="5266"><strong data-start="5247" data-end="5266">Linked Platform</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="k37ebj" data-start="5267" data-end="5288">
<p data-start="5269" data-end="5288"><strong data-start="5269" data-end="5288">Future Vertical</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="5290" data-end="5324">That keeps the conversation clean.</p>
<p data-start="5326" data-end="5395">For your repo and workspace organization, I would map them like this:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="5397" data-end="5686"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Core Internal</span><br><span>  = keep open with project, proposal, invoice, docs, QA/QC, client comms</span><br><br><span>Linked Platform</span><br><span>  = keep callable/usable, but stop thinking of it as the same product</span><br><br><span>Future Vertical</span><br><span>  = roadmap it as its own product family even if it still lives here today</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<h1 data-section-id="1p2f81w" data-start="5688" data-end="5706">Blunt conclusion</h1>
<p data-start="5708" data-end="5764">Nothing in that portal needs to be treated as throwaway.</p>
<p data-start="5766" data-end="5841">But a lot of it should stop being treated as <strong data-start="5811" data-end="5827">the same app</strong> in your head.</p>
<p data-start="5843" data-end="5865">The cleanest split is:</p>
<ul data-start="5867" data-end="6043">
<li data-section-id="zd61q0" data-start="5867" data-end="5890">
<p data-start="5869" data-end="5890"><strong data-start="5869" data-end="5890">Internal core ops</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1p6jsn2" data-start="5891" data-end="5929">
<p data-start="5893" data-end="5929"><strong data-start="5893" data-end="5929">GTM / CRM / sales-dev operations</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="8qz0l4" data-start="5930" data-end="5958">
<p data-start="5932" data-end="5958"><strong data-start="5932" data-end="5958">Web/content operations</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="q02vg3" data-start="5959" data-end="6043">
<p data-start="5961" data-end="6043"><strong data-start="5961" data-end="5995">Future vertical operating apps</strong> for inspections, compliance, and bid monitoring</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="6045" data-end="6090">That is the matrix I would use going forward.</p>
<p data-start="6092" data-end="6180">The next strong artifact would be a <strong data-start="6128" data-end="6158">route-by-route relabel map</strong> in this exact format:</p>
<p data-start="6182" data-end="6288" data-is-only-node=""><code data-start="6182" data-end="6288">route -&gt; current purpose -&gt; label (Core Internal / Linked Platform / Future Vertical) -&gt; future app home</code></p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Good response" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="good-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#51753c" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><b