<p data-start="5745" data-end="5773">This is the immediate focus.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="16s1dnt" data-start="5775" data-end="5788">Objective</h3>
<p data-start="5789" data-end="5894">Get the marketing site from “assembled and increasingly stable” to “cohesive, polished, and trustworthy.”</p>
<h3 data-section-id="77rc8c" data-start="5896" data-end="5905">Scope</h3>
<p data-start="5906" data-end="6022">Do <strong data-start="5909" data-end="5916">not</strong> redesign.<br data-start="5926" data-end="5929">
Do <strong data-start="5932" data-end="5939">not</strong> touch locked contracts.<br data-start="5963" data-end="5966">
Do <strong data-start="5969" data-end="5976">not</strong> broaden scope into internal or microservices.</p>
