</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1rdjbd8" data-start="6327" data-end="6671">
<p data-start="6330" data-end="6368"><strong data-start="6330" data-end="6361">Desktop-first visual polish</strong><br>
On:</p>
<ul data-start="6372" data-end="6444">
