ents-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#e04414" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span><p class="line-clamp-3">You are no longer blocked by architecture or UX strategy — you are blocked by **one lingering build-warning closure task** and then the **production imagery pass**.

