</li>
<li data-section-id="1gx1jcl" data-start="972" data-end="1104">
<p data-start="974" data-end="1104"><code data-start="974" data-end="985">About.tsx</code> still contains an external Unsplash image for the “How We Work”/expertise visual <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_37m_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/5a5789ff689084607bb574308db53fa3ffc02f32/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/About.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/5a5789ff689084607bb574308db53fa3ffc02f32/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/About.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">About</p></a></span></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1wkdzra" data-start="1107" data-end="1397">
<p data-start="1109" data-end="1397"><code data-start="1109" data-end="1127">PreviousWork.tsx</code> and marketing <code data-start="1142" data-end="1161">ProjectDetail.tsx</code> still render <code data-start="1175" data-end="1190">project.image</code> / <code data-start="1193" data-end="1211">project.images[]</code>, so the safest Phase 5 path is to replace the <strong data-start="1258" data-end="1289">data sources and asset URLs</strong>, not rewrite those components <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_37n_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/5a5789ff689084607bb574308db53fa3ffc02f32/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/PreviousWork.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/5a5789ff689084607bb574308db53fa3ffc02f32/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/PreviousWork.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">PreviousWork</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_37o_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/5a5789ff689084607bb574308db53fa3ffc02f32/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/ProjectDetail.tsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/5a5789ff689084607bb574308db53fa3ffc02f32/client/src/portals/marketing/pages/ProjectDetail.tsx" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">ProjectDetail</p></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-section-id="hg2hjw" data-start="1398" data-end="1716">
