<h1 data-section-id="b3zp3r" data-start="3393" data-end="3424">What this means in plan terms</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="1l59y4l" data-start="3426" data-end="3452">Phase 5 progress rating</h2>
<p data-start="3453" data-end="3489">I would now rate Phase 5 at roughly:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="hzldco" data-start="3491" data-end="3514"><span role="text"><strong data-start="3495" data-end="3514">60–70% complete</strong></span></h3>
<p data-start="3516" data-end="3686">Not because the code pass is weak.<br data-start="3550" data-end="3553">
Because this pass solved the <strong data-start="3582" data-end="3621">asset plumbing and source migration</strong>, but not yet the full <strong data-start="3644" data-end="3685">final approved-image curation problem</strong>.</p>
