<p data-start="4698" data-end="4795">The manifest entries I checked are still overwhelmingly marked <strong data-start="4761" data-end="4778"><code data-start="4763" data-end="4776">provisional</code></strong>, not <code data-start="4784" data-end="4794">approved</code>:</p>
<ul data-start="4796" data-end="4922">
<li data-section-id="3smc64" data-start="4796" data-end="4822">
