<p data-start="5224" data-end="5299">So the team section is technically cleaned up, but not creatively finished.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="161v1vm" data-start="5301" data-end="5340">3. Blog imagery is still provisional</h2>
<p data-start="5341" data-end="5542">The blog asset entries are local and clean, but still provisional, which means the content system is ready while the editorial visual curation still needs a pass <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_390_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/chillin_v2/shared/marketing-asset-manifest.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/chillin_v2/shared/marketing-asset-manifest.ts" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">marketing-asset-manifest</p></a></span></p>
<h2 data-section-id="1yvx1tg" data-start="5544" data-end="5608">4. Project imagery is safer, but not yet “final pack” quality</h2>
<p data-start="5609" data-end="5858">The six priority projects now have local project image slots and multiple images, but the manifest’s own <code data-start="5714" data-end="5726">sourceNote</code> says these are provisional local images pending the final approved project photography pack <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_391_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/chillin_v2/shared/marketing-asset-manifest.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/chillin_v2/shared/marketing-asset-manifest.ts" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">marketing-asset-manifest</p></a></span></p>
<p data-start="5860" data-end="5893">That is the exact remaining work.</p>
<hr data-start="5895" data-end="5898">
<h1 data-section-id="1r52xbq" data-start="5900" data-end="5940">My honest read of Codex’s Phase 5 pass</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="abivt" data-start="5942" data-end="5975">What Codex really accomplished</h2>
<p data-start="5976" data-end="6034">Codex completed the <strong data-start="5996" data-end="6033">hard part of the system migration</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="6035" data-end="6195">
<li data-section-id="bsvinu" data-start="6035" data-end="6065">
<p data-start="6037" data-end="6065">centralized asset management</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="hw6klw" data-start="6066" data-end="6088">
<p data-start="6068" data-end="6088">safer image sourcing</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="uggn9v" data-start="6089" data-end="6112">
<p data-start="6091" data-end="6112">public-route coverage</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="zeiiqb" data-start="6113" data-end="6146">
<p data-start="6115" data-end="6146">contract-safe value replacement</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="hipqsq" data-start="6147" data-end="6195">
<p data-start="6149" data-end="6195">removal of active stock/generated dependencies</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="6197" data-end="6222">That is a very good pass.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="pl6fdp" data-start="6224" data-end="6256">What Codex did not yet finish</h2>
<p data-start="6257" data-end="6324">Codex did <strong data-start="6267" data-end="6274">not</strong> finish the full editorial/design side of Phase 5:</p>
<ul data-start="6325" data-end="6481">
<li data-section-id="9m9cnu" data-start="6325" data-end="6366">
<p data-start="6327" data-end="6366">final approved project photography pack</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="m4hcqx" data-start="6367" data-end="6398">
<p data-start="6369" data-end="6398">final approved team headshots</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="18pl1w4" data-start="6399" data-end="6422">
<p data-start="6401" data-end="6422">final blog visual set</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1nvifp9" data-start="6423" data-end="6481">
<p data-start="6425" data-end="6481">final status transition from <code data-start="6454" data-end="6467">provisional</code> to <code data-start="6471" data-end="6481">approved</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="6483" data-end="6620">That is not a criticism. It just means the phase now needs a <strong data-start="6544" data-end="6586">curation / approval / replacement pass</strong>, not another infrastructure pass.</p>
<hr data-start="6622" data-end="6625">
<h1 data-section-id="42jgvr" data-start="6627" data-end="6664">What I would call the next subphase</h1>
<p data-start="6666" data-end="6703">I would label the next Codex task as:</p>
<h2 data-section-id="8f4fuc" data-start="6705" data-end="6761"><span role="text"><strong data-start="6708" data-end="6761">Phase 5B — provisional-to-approved asset curation</strong></span></h2>
<p data-start="6763" data-end="6825">That is cleaner than calling the whole phase done or not done.</p>
<hr data-start="6827" data-end="6830">
<h1 data-section-id="s3c09f" data-start="6832" data-end="6861">Recommended next Codex step</h1>
<p data-start="6863" data-end="6959">The next Codex pass should <strong data-start="6890" data-end="6897">not</strong> keep working on the asset system itself unless a bug appears.</p>
<p data-start="6961" data-end="6987">It should do this instead:</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1xvwx4w" data-start="6989" data-end="6996">Goal</h2>
<p data-start="6997" data-end="7119">Convert as many <code data-start="7013" data-end="7026">provisional</code> assets as possible into <code data-start="7051" data-end="7061">approved</code> assets, prioritizing the routes that shape trust fastest.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1rew3rt" data-start="7121" data-end="7138">Priority order</h2>
<ol data-start="7139" data-end="7224">
<li data-section-id="ac95p8" data-start="7139" data-end="7166">
<p data-start="7142" data-end="7166">homepage + featured work</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1zjcb" data-start="7167" data-end="7202">
<p data-start="7170" data-end="7202">project gallery + project detail</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="yrw5ev" data-start="7203" data-end="7216">
<p data-start="7206" data-end="7216">about/team</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1mto7i1" data-start="7217" data-end="7224">
<p data-start="7220" data-end="7224">blog</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h2 data-section-id="1o3z78" data-start="7226" data-end="7244">Specific target</h2>
<p data-start="7245" data-end="7279">For each provisional asset family:</p>
<ul data-start="7280" data-end="7515">
<li data-section-id="6vs2nx" data-start="7280" data-end="7328">
<p data-start="7282" data-end="7328">replace with the best available approved asset</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1e22w8w" data-start="7329" data-end="7386">
<p data-start="7331" data-end="7386">update manifest status from <code data-start="7359" data-end="7372">provisional</code> to <code data-start="7376" data-end="7386">approved</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="14piiq8" data-start="7387" data-end="7416">
<p data-start="7389" data-end="7416">tighten alt/caption quality</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1v0nn7m" data-start="7417" data-end="7466">
<p data-start="7419" data-end="7466">verify crops and aspect ratios still look right</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="12rp6yc" data-start="7467" data-end="7515">
<p data-start="7469" data-end="7515">preserve existing route behavior and contracts</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="7517" data-end="7520">
<h1 data-section-id="te74ok" data-start="7522" data-end="7549">My current status verdict</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="1er94ie" data-start="7551" data-end="7567">Ahead of plan</h2>
<ul data-start="7568" data-end="7706">
<li data-section-id="1b3tqrh" data-start="7568" data-end="7595">
<p data-start="7570" data-end="7595">asset-source architecture</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1luakkt" data-start="7596" data-end="7627">
<p data-start="7598" data-end="7627">contract-safe image migration</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1tpkdmg" data-start="7628" data-end="7658">
<p data-start="7630" data-end="7658">generated-image deactivation</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="a1l5y7" data-start="7659" data-end="7683">
<p data-start="7661" data-end="7683">external-image cleanup</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1h1sm78" data-start="7684" data-end="7706">
<p data-start="7686" data-end="7706">route-level coverage</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="iot88n" data-start="7708" data-end="7718">On plan</h2>
<ul data-start="7719" data-end="7796">
<li data-section-id="10ry48p" data-start="7719" data-end="7743">
<p data-start="7721" data-end="7743">project-proof backbone</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1elzzux" data-start="7744" data-end="7765">
<p data-start="7746" data-end="7765">manifest governance</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ae67g4" data-start="7766" data-end="7796">
<p data-start="7768" data-end="7796">public asset folder strategy</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="8hl8u2" data-start="7798" data-end="7812">Behind plan</h2>
<ul data-start="7813" data-end="7929">
<li data-section-id="y9ssmp" data-start="7813" data-end="7844">
<p data-start="7815" data-end="7844">final approved image curation</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1nm253k" data-start="7845" data-end="7868">
<p data-start="7847" data-end="7868">team headshot quality</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1qz6bdj" data-start="7869" data-end="7890">
<p data-start="7871" data-end="7890">blog visual quality</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="3kjdqv" data-start="7891" data-end="7929">
<p data-start="7893" data-end="7929">full “publishable” finish on imagery</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="7931" data-end="7934">
<h1 data-section-id="1tn553i" data-start="7936" data-end="7951">Short version</h1>
<p data-start="7953" data-end="8048">This is <strong data-start="7961" data-end="7987">not just the beginning</strong> of Phase 5.<br data-start="7999" data-end="8002">
It is a <strong data-start="8010" data-end="8036">legitimate major chunk</strong> of Phase 5.</p>
<p data-start="8050" data-end="8065">More precisely:</p>
<ul data-start="8067" data-end="8177">
<li data-section-id="1ydw7lt" data-start="8067" data-end="8103">
<p data-start="8069" data-end="8103"><strong data-start="8069" data-end="8098">Phase 5 system migration:</strong> done</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="op97cf" data-start="8104" data-end="8177">
<p data-start="8106" data-end="8177"><strong data-start="8106" data-end="8152">Phase 5 production-quality asset curation:</strong> still needs another pass</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="8179" data-end="8324" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">If you want, I can now write the <strong data-start="8212" data-end="8236">Phase 5B Codex brief</strong> specifically for turning the provisional local assets into approved route-ready assets.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="relative h-[60px] select-none"><div class="absolute h-[60px]" style="opacity: 1;"><button class="not-prose group/footnote border-token-border-default bg-token-main-surface-primary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 mt-3 mb-2 flex w-fit items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border py-2 ps-3 pe-2.5"><div class="flex flex-row-reverse gap-1"><div class="border-token-main-surface-primary bg-token-main-surface-primary flex items-center overflow-hidden group-hover/footnote:border-token-main-surface-secondary relative" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="icon-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></div></div></div><div class="text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-xs font-semibold">Sources</div></button></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]: