idth) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="user" data-message-id="c764b640-31eb-4a5f-8e07-a4f66bad1a9b" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden items-end rtl:items-start"><div class="user-message-bubble-color corner-superellipse/0.98 relative rounded-[22px] px-4 py-2.5 leading-6 max-w-(--user-chat-width,70%)"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap">I'd rather perform phase 5 with the assistance of gemini and nano-banana . 

Prepare me a handoff plan to give gemini that will accompany my introductory brief and the zipped folder of our current codebase that I am giving it. 

along with the handoff plan, reproduce the 6 phase plan and detailed completion percentages and required next steps for each phase of the 6 that is not complete - so that gemini has full context. 

this is the introductory message I am opening the session with, and intend to attach your brief and prompt to it as well:

I want you to unzip the attached .zip folder, then read in all files to get an understanding of our codebase including tracked and untracked files. The github repo for this is https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath.git and the branch that this codebase is on is chillin_v2 . 



We already have a live version of the marketing site at pacificengineeringsf.com , which we're considering more of a rough draft. 



We are focused first on finalizing the marketing site first so that it can be relaunched, then we will launch the internal portal (internal.pacificengineeringsf.com) and client portal  (portal.pacificengineeringsf.com) . 



