<ul data-start="12310" data-end="12696">
<li data-section-id="dbncdj" data-start="12310" data-end="12400">
<p data-start="12312" data-end="12400">many assets remain <code data-start="12331" data-end="12344">provisional</code>, not <code data-start="12350" data-end="12360">approved</code> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_39u_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/chillin_v2/shared/marketing-asset-manifest.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/chillin_v2/shared/marketing-asset-manifest.ts" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">marketing-asset-manifest</p></a></span></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="t9b39u" data-start="12401" data-end="12452">
<p data-start="12403" data-end="12452">team imagery still needs final approved headshots</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="13rgqp9" data-start="12453" data-end="12507">
<p data-start="12455" data-end="12507">blog imagery still needs stronger editorial curation</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="zplhyb" data-start="12508" data-end="12608">
<p data-start="12510" data-end="12608">project imagery still needs a final approved-quality pass rather than just local-safe placeholders</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="j8ddmq" data-start="12609" data-end="12696">
<p data-start="12611" data-end="12696">the route system is cleaner, but not yet fully “publishable photography pack” quality</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="17zg7ex" data-start="12698" data-end="12721">Required next steps</h3>
<ol data-start="12722" data-end="13106">
<li data-section-id="10d79iv" data-start="12722" data-end="12779">
<p data-start="12725" data-end="12779">review current local/provisional assets route-by-route</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="3hdenk" data-start="12780" data-end="12845">
<p data-start="12783" data-end="12845">prioritize homepage, project gallery, and project detail first</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="fiwqa" data-start="12846" data-end="12929">
<p data-start="12849" data-end="12929">replace the weakest provisional assets with the best approved available material</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="a3g5v8" data-start="12930" data-end="13004">
<p data-start="12933" data-end="13004">upgrade manifest statuses from <code data-start="12964" data-end="12977">provisional</code> to <code data-start="12981" data-end="12991">approved</code> where earned</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="l009qs" data-start="13005" data-end="13043">
<p data-start="13008" data-end="13043">tighten alt/caption/source metadata</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="xj98ak" data-start="13044" data-end="13106">
<p data-start="13047" data-end="13106">rerun route sweeps for broken images and visual consistency</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-section-id="r4bgh0" data-start="13108" data-end="13128">Current subphase</h3>
<p data-start="13129" data-end="13207">This is the active work:<br>
<strong data-start="13154" data-end="13207">Phase 5B — provisional-to-approved asset curation</strong></p>
<hr data-start="13209" data-end="13212">
<h2 data-section-id="171aftp" data-start="13214" data-end="13247">Phase 6 — Final republish gate</h2>
<p data-start="13248" data-end="13270"><strong data-start="13248" data-end="13270">Completion: 10–15%</strong></p>
