<hr data-start="14303" data-end="14306">
<h1 data-section-id="1slu6im" data-start="14308" data-end="14371">4. Short “what Gemini should conclude if things go well” note</h1>
<p data-start="14373" data-end="14474">You can add this to the end of your handoff if you want Gemini to stay aligned with your actual goal.</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="14476" data-end="14921"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>The desired outcome of this review is not to restart design exploration.</span><br><span>It is to determine whether the current branch is:</span><br><span>1. one asset-curation pass away from Phase 6, or</span><br><span>2. already strong enough to move directly into the final republish gate.</span><br><br><span>Keep the review practical.</span><br><span>Focus on publishability, trust, and consistency.</span><br><span>The marketing site is the priority.</span><br><span>Internal portal scope comes back after marketing is relaunched.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
