</li>
<li data-section-id="1gnejtv" data-start="2667" data-end="2724">
<p data-start="2669" data-end="2724">no active external/Unsplash/<code data-start="2697" data-end="2706">@assets</code> marketing serving</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1dsy1ds" data-start="2725" data-end="2744">
<p data-start="2727" data-end="2744">route sweep clean</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="xzrqt6" data-start="2745" data-end="2840">
<p data-start="2747" data-end="2840">seam diff clean <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_3br_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/chillin_v2/docs/internal/phase5b-curation-note.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/chillin_v2/docs/internal/phase5b-curation-note.md" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">phase5b-curation-note</p></a></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_3bs_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/chillin_v2/docs/internal/phase5-image-inventory.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/chillin_v2/docs/internal/phase5-image-inventory.md" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">phase5-image-inventory</p></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2842" data-end="2875">That is enough to trust the pass.</p>
<hr data-start="2877" data-end="2880">
<h1 data-section-id="rdrsd2" data-start="2882" data-end="2908">What is still incomplete</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="1ps2qsr" data-start="2910" data-end="2928">1. Team imagery</h2>
<p data-start="2929" data-end="2979">This is the biggest obvious remaining visual debt.</p>
<p data-start="2981" data-end="3033">The manifest explicitly says team entries are still:</p>
<ul data-start="3034" data-end="3138">
<li data-section-id="1knxsfg" data-start="3034" data-end="3047">
<p data-start="3036" data-end="3047">provisional</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1fkl7mm" data-start="3048" data-end="3069">
<p data-start="3050" data-end="3069">logo-fallback-based</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="xpnlqy" data-start="3070" data-end="3138">
<p data-start="3072" data-end="3138">pending approved headshots <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_3bt_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/chillin_v2/shared/marketing-asset-manifest.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/chillin_v2/shared/marketing-asset-manifest.ts" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">marketing-asset-manifest</p></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3140" data-end="3251">So the team section may be structurally okay, but it is not yet carrying the same trust weight as the projects.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="kwai5v" data-start="3253" data-end="3271">2. Blog imagery</h2>
<p data-start="3272" data-end="3353">All three blog entries remain provisional <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_3bu_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/chillin_v2/shared/marketing-asset-manifest.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/chillin_v2/shared/marketing-asset-manifest.ts" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">marketing-asset-manifest</p></a></span></p>
<p data-start="3355" data-end="3456">This is less urgent than project proof, but it still matters if blog is part of the relaunch surface.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="2k09f6" data-start="3458" data-end="3515">3. Route imagery outside the approved project backbone</h2>
<p data-start="3516" data-end="3688">Your inventory shows most route hero/support imagery is still classified as production-safe local but not necessarily approved-final <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_3bv_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/chillin_v2/docs/internal/phase5-image-inventory.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/chillin_v2/docs/internal/phase5-image-inventory.md" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">phase5-image-inventory</p></a></span></p>
<p data-start="3690" data-end="3870">That is fine for now if those images are visually coherent. But it means “Phase 5 complete” depends on whether you want a <strong data-start="3812" data-end="3841">strict publishability bar</strong> or a <strong data-start="3847" data-end="3869">relaunch-ready bar</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="3872" data-end="3875">
<h1 data-section-id="7bry6z" data-start="3877" data-end="3896">My recommendation</h1>
<p data-start="3898" data-end="3934">You now have two defensible options.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="17jcyp7" data-start="3936" data-end="3996">Option A — call Phase 5 effectively complete for relaunch</h2>
<p data-start="3997" data-end="4008">Do this if:</p>
<ul data-start="4009" data-end="4278">
<li data-section-id="1k3o4yb" data-start="4009" data-end="4097">
<p data-start="4011" data-end="4097">homepage, gallery, project detail, and the major trust surfaces now look strong enough</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="slg64s" data-start="4098" data-end="4187">
<p data-start="4100" data-end="4187">you are okay carrying <strong data-start="4122" data-end="4130">team</strong> and <strong data-start="4135" data-end="4143">blog</strong> as explicitly deferred provisional families</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1d2wz4q" data-start="4188" data-end="4278">
<p data-start="4190" data-end="4278">the relaunch priority is marketing credibility first, not perfect editorial completeness</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4280" data-end="4305">If you choose this, then:</p>
<ul data-start="4306" data-end="4361">
<li data-section-id="1kqpvr6" data-start="4306" data-end="4338">
<p data-start="4308" data-end="4338">document team/blog as deferred</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1f10hvr" data-start="4339" data-end="4361">
<p data-start="4341" data-end="4361">proceed into Phase 6</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="h1elu" data-start="4363" data-end="4409">Option B — run one very small Phase 5C pass</h2>
<p data-start="4410" data-end="4421">Do this if:</p>
<ul data-start="4422" data-end="4584">
<li data-section-id="191wlw8" data-start="4422" data-end="4472">
<p data-start="4424" data-end="4472">the team section still visually weakens the site</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="b3579m" data-start="4473" data-end="4526">
<p data-start="4475" data-end="4526">the blog thumbnails/heroes still feel too temporary</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="xgku7x" data-start="4527" data-end="4584">
<p data-start="4529" data-end="4584">you want cleaner confidence before final republish gate</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4586" data-end="4637">If you choose this, the pass should be very narrow:</p>
<ul data-start="4638" data-end="4784">
<li data-section-id="12krqtz" data-start="4638" data-end="4692">
<p data-start="4640" data-end="4692">team headshot harmonization or improved placeholders</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="5ryt1j" data-start="4693" data-end="4720">
<p data-start="4695" data-end="4720">blog hero tightening only</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="qfmuob" data-start="4721" data-end="4784">
<p data-start="4723" data-end="4784">no further project/gallery work unless a clear defect appears</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="4786" data-end="4789">
<h1 data-section-id="13ps32v" data-start="4791" data-end="4811">My honest judgment</h1>
<p data-start="4813" data-end="4925">Given where you are and the fact that the six most important project-proof assets are now approved, I would say:</p>
<h2 data-section-id="qsiye" data-start="4927" data-end="4980">You are close enough to begin Phase 6 planning now</h2>
<p data-start="4982" data-end="5098">Not because Phase 5 is perfect.<br data-start="5013" data-end="5016">
Because the remaining debt is <strong data-start="5046" data-end="5072">contained and explicit</strong>, not broad and ambiguous.</p>
<p data-start="5100" data-end="5126">That is the key threshold.</p>
<hr data-start="5128" data-end="5131">
<h1 data-section-id="1gjf4ue" data-start="5133" data-end="5156">Recommended next step</h1>
<p data-start="5158" data-end="5174">I would do this:</p>
<ol data-start="5176" data-end="5482">
<li data-section-id="90ljrg" data-start="5176" data-end="5335">
<p data-start="5179" data-end="5207"><strong data-start="5179" data-end="5207">Do the Gemini review now</strong></p>
<ul data-start="5211" data-end="5335">
<li data-section-id="1421reh" data-start="5211" data-end="5253">
<p data-start="5213" data-end="5253">focused on team/blog provisional quality</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ega53k" data-start="5257" data-end="5335">
<p data-start="5259" data-end="5335">and on whether any route still feels visually weak enough to block republish</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-section-id="17gsmo" data-start="5337" data-end="5482">
<p data-start="5340" data-end="5356">Based on Gemini:</p>
<ul data-start="5360" data-end="5482">
<li data-section-id="r2b9q4" data-start="5360" data-end="5417">
<p data-start="5362" data-end="5417">if the team/blog debt looks acceptable, move to Phase 6</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="f0a1zy" data-start="5421" data-end="5482">
<p data-start="5423" data-end="5482">if not, run one tiny Phase 5C pass and then move to Phase 6</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="5484" data-end="5487">
<h1 data-section-id="d1fabk" data-start="5489" data-end="5523">Short status summary you can use</h1>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="5525" data-end="6266"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Phase 5B is a strong pass and materially advances the marketing site toward relaunch readiness.</span><br><br><span>What is now done:</span><br><span>- six Tier 1 proof-project asset families promoted from provisional to approved</span><br><span>- stronger alt/caption/provenance metadata added</span><br><span>- project gallery/project detail/home proof surfaces upgraded</span><br><span>- route coverage and source-policy validation clean</span><br><span>- public API shapes and internal seams preserved</span><br><br><span>What remains provisional:</span><br><span>- all six team entries</span><br><span>- all three blog entries</span><br><br><span>Current Phase 5 estimate:</span><br><span>- 85–90% complete</span><br><br><span>Recommendation:</span><br><span>- run Gemini review now focused on team/blog and any remaining weak route imagery</span><br><span>- then either proceed directly to Phase 6 or run one very small Phase 5C cleanup pass first</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="6268" data-end="6356" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">If you want, I can now write the <strong data-start="6301" data-end="6355">Gemini review prompt for this exact Phase 5B state</strong>.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="relative h-[60px] select-none"><div class="absolute h-[60px]" style="opacity: 1;"><button class="not-prose group/footnote border-token-border-default bg-token-main-surface-primary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 mt-3 mb-2 flex w-fit items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border py-2 ps-3 pe-2.5"><div class="flex flex-row-reverse gap-1"><div class="border-token-main-surface-primary bg-token-main-surface-primary flex items-center overflow-hidden group-hover/footnote:border-token-main-surface-secondary relative" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="icon-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></div></div></div><div class="text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-xs font-semibold">Sources</div></button></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="ma