n:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-tertiary flex items-center gap-0.5 dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary">Thought for 1m 36s<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-xs"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#b140e7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="7905a3db-d258-4759-9775-115310941395" data-turn-start-message="true" dir="auto" tabindex="0" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-4-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="114">Done on my side: I created the image file for you as <span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button">mark-waldman-01.jpg</button></span>.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="4vuz9l" data-start="116" data-end="141">What to do in the repo</h2>
<p data-start="142" data-end="163">Place that file here:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="165" data-end="222"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>client/public/images/team/mark-waldman-01.jpg</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="224" data-end="289">Then flip Mark’s manifest entry from <code data-start="261" data-end="274">provisional</code> to <code data-start="278" data-end="288">approved</code>.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1itw6ku" data-start="291" data-end="321">Recommended manifest update</h2>
<p data-start="322" data-end="446">Use the existing Mark entry key/id already in <code data-start="368" data-end="404">shared/marketing-asset-manifest.ts</code>, but make it look like this conceptually:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="448" data-end="807"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>TypeScript</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼv">image</span><span>: </span><span class="ͼr">"/images/team/mark-waldman-01.jpg"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼt">status</span><span>: </span><span class="ͼr">"approved"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼt">sourceNote</span><span>: </span><span class="ͼr">"Approved local headshot provided by Pacific Engineering leadership."</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼt">alt</span><span>: </span><span class="ͼr">"A. Mark Waldman, principal engineer and project manager at Pacific Engineering."</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼt">caption</span><span>: </span><span class="ͼr">"Principal engineer and project manager with decades of Bay Area engineering and construction experience."</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="809" data-end="862">I would <strong data-start="817" data-end="824">not</strong> change the shape of the object, only:</p>
<ul data-start="863" data-end="958">
<li data-section-id="1wu6sgv" data-start="863" data-end="891">
<p data-start="865" data-end="891">the <code data-start="869" data-end="876">image</code> path if needed</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1d3v9cs" data-start="892" data-end="902">
<p data-start="894" data-end="902"><code data-start="894" data-end="902">status</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="k34urp" data-start="903" data-end="917">
<p data-start="905" data-end="917"><code data-start="905" data-end="917">sourceNote</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1d8qt5u" data-start="918" data-end="958">
<p data-start="920" data-end="958">optionally tighten <code data-start="939" data-end="944">alt</code> and <code data-start="949" data-end="958">caption</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="960" data-end="1198">That keeps it aligned with the Phase 5B / 5C pattern where the remaining debt is concentrated in team/blog while the approved project-proof backbone stays locked. <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_3eg_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Pasted text</p></button></span> <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_3eh_" data-state="closed"><a href="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/chillin_v2/shared/marketing-asset-manifest.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://github.com/dylanlmeraki/last_breath/blob/chillin_v2/shared/marketing-asset-manifest.ts" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">marketing-asset-manifest</p></a></span></p>
<hr data-start="1200" data-end="1203">
<h2 data-section-id="4cwe7k" data-start="1205" data-end="1240">My read on your hero-image issue</h2>
<p data-start="1241" data-end="1258">I agree with you.</p>
<p data-start="1260" data-end="1301">This is now the next real visual problem:</p>
<ul data-start="1302" data-end="1445">
<li data-section-id="aolfdu" data-start="1302" data-end="1335">
<p data-start="1304" data-end="1335">the <strong data-start="1308" data-end="1335">infrastructure is there</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="hmhmc0" data-start="1336" data-end="1367">
<p data-start="1338" data-end="1367">the <strong data-start="1342" data-end="1367">architecture is there</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="18vhdk7" data-start="1368" data-end="1445">
<p data-start="1370" data-end="1445">but a lot of the <strong data-start="1387" data-end="1409">hero image choices</strong> are not carrying the brand properly</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1447" data-end="1608">That is different from the project-proof layer. The project-proof layer now sounds much healthier. The problem is that several <strong data-start="1574" data-end="1596">page hero surfaces</strong> still feel:</p>
<ul data-start="1609" data-end="1710">
<li data-section-id="1j37ap2" data-start="1609" data-end="1615">
<p data-start="1611" data-end="1615">lazy</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ju72ex" data-start="1616" data-end="1625">
<p data-start="1618" data-end="1625">generic</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1o2ai69" data-start="1626" data-end="1642">
<p data-start="1628" data-end="1642">under-directed</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="14ia633" data-start="1643" data-end="1710">
<p data-start="1645" data-end="1710">visually disconnected from the seriousness of Pacific Engineering</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1712" data-end="1895">That also lines up with Gemini’s conclusion that the remaining issues are no longer broad system issues, but concentrated visual/editorial debts. <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_3ei_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a066ed1a.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Pasted text</p></button></span></p>
<h2 data-section-id="1r1jfz" data-start="1897" data-end="1920">What I would do next</h2>
<p data-start="1921" data-end="2017">Before a full Phase 6 gate, I would insert a very small <strong data-start="1977" data-end="2016">Phase 5.5 / Hero Art Direction pass</strong>:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="77rc8c" data-start="2019" data-end="2028">Scope</h3>
<p data-start="2029" data-end="2057">Only touch hero surfaces on:</p>
<ul data-start="2058" data-end="2302">
<li data-section-id="1nmepwq" data-start="2058" data-end="2068">
<p data-start="2060" data-end="2068"><code data-start="2060" data-end="2068">/about</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1fbcgx3" data-start="2069" data-end="2081">
<p data-start="2071" data-end="2081"><code data-start="2071" data-end="2081">/contact</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="3veikp" data-start="2082" data-end="2095">
<p data-start="2084" data-end="2095"><code data-start="2084" data-end="2095">/services</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ez3jc7" data-start="2096" data-end="2118">
<p data-start="2098" data-end="2118"><code data-start="2098" data-end="2118">/services-overview</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1qnyigh" data-start="2119" data-end="2143">
<p data-start="2121" data-end="2143"><code data-start="2121" data-end="2143">/inspections-testing</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="8zk946" data-start="2144" data-end="2168">
<p data-start="2146" data-end="2168"><code data-start="2146" data-end="2168">/special-inspections</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1dynhq" data-start="2169" data-end="2196">
<p data-start="2171" data-end="2196"><code data-start="2171" data-end="2196">/structural-engineering</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1wdsxru" data-start="2197" data-end="2214">
<p data-start="2199" data-end="2214"><code data-start="2199" data-end="2214">/construction</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="f2pp0v" data-start="2215" data-end="2233">
<p data-start="2217" data-end="2233"><code data-start="2217" data-end="2233">/swppp-checker</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="bv8i92" data-start="2234" data-end="2251">
<p data-start="2236" data-end="2251"><code data-start="2236" data-end="2251">/consultation</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1o0wbia" data-start="2252" data-end="2302">
<p data-start="2254" data-end="2302">optionally <code data-start="2265" data-end="2272">/blog</code> if it still reads too generic</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="yn9hlv" data-start="2304" data-end="2312">Goal</h3>
<p data-start="2313" data-end="2358">Do <strong data-start="2316" data-end="2323">not</strong> redesign the layout.<br>
Just improve:</p>
<ul data-start="2359" data-end="2499">
<li data-section-id="gv0bkv" data-start="2359" data-end="2381">
<p data-start="2361" data-end="2381">hero image selection</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="gcgbht" data-start="2382" data-end="2399">
<p data-start="2384" data-end="2399">hero image crop</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1drx4qu" data-start="2400" data-end="2424">
<p data-start="2402" data-end="2424">hero overlay treatment</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="wc6qh7" data-start="2425" data-end="2450">
<p data-start="2427" data-end="2450">hero text/image balance</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="iy2302" data-start="2451" data-end="2478">
<p data-start="2453" data-end="2478">color/contrast discipline</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="gu6shf" data-start="2479" data-end="2499">
<p data-start="2481" data-end="2499">visual seriousness</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="ynovjc" data-start="2501" data-end="2509">Rule</h3>
<p data-start="2510" data-end="2538">Use hero imagery that feels:</p>
<ul data-start="2539" data-end="2619">
<li data-section-id="1b3z31e" data-start="2539" data-end="2557">
<p data-start="2541" data-end="2557">project-adjacent</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="slv8qj" data-start="2558" data-end="2569">
<p data-start="2560" data-end="2569">technical</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1yj2ybg" data-start="2570" data-end="2583">
<p data-start="2572" data-end="2583">desaturated</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="appggc" data-start="2584" data-end="2594">
<p data-start="2586" data-end="2594">grounded</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="6tikez" data-start="2595" data-end="2619">
<p data-start="2597" data-end="2619">compositionally strong</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2621" data-end="2627">Avoid:</p>
<ul data-start="2628" data-end="2788">
<li data-section-id="1n6hyp6" data-start="2628" data-end="2642">
<p data-start="2630" data-end="2642">stock energy</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="7v986b" data-start="2643" data-end="2665">
<p data-start="2645" data-end="2665">obvious placeholders</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1oggqjd" data-start="2666" data-end="2738">
<p data-start="2668" data-end="2738">“background wallpaper” images with no relationship to the page subject</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="g79wb4" data-start="2739" data-end="2788">
<p data-start="2741" data-end="2788">lazy full-bleed image choices that reduce trust</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2790" data-end="2793">
<h2 data-section-id="1v6wwkz" data-start="2795" data-end="2812">Best next move</h2>
<ol data-start="2813" data-end="2975">
<li data-section-id="q642h8" data-start="2813" data-end="2884">
<p data-start="2816" data-end="2884">Drop in <span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button">mark-waldman-01.jpg</button></span></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="q9tz2n" data-start="2885" data-end="2911">
<p data-start="2888" data-end="2911">Flip Mark to <code data-start="2901" data-end="2911">approved</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1lphm4h" data-start="2912" data-end="2953">
<p data-start="2915" data-end="2953">Run one narrow hero-art-direction pass</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ozv4v6" data-start="2954" data-end="2975">
<p data-start="2957" data-end="2975">Then go to Phase 6</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="2977" data-end="3103">If you want, I’ll write that next pass as a <strong data-start="3021" data-end="3052">Codex Hero Refinement Brief</strong> so you can feed it directly into the next session.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div class="relative h-[60px] select-none"><div class="absolute h-[60px]" style="opacity: 1;"><button class="not-prose group/footnote border-token-border-default bg-token-main-surface-primary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 mt-3 mb-2 flex w-fit items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border py-2 ps-3 pe-2.5"><div class="flex flex-row-reverse gap-1"><div class="border-token-main-surface-primary bg-token-main-surface-primary flex items-center overflow-hidden group-hover/footnote:border-token-main-surface-secondary relative" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="icon-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-external-a5a181b2.svg#1a6f23" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></div></div></div><div class="text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-xs font-semibold">Sources</div></button></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center 